    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Fierce Tiger Warriors Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-08-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Agil, and Silica are dressed as mighty warriors with tiger-like fury in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe Fierce Tiger Warriors Order is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Fierce Tiger Strike] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nExtension/Engrave\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Extension 1] Attack rises 6% x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Engrave] When equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Graceful Predator] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Earth Burst\nSkill Name\nCross Earth\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n43\nBreak Gauge\n86\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Earth element's damage rises by the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set x 10%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Alice Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Full Burst state/[Bonus] Critical rate +500%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Tiger's Mighty Axe] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShining Launcher\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Blunt 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dragon & Tiger Pincer] Silica\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSand Cutter Burst\nSkill Name\nSand Cutter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] Make it Poison (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Alice Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Earth 4/Buff] Earth element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Dragon & Tiger Pincer] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - Before September 9, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
