    "news_date": 1785916800,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "낚시 랭킹 이벤트 \"2026 한여름 낚시대회\"가 진행중입니다. '2026 한여름 낚시 대회'에서는 어획량 점수에 따라 최고 순위를 놓고 경쟁합니다.  사용자 제출 중에서 선택한 Bubbly Bonito와 Lace Wraith가 이 이벤트 맵에 등장합니다! 그들을 잡아서 높은 점수를 얻으세요!  부...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nFishing Ranking Event, \"2026 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2026-08-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFishing Ranking Event \"2026 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2026 Midsummer Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nThe Bubbly Bonito and Lace Wraith, selected from user submissions, appear on this Event Map!\nCatch them to get a\nhigh score\n!\nBubbly Bonito: A refreshing fish that fizzes when caught. Its sky blue body quenches both heart and thirst.\nLace Wraith: A jellyfish resembling a lace veil. It drifts gently through the deep sea like a ghost.\nEvent Period\nEvent Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\" Period: Starts after the August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2026 Midsummer Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nParticipation Requirements\nYou can move to the Event Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\"\nafter completing the 1F main quest\n.\nThere are no special requirements to fish itself, but you will be unable to enter the Event Maps without finishing the quest above.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition Records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, up to 1\nCore Metal\n, and up to 4\nRelease Crystals (L)\n, as well as other items, at the 2026 Midsummer Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\n2026 Midsummer Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nMS Fishing King 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nMS Fishing Elite 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nMS Fishing Mania 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nThere are 4 locations in total, with day and night versions of the Event Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\".\nHead to the day beach by talking to the \"Beach Guide\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza. (Available after completing the 1F main quest.)\nMove to the night beach by talking to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC at the day beach.\nMove on board the boat by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the beach (day or night).\nMove between the day and night boat via the \"Night Map Guide\" / \"Day Map Guide\" NPCs on board.\nEvent Map\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nBeach (Day)\n1～10\nOn Board (Day)\n11～15\nBeach (Night)\n16～20\nOn Board (Night)\n21～\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:MS Fishing King 2026\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Elite 2026\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:MS Fishing Elite 2026\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking Reward Distribution Period: August 14, 2026 (Fri) 14:00 (JST/UTC+9) to the start of the August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nImportant\nThe item with your Record will be hidden on September 2, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9), and deleted on September 9, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nUnlike the Record items, Bubbly Bonito and Lace Wraith will NOT be removed after the event ends — you may keep them as regular fishing items.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-08-04T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-08-26T19:00:00+00:00"
