    "full_details": "Notices\nHigh difficulty \"Chaos Showdown\" updated! Get your hands on the powerful Dark Black Series armor!\nEVENT\n2026-08-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"Chaos Showdown\", has been updated!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nDungeon Duration\nAfter August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - before August 19, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nBloody Eyes Chaos\nDetails\nThis battle takes place in a Crystal Nullification Zone, so some items cannot be used.\nWhen battle starts, it will use a Critical Resistance buff.\nIt is breakable with One-handed Sword skills. During the battle, the Break requirements change and it becomes breakable with Dagger skills.\nWhen a Break or Skill Break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nOnly Sword Skills that are both Slash Element and Earth Element can reduce the Skill Break gauge.\nWhen preparing its Skill Breakable attack, it receives a buff that reduces the damage it takes.\nSome attacks will reduce the Awakening gauge.\nIt removes all debuffs during battle.\nCounter switch available.\nReflection available.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will activate the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nResistance\nCritical rate resistance\nDamage cut\nNon-weakness weapon element resistance\nNon-weakness natural element resistance\nBuffs used\n\"Critical Resistance\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\n\"Stack-type Damage Reduction\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Sleep\", \"Weakness\" and \"Deadly Poison\"\nDebuffs \"Non-elemental Damage Reduction\", \"Item Seal\" and \"CT Increase\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects. During the battle, the Break requirements change and it becomes breakable only with Dagger skills. Each Break or Skill Break applies a stackable debuff that increases damage dealt to the boss.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChallenge with party\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nBlunt Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nSlash Element\n・\nDark Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Asura\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Warden\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black White Wyrm\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nOK\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Land Devourer\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 255\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nSky Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 275\nDark Black Metal Reaper\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nDeep Emerald Chaos Crystal\nNO\nChaos Showdown 295\nDark Black Bloody Eyes\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nDeep Amethyst Chaos Crystal\nNO\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense (Max)\nHP Bonus (Max)\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Asura Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Asura Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Warden Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Warden Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Land Devourer Armor\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Land Devourer Greaves\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox Armor\n1878\n34500\nLv.255\nDark Black Nine-tailed Fox Greaves\n1540\n20403\nLv.255\nDark Black Metal Reaper Armor\n1985\n37150\nLv.275\nDark Black Metal Reaper Greaves\n1628\n21553\nLv.275\nDark Black Bloody Eyes Armor[NEW!]\n2093\n39850\nLv.295\nDark Black Bloody Eyes Greaves[NEW!]\n1716\n22753\nLv.295\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 295 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n120\n50\nHP\n2500\n6000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Bloody Eyes Armor, defense will increase by 360 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
