    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 '오퍼레이션: 여름의 추억' 개최 중!  사샤는 고아원 아이들에게 여름방학을 경험할 수 있는 기회를 주기 위해 여행을 계획했습니다. 아이들과 함께 낚시, 벌레 잡기, 숨바꼭질 놀이 등으로 모두가 여름의 즐거움을 되새깁니다. 예전 여름처럼…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Operation: Summer Memories\" is on now! Get the ★4 Sasha Skill Record, limited-edition stamps, and more!\nEVENT\n2026-07-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Operation: Summer Memories\" is on now!\nSasha organized a trip to give the orphanage children a chance to experience summer vacation.\nTogether with the children, everyone relives the joys of summer by fishing, catching bugs, and playing hide-and-seek, just like the summers they once experienced in the real world.\nBut just as the children eagerly await the evening campfire, an unexpected disaster strikes!?\nThis event also marks the debut of the new event map, Lake Nostalgia!\nEnjoy the lakeside scenery as it changes between day and night!\nRewards\nGet the event-only Skill Record ★4 [Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha and the limited-edition chat stamp \"Let's Go Again!\"\nGet up to 1000 \"Arcana Gems\", up to 100 \"Awakening Stars\", up to 25 \"Medals of Combat Arts\", and up to 300 \"Memoria Niter S\" from the event.\nYou can also get various Awakening Jewels (Great Red/Green/Yellow/Blue, ×20 each) and Release Crystal (L).\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on DANGER difficulty and above!\nSkill Record\n★4[Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper / Enhance Debility Res.\nAttack\n31\nDefense\n26\nHP\n2000\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 3] Attack +300./●[Enhance Debility Res. 3] Debility resistance +30%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nLet's Go Again!\nMemory Stamp (Trader)\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nHomemade Smoked Cheese\nA cheese packed with unique aroma and flavor.\nPlayer's attack +7% for 3 min.\nRoasted Marshmallow\nA perfectly toasted marshmallow.\nInstantly recover 1000 HP and status ailment.\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Blue Nostalgic Lure\" and \"White Nostalgic Lure\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\nThis time, both tokens drop on all difficulty levels.\n\"White Nostalgic Lure\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on August 13, 2026 (Thu).\nTrade \"Blue Nostalgic Lure\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\n★4[Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha\n400\n1\nRoasted Marshmallow\n50\n3\nHomemade Smoked Cheese\n50\n3\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"White Nostalgic Lure\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha\n400\n1\nRoasted Marshmallow\n50\n3\nHomemade Smoked Cheese\n50\n3\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", and \"Unknown\" difficulties all count toward the \"Total Score Reward\".\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nUnknown\nBasic Clear Bonus:11000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n11120\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher (can be cleared once per day)\nUnknown: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×600\n★4[Fieldwork Awaits] Sasha×7\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nMemoria Niter S×120\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nNostalgic Scenery\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Blue Nostalgic Lures in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nSummer Fun Expert\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Blue Nostalgic Lures in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHero of the Children\nLet's collect a total of 2000 White Nostalgic Lures in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Period\nStarts after the July 29, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\n* A high-difficulty dungeon is planned to be added. Details will be announced at a later date.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the July 29, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 2, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nMake your way to Lake Nostalgia by first speaking to the Lake Nostalgia Guide NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza in the Town of Beginnings.\nOnce at Lake Nostalgia, speak to the Event Guide NPC to get the scenario quests rolling.\nComplete all 5 scenario quests to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nSly The Smurfingryphon\nDetails\nBreaks can be performed with Thrust Element skills.\nWhen a Break happens, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all its buffs will be removed.\nIn addition, when a Break happens, it will receive a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nOn DANGER difficulty and above, the enemy uses the Chaos Recollection buff.\nOn Unknown difficulty, it uses an Item Seal debuff.\nWeakness\nExcept Exile\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nExile\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nResistance\nUnknown\nWeapon Element Resistance　Nature Element Resistance\nCritical Resistance　Damage Taken\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Petrify\", \"Old Grudge\", \"Fatal Poison\"\nDebuff \"Decrease Non-Elemental Damage\", \"Seal item\"\n* Break: By completely lowering the Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments,\" please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments.\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Blue Nostalgic Lure\", \"White Nostalgic Lure\", \"Homemade Smoked Cheese\" and \"Roasted Marshmallow\" will be deleted on September 2, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-07-28T19:00:00+00:00",
