    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Memories of a Summer Night Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-07-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Koharu, Sanya, and Asuna are enjoying the most memorable summer night in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe Memories of a Summer Night Order is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Flames of a Summer Night] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Slay\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Slash Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where slash elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Fire element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Fire element damage +50%\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Around the Campfire] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShade Shaft\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 4/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +25% for 10 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Dark element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Attack +100% against debuffed enemies.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweet Aroma in the Silence] Sanya\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Hidden Blessing/Halo/Dark Invitation\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 5] Attack +1200./[Hidden Blessing 3] Attack +15%, and non-natural elemental damage -100%./[Halo 3] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the hit rate -30%\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Dark Invitation 2] Deals +10% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Unexpected Heat] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nShade Torrent Burst\nSkill Name\nShade Torrent\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Thrust→\nDark\n→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n92\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Shadow 4/Buff]Dark element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Flames of a Summer Night] Yuuki\", \"[Unexpected Heat] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter July 23, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - Before August 19, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
