    "full_details": "Notices\nAvatars with swimsuits based off of the scenario event are here! \"Summer Beach Attire Avatars Order\" is now underway!\nShop\n2026-07-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA lineup of avatars with swimsuits based off of the scenario event Heat the Beach! Summer Swimsuit Spectacular!\nThe \"\nSummer Beach Attire Avatars Order\n\", now underway!\nPlease note that all the Avatars included in this Order are\nfemale\n!\n【Avatar Images】\n【Appearing Avatar】\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nSummer Beach Dress Top A\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top B\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top C\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top D\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top E\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top F\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top G\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Top H\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms B\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms C\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms D\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms E\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms F\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms G\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Dress Bottoms H\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Headband\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Ribbon\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Hat\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nSummer Beach Hairband\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\n- Duration\nAfter July 23, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - Before August 27, 2026 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nAll of the Avatars included in this Order are female.\nThis means that you will receive female avatars, regardless of the gender of the character you are currently using.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nFaces and hairstyles are not included in this Order.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
