    "full_details": "Notices\nJune 21 is Rain's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJune 21 is Rain's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Rain's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\n* There are some events and Orders that have yet to begin at the time of this announcement's posting.\nRain's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Rain!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nRain's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nJune 21, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - June 30, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Rain have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nJune 21, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - June 30, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Rain's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until June 21, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nMemory Stamp Gift\nA free Memory Stamp is being sent out to celebrate Rain's birthday! This item will be delivered to your \"Gifts\" when you log in during the time period.\nPeriod of Availability\nJune 21, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - June 30, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
