    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/10)\nMAINT.\n2026-06-10 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/10, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 6/10, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼New Events\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Golden Colossus Hunt\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nEchoes of Aincrad Launch Celebration Event: Resonating Together!\nThe 72nd \"Guild of Guilds\"\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n6/10, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Golden Colossus Hunt\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nEchoes of Aincrad Launch Celebration Event: Resonating Together!\nThe 72nd \"Guild of Guilds\"\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 6/10 Maintenance\nThe 16th Squad Jumble\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Silica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\"\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
