    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] Free 11x Every Day! \"Holiday Campaign Free Order\" is on now!\nShop\n2026-06-08 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nFree 11x Every Day! \"\nHoliday Campaign Free Order\n\" is here! Get up to 253 Skill Records!\nDuring this campaign, players will receive one free 11x Order per day up to 23 times (23 days total).\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Celebration Begins] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAqua Indiscreet\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Aqua Force 4/Buff] Water element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Sleep Res. 4/Buff] Sleep resist +80% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Water element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Royal Star] Alice\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Prosper/Earth Accumulation\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Earth Accumulation 3] Earth element's damage rises by the number of Klein Skill Records in the same set x 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[The All-Reaping Blade] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurrowing Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2110% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Period\nJune 8, 2026 (Mon) 4:00 - September 1, 2026 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
