    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Argo\" is here! Get the Argo stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2026-06-05 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Argo\" is here! Get the Argo stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Argo\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\".\nPeriod\nJune 5, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - June 12, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nHigh-Speed Floater\nMemory Stamp 393\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 393\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Argo as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
