    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 '서프라이즈 웨딩'이 돌아왔습니다!  이번 이벤트는 이전 진행 내용을 다음과 같이 이어갑니다. ・퀘스트 진행 및 보상 ・총점 및 점수 보상 ・챌린지 보상 ・거래량 ・업적 및 성취 진행 서프라이즈 웨딩 6월의 생일을 맞이합니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Surprise Wedding\" is back! Get a Bridal Avatar!\nEVENT\n2026-06-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Surprise Wedding\" is back!\nThis event will carry over the following progress from the previous run:\n・Quest progression and rewards\n・Total Score and Score Rewards\n・Challenge rewards\n・Amount traded\n・Achievements and achievement progress\nSurprise Wedding\nWe're celebrating June brides with a wedding-themed scenario quest.\nClear this scenario quest with the women of SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor!\nRewards\nGet Arcana Gems and\nLimited-edition Stamps\nfrom Quest Rewards.\nCombined with the Score Rewards, you can get up to 500 \"Arcana Gems\".\nCollect \"Blooming Bouquets\" from Rewards and monster drops and exchange them for Bridal Avatars or useful items to enhance or transform equipment.\nAvatar Images\nMemory Stamp\nLimited-edition Stamps are back.\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAwww\nHappy\nCrush on me?\nYay!\nTrade \"Blooming Bouquet\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nBridal Dress（Female Only）\n800\n2\nBridal Tuxedo（Male Only）\n800\n1\nBridal Pin（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Bracelet（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Tiara（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Necklace（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nRefining Hammer+\n50\n80\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Blooming Bouquet\" banner.\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nYou can clear the\n\"Special\"\n3 times per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n300\nBlooming Bouquet\n5\n400\nBlooming Bouquet\n10\n600\nRecord Frame M\n10\n800\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1200\nBlooming Bouquet\n10\n1600\nBlooming Bouquet\n15\n2100\nRestorative Potion\n20\n2800\nRestorative Potion\n30\n3000\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n4000\nBlooming Bouquet\n25\n3900\nCleansing Potion\n5\n5200\nCleansing Potion\n10\n5400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n7200\nRecord Frame M\n30\n6600\nBlooming Bouquet\n30\n8800\nBlooming Bouquet\n35\n7800\nArcana Gems\n50\n10400\nArcana Gems\n50\n9000\nRevive Crystal\n1\n12000\nRevive Crystal\n2\nー\nー\nー\n14000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n500\nBlooming Bouquet\n15\n600\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame L\n15\n2000\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n2400\nBlooming Bouquet\n30\n3500\nRestorative Potion\n40\n4200\nRestorative Potion\n50\n5000\nArcana Gems\n50\n6000\nArcana Gems\n50\n6500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\n7800\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10800\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11000\nBlooming Bouquet\n40\n13200\nBlooming Bouquet\n50\n13000\nArcana Gems\n50\n15600\nArcana Gems\n50\n15000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n17500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n21000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n3000\nSmall Gift\n1\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\n11000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCongratulations\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nToss Me the Bouquet\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nSurprise!\nLet's collect a total of 10000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Surprise Wedding\" banner.\n(Tapping the in-game banner will take you to the \"Church\" Event Map.)\nOnce you're at the \"Church\" Event Map, talk to the NPC \"Julie\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 3, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 24, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the June 3, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 30, 2026 (Tue) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nRegret Mummy\nDetails\nA mummy wrapped head to toe in bandages.\nIt releases its deep-seated hatred at the player, inflicting them with Curse.\nIts scratch and poisonous mist can inflict Poison.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\n\"Blooming Bouquet\" will be deleted on June 30, 2026 (Tue) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a Special difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
