    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Celestial Blessing Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-06-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA radiant blessing in the sky forges an eternal vow. Kirito, Leafa, Alice and Koharu are here with new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCelestial Blessing Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Vow Beneath the Stars] Kirito\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Strike/Shine Conversion\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Strike 3] Attack +35% when attacking with blunt element./[Shine Conversion 4] Dark element's damage to enemies -10% and holy element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Blessed Night Sky] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Buster\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Hall of Divine Light] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nIndiscreet Air\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Slash 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to Slash +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Slash Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where slash elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Your own attack increases by defense x 1.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dawnlit Rose Bouquet] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHoly Blow Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Blow\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Blunt→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Force 5/Buff (PT)] Holy element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +150% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Holy element's damage rises by the number of Lisbeth Skill Records in the same set x 10%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Dawnlit Rose Bouquet] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 1, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - June 30, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
