    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/27)\nMAINT.\n2026-05-27 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 5/27, 2026, 12:00, was completed on 5/27, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad Floor 65\" Update\nLive Event: Rainbow-colored Duet ～Echoes of Aincrad Launch Celebration～\n[Holiday Campaign] Ring Production Campaign\n[Holiday Campaign] 100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\nSilica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the skill effects of [Opening Ceremony] Leafa did not activate correctly.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out the reward of \"300 Arcana Gems\" for the viewer-participation event held during the official live stream on 5/22, 2026.\nReceive by: Until 6/3, 2026, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n5/27, 2026 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad Floor 65\" Update\nLive Event: Rainbow-colored Duet ～Echoes of Aincrad Launch Celebration～\n[Holiday Campaign] Ring Production Campaign\n[Holiday Campaign] 100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\nSilica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 5/27 Maintenance\n[Holiday Campaign] Guild Support Campaign\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\nRanking Event \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 71\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
