    "full_details": "Notices\nMay 18 is Lisbeth's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMay 18 is Lisbeth's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in Sword Art Online Integral Factor to celebrate Lisbeth's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\nBuild Up Equipment with Lisbeth +1\nWe're holding an event where you can get a Lisbeth chat stamp as well as enhancement and transformation materials!\n\"Build Up Equipment with Lisbeth\" is now available to be cleared twice per day, meaning you can get twice as many total materials from score rewards!\nPeriod\nMay 15, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - May 22, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nLisbeth's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Lisbeth!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nLisbeth's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nMay 18, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - May 27, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Lisbeth have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nMay 18, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - May 27, 2026 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Lisbeth's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until May 18, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
