    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2026-05-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nGrand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Creation & Rebirth] Asuna\nSkill Name\nCombination/Prosper/Hold the Front/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 3] Skill's power is added +75% when used in switch./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 5] Aggro increase -50% when attack hits.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Unleashed Power] Alice\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Slash/Earth Conversion\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Slash 3] Attack +35% when attacking with slash element./[Earth Conversion 4] Wind element's damage to enemies -10% and earth element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Colorful Connection] Silica\nSkill Name\nEnhance Frostbite Hit/Frostbite Blow/Inflict Frostbite\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Frostbite Hit 5] +success rate for Frostbite./[Frostbite Blow 5] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 30%./[Inflict Frostbite] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDamage +10% when using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Starlit Halloween] Sanya\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Slash Boost\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n48\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%./[Slash Boost 3] Adds a buff where slash elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 30 sec when hitting with Switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nSkill's power is added +150% when used in switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[When the Battle Ends] Kirito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/High Battle Healing/Deep Affection\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[High Battle Healing 4] Recovers a max of 1.5% HP per 3 sec./[Deep Affection 4] Defense rises by 4% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set.Attack rises by 7% x the number of Leafa Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Thunder Incarnate] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAqua Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 7, 2026 (Thu) 17:00 - May 17, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
