    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eugeo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eugeo!\nShop\n2026-04-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eugeo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Onto a New Journey] Eugeo\n(Link Skill)\" and \"\n[Freezing Flash] Eugeo\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nEugeo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eugeo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eugeo\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Onto a New Journey] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBurn Ravage\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n58\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Blunt 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Fire element damage +50%.\nLLv100: Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Freezing Flash] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Recoil Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Recoil\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Slash→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Dark element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Curse stacks when the player is inflicted with the Curse status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Freezing Flash] Eugeo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nApril 10, 2026 (Fri) 0:00 - April 19, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eugeo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eugeo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
