    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  아래 기간 동안 점검이 진행됩니다.  - 점검 예정일 2026년 4월 1일 11:50 ~ 12:20 (JST/UTC+9) * 날짜에 따라 변경될 수 있습니다.  - 유지보수 내용 서버 장비 조정.   참고하세요...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(4/1)\nMAINT.\n2026-04-01 11:20:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/1, 2026 11:50, was completed on 4/1, 2026 12:15(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed an issue in which Crimson Silent Arrows and Target Apples did not drop from the event dungeon boss in \"Aria of a Bowless World\".\n* Items that could not be obtained will be compensated in a future maintenance.\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n50 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\n4/8, 2026 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\n4/1, 2026 11:50 to 12:20 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nAdjusting server equipment.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
