    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] Clear the Underground Labyrinth to get lots of Protection Stones and Skill Releasers! The Underground Labyrinth Bonus Time Campaign is here!\nCampaign\n2026-03-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"Underground Labyrinth Bonus Time Campaign\" is here!\nDuring the campaign period, the chances to obtain Protection Stones and Skill Releasers will be increased!\nDon't let this chance pass you by!\nProtection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\nFor a limited time, every floor of the Underground Labyrinth will have an increased drop rate for\nProtection Stones\n!\nThe number of drops for\nProtection Stone Pieces\nwill also increase!\nAnd lastly, all bosses in every floor will have increased\nAppearance Rates\n,\nStaying Time\nand Chance to Obtain!\nUse this chance to challenge the Underground Labyrinth, and do your best to produce and evolve the Integral Series Shield!\nPlease see here for more details.\nSkill Releaser Campaign\nDuring the campaign period, the probability to obtain\nSkill Releasers\nwhen defeating monsters will be increased!\nYou can obtain tons of them, so use as much as you want for their effects!\nPlease see here for more details.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Underground Labyrinth Guide\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\" to challenge it.\nIn order to participate, you must clear the 100F Main Quest through the end.\nAbout Underground Labyrinth\nThe Underground Labyrinth is a special location where you can fight enemies on the same field with players outside of your party and guild members.\nOther players can attack monsters currently being fought.\nAll monsters will attack players near them.\nYou can obtain Skill Releasers in all floors of the Underground Labyrinth.\nSkill Releasers are items that increase the damage of certain sword skills.\nA very valuable shield can be produced using Protection Stones that drop from the bosses from the Underground Labyrinth B2F.\nFermat\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n3525\n280\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nFrom the Underground Labyrinth B3F, you can enjoy a special scenario and receive Arcana Gems and Skill Releasers.\nThey were certain he had disappeared...\nAfter the 100th Floor Incident, a new Underground Labyrinth suddenly appears in the Blackiron Palace.\nScouts bring back two things from the unknown dungeon: the new Skill Releaser power and a message from a mysterious supporter of the Assault Team.\nIn order to unravel the mysteries of the Underground Labyrinth and obtain greater power, the Assault Team forms a scouting team.\nWith the man everyone was certain had disappeared, your group takes on the Underground Labyrinth!\nPlease see here for more details of the latest floor.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
