    "full_details": "Notices\n[Underground Labyrinth] Get tons of Skill Releasers! The \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" is here! [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary]\nCampaign\n2026-03-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nThis is your opportunity to focus on earning Skill Releasers! The\n\"Skill Releaser Campaign\"\nis here!\nDuring the campaign period, the probability to obtain\nSkill Releasers\nwhen defeating monsters will be increased!\nThe \"\nProtection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\n\" is also currently active in the Underground Labyrinth!\nYou will have increased chances to obtain Protection Stones from bosses! Do not miss this chance to participate!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Underground Labyrinth Guide\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\" to challenge it.\nIn order to participate, you must clear the 100F Main Quest through the end.\nAbout Underground Labyrinth\nThe Underground Labyrinth is a special location where you can fight enemies on the same field with players outside of your party and guild members.\nOther players can attack monsters currently being fought.\nAll monsters will attack players near them.\nYou can obtain Skill Releasers in all floors of the Underground Labyrinth.\nSkill Releasers are items that increase the damage of certain sword skills.\nA very valuable shield can be produced using Protection Stones that drop from the bosses from the Underground Labyrinth B2F.\nFrom the Underground Labyrinth B3F, you can enjoy a special scenario and receive Arcana Gems and Skill Releasers.\nThey were certain he had disappeared...\nAfter the 100th Floor Incident, a new Underground Labyrinth suddenly appears in the Blackiron Palace.\nScouts bring back two things from the unknown dungeon: the new Skill Releaser power and a message from a mysterious supporter of the Assault Team.\nIn order to unravel the mysteries of the Underground Labyrinth and obtain greater power, the Assault Team forms a scouting team.\nWith the man everyone was certain had disappeared, your group takes on the Underground Labyrinth!\nExamples of Available Skill Releasers\nSee here for more details on Skill Releasers.\nFloor\nItem Name\nEffect\nItem Icon\nMax amount\nUnderground Labyrinth B1F\nResonate Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Resonate\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B1F\nFissure Releaser\nAdds 400% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Fissure\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B1F\nSlice Releaser\nAdds 400% power to Dagger Skills with \"Slice\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B2F\nRaid Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Raid\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B2F\nConverging Releaser\nAdds 500% power to 2H Spear Skills with \"Converging\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B2F\nJudgement Releaser\nAdds 500% power to 2H Axe Skills with \"Judgement\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B3F\nBump Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Bump\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B3F\nNova Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Nova\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B3F\nVigor Releaser\nAdds 500% power to Bow Skills with \"Vigor\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B4F\nPollution Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Pollution\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B4F\nCrush Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Crush\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B4F\nFang Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to Dagger Skills with \"Fang\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B5F\nShudder Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Shudder\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B5F\nOrbit Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to 2H Spear Skills with \"Orbit\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B5F\nSplit Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 2H Axe Skills with \"Split\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B6F\nPrison Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Prison\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B6F\nThorn Releaser\nAdds 1000% power to 1H Rapier Skills with \"Thorn\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B6F\nShock Releaser\nAdds 800% power to Bow Skills with \"Shock\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F\nStarburst Releaser\nAdds 1100% power to 1H Sword Skills with \"Starburst\" in the name\n300\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F\nDemolishing Releaser\nAdds 800% power to 1H Club Skills with \"Demolishing\" in the name\n500\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F\nCutter Releaser\nAdds 900% power to Dagger Skills with \"Cutter\" in the name\n500\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
