    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2026-03-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nDuring this campaign, get\n8x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the 8x value.\n8x EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
