    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/4)\nMAINT.\n2026-03-03 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/4, 2026, 14:00, was completed on 3/4, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 13th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Koharu Birthday Festival Defense Battle\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Chain Step-Up Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Teleport Gate Plaza maps have been changed for White Day\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n3/4, 2026 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 13th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Koharu Birthday Festival Defense Battle\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 3/4 Maintenance\n\"Match Made In Heaven Order\"\n[3000+ Days Anniversary] \"Memoria All Out Battle: The Gleam Eyes\"\n[3000+ Days Anniversary] \"Memorial Dungeon\"\n\"Valentine Boss Rush\"\n\"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
