    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"A View of Cherry Blossoms Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-02-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLeafa, Yuuki, Sinon, and Klein, enjoying a sightseeing tour of the ancient capital in full-bloom cherry blossoms, appear as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nA View of Cherry Blossoms Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Spring in the Old Capital] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nEarth Rush Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Rush\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nBreak Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n72\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Earth element's damage rises by the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set x 10%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Joyful Town in Spring] Yuuki\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHeat Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nHeat Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5600% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Spring in Her Eyes] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nBurning Shock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Path of Dancing Blossoms] Klein\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Back Up/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion5]Water element's damage to enemies -15% and fire element's damage to enemies +30%./[Back Up 5] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 4] Aggro increase -40% when attack hits.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nFebruary 27, 2026 (Fri) 17:00 - March 31, 2026 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
