    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/5000.html",
    "news_date": 1771182000,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터가 일본에 출시된 지 3,000일이 지났습니다! 아르카나 보석을 최대 2,000개 획득할 수 있는 특별한 던전이 등장합니다! 하루에 한 번 클리어하면 매일 아르카나 젬을 얻을 수 있습니다! * 아르카나 젬은 총 16일간 획득 가능합니다.  게다가 '3000일 기념일'을 모아서...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[3000+ Days Anniversary] Get up to 2,000 Arcana Gems! The returning \"Pixel Graphic T-Shirt\" is also available as a reward! The \"Memorial Dungeon\" is here!\nEVENT\n2026-02-16 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's been 3,000 days since Sword Art Online Integral Factor was released in Japan!\nA special dungeon where you can get up to\n2,000 Arcana Gems\nis here!\nClear it once per day to get Arcana Gems daily!\n* Arcana Gems can be obtained for up to 16 days total.\nAdditionally, by collecting \"3000 Days Anniversary Medal\", you can exchange them for various rare returning avatars from the \"\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt\n\" series!\nIf you don't have them yet, this is your chance!\n\"3000 Days Anniversary Medal\" can be obtained from total score rewards and challenge rewards.\nAlso, starting after the maintenance on February 18, 2026 (Wed), field monsters in the returning event \"\nBitter Chocolate Road\n\" will also drop them!\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Kirito\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Asuna\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Partner\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Yuuki\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Sinon\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Leafa\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Lisbeth\nTop Avatar\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Silica\nTop Avatar\nTotal Score Reward\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n50\nArcana Gems\n100\n100\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n150\nArcana Gems\n100\n200\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n100\n250\nArcana Gems\n100\n300\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n100\n350\nArcana Gems\n100\n400\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n100\n450\nArcana Gems\n100\n500\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n550\nArcana Gems\n100\n600\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n650\nArcana Gems\n100\n700\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n750\nArcana Gems\n100\n800\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n850\nArcana Gems\n100\n900\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n950\nArcana Gems\n100\n1000\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1050\nArcana Gems\n100\n1100\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1150\nArcana Gems\n100\n1200\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1250\nArcana Gems\n150\n1300\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1350\nArcana Gems\n150\n1400\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1450\nArcana Gems\n150\n1500\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1550\nArcana Gems\n150\n1600\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\n1700\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n200\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n3000 Days Annivesary Medal\n100\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gems\n100\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gems\n100\nTrade \"3000 Days Annivesary Medal\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Kirito\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Asuna\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Partner\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Yuuki\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Sinon\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Leafa\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Lisbeth\n300\n2\nPixel Graphic T-Shirt-Silica\n300\n2\nEvent Period\nFebruary 16, 2026 (Mon) 4:00 - Before the March 4, 2026 (Wed) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nTrader Period\nFebruary 16, 2026 (Mon) 4:00 - Before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Anniversary Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Memorial Dungeon\" to challenge the dungeon.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGreat Golden Spirit\nDetails\nIt will bite and charge at you.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\n3000 Days Annivesary Medals will be deleted on March 11, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
