    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/21)\nMAINT.\n2026-01-20 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/21, 2026, 14:00, was completed on 1/21, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 67 begins\nAdded \"That Time I Got Teleported to SAO\" Event rewards\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Order VOL. 3\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the names of the avatars obtainable in the 67th Guild of Guilds from \"Green Red\" to \"Pink Green\"\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where collab avatars obtained from the That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Avatar Order could not be sold at the Avatar Shop\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n1/21, 2026 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 67 begins\nAdded \"That Time I Got Teleported to SAO\" Event rewards\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 1/21 Maintenance\n\"Stardust Maker Order\"\n\"Flame Stallion Hunt\"\n\"The Way of the Swordsmen\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\n©RK/K/SP ©BNEI © T,F,K/TSP\nGo to Notice List"
