    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Login Bonus now available! Login every day to get new limited edition rewards from this collab!\nCampaign\n2026-01-08 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate the SAOIF x That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime collaboration, \"TenSura Collab Celebration Login Bonus\" are here!\nLog in during the event and get your hands on the Skill Record ★4[A Slime Here Too]Rimuru, limited edition Stamps, and more limited items unique to this collab!\nPeriod\nJanuary 8, 2026 (Thu) 4:00 - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nTenSura Collab Stamp 3\nUse to obtain the \"Rimuru 3\" stamp.\nDay2\n★4[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\nDay3\nSlime Gummy×100\nDay4\nTenSura Collab Stamp 6\nUse to obtain the \"Veldora 1\" stamp.\nDay5\nShion's Cooking×50\nRevive Crystal×50\nDay6\nHi-potion×100\nDay7\nTenSura Collab Stamp 18\nUse to obtain the \"Ramiris\" stamp.\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\n\"Hi-potion\", \"Shion's Cooking\" and \"Slime Gummy\" will be deleted on January 30, 2026 (Fri) at 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
