    "snippet": "낚시랭킹 이벤트 \"2025년 설맞이 낚시대회\"가 진행중입니다. '2025년 설맞이 낚시 대회'에서는 어획량 점수에 따라 최고 순위를 놓고 경쟁합니다.   일출 선박 이벤트 맵 독점 파티 도미 낚시로 높은 점수를 기대하세요!   Party Bream 게다가, 당신은 ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Fishing Ranking Event \"2025 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is on now! More fish can be caught at any time on 22F!\nEVENT\n2025-12-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFishing Ranking Event \"2025 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2025 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nExpect\nhigh scores\nby fishing Party Bream exclusive to the Sunrise Ship Event Map!\nParty Bream\nWhat's more, you can now catch user-selected fish that appeared in past events at any time on 22F!\nThese can now be traded for items at the Fishing Trader.\nEight kinds of fish have been added!\n* We plan to continue adding more in the future.\nEvent Period\nSunrise Ship Event Map Period: Starts after the December 24, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the December 24, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 31, 2025 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2025 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get\nlimited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait\n, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the 2025 New Year's Eve Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\n2025 New Year's Eve Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the December 24, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 21, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nNYE Fishing King 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Elite 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Mania 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\n* The item with your Record will be deleted on January 21, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59(JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Locations\nScores from fish caught on the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map (Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced) as well as the day and night \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F will be displayed in the rankings.\nHead to the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nEvent Map & 22F\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nSunrise Ship(Beginner)\n1～10\nSunrise Ship(Intermediate)\n11～20\nSunrise Ship(Advanced)\n21～\nSerene Shore\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:NYE Fishing King 2025\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from January 2, 2026 (Fri) 0:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until January 21, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
