    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/17)\nMAINT.\n2025-12-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 12/17, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 12/17, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 66 begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Prison Warden\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Shining Shooting Stars Christmas\"\nAdded [Holiday Campaign] \"Christmas Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Avatar Party (Winter)\" begins\n\"Wandering Traveler Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for winter\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue when using Link Skills, where individual Link Skill effects were being applied to normal attacks\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n12/17, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 66 begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Prison Warden\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Shining Shooting Stars Christmas\"\nAdded [Holiday Campaign] \"Christmas Boss Rush\" Event rewards\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 12/17 Maintenance\n\"Chaos Revolution Order\"\n\"Returning! Alicization Avatar Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
