    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/10)\nMAINT.\n2025-12-09 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 12/10, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 12/10, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Shining Shooting Stars Christmas\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 66 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Christmas Boss Rush\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Heartful Christmas Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where Link Skill Record mini-icons did not have background colors\nFixed an issue where the Limit Break displayed on Skill Record icons in the Present Box appeared as -1\nFixed an issue with the ★5 Rex Integral Series where the visual effect triggered when drawing the sword was also displayed when sheathing it\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 12/17, 2025, the guild room will no longer be themed for Holiday Campaign.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n12/10, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Shining Shooting Stars Christmas\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 66 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Christmas Boss Rush\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 12/10 Maintenance\n\"Brilliant Order\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
