    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 사용자 여러분께 알려드립니다. [1개 전용] 무술 상인 메달에 채팅 스탬프 1개가 추가되었습니다. 매력적인 캐릭터들의 스탬프를 꼭 손에 넣어보세요!  [1x 전용] 전투 예술 메달 상인 정보. 새로운 채팅스탬프와 채팅스탬프를 받아보세요.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"[1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader\" Lineup Update!\nNOTICES\n2025-11-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\n1 chat stamp have been added to the [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader.\nBe sure to get your hands on these charming characters' stamps!\nAbout [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader.\nGet new chat stamps and chat stamps that appeared as rewards in previous events, as well as all kinds of Chaos Crystals for producing the Dark Black Series.\nArmament Stones for Nox Integral Series and Lux Integral Series production and transformation are included in the lineup.\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\nAccessing the Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tapping the [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader > Trade Limited Items and tapping the [1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\n[1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader Special Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Swinging Blade] Kirito\n50\n1\n★4[Black Pioneer] Kirito\n1\n10\nLast Number Armament Stone\n85\n1\nButterfly Armament Stone\n82\n1\nWarden Armament Stone\n79\n1\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\n75\n1\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\n72\n1\nAsura Armament Stone\n69\n1\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\n75\n1\nAmber Chaos Crystal\n63\n1\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\n60\n1\nMemory Stamp 298[NEW!]\nUse to obtain the \"Let's go together!\" stamp.\n1\n1\nMemory Stamp 304[NEW!]\nUse to obtain the \"Let's celebrate with party poppers\" stamp.\n1\n1\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLet's go together!\nLet's celebrate with party poppers\nImportant\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nSome of the stamps that have been added are entries received from the offline SAOIF avatar and stamp design contest in 2019 have been added to the game as stamps.\nThis is different from the regular \"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader as the trade limit does not reset.\nDepending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
