    "news_date": 1764316800,
    "news_category": "UPDATE",
    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터를 플레이해주셔서 감사합니다. 이러한 완화된 요구사항은 2025년 11월 28일(금) 점검 이후 시행되었습니다.  미궁에서 생산 재료 드롭률이 증가했습니다. 영향을 받는 통합 시리즈: Rosso, Yasha, Gaou, Machina, Gale 드랍율 개선 위치...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nIncreased drop rates for Integral Series production and transformation materials, as well as Dark Black Series production materials! And now you can take on Chaos Showdown 195 as a party!\nUPDATE\n2025-11-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for playing Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nThese relaxed requirements were implemented after the maintenance on November 28, 2025 (Fri).\nIncreased production material drop rates in labyrinths.\nIntegral Series affected:\nRosso, Yasha, Gaou, Machina, Gale\nLocations of Drop Rate Improvements\nProduction materials\n61F Labyrinth – Entry\nSea Snake Armament Stone\nSea Snake Fin\n61F Labyrinth – Interior\n74F Labyrinth – Entry\nGleam Eyes Armament Stone\nGleam Eyes Horn\n74F Labyrinth – Interior\n81F Labyrinth – Entry\nLand Devourer Armament Stone\nLand Devourer Sludge\n81F Labyrinth – Interior\n85F Labyrinth – Entry\nHundred Arms Armament Stone\nHundred Arms Armor Piece\n85F Labyrinth – Interior\n91F Labyrinth – Entry\nChaos Drake Armament Stone\nChaos Drake Claw\n91F Labyrinth – Interior\nAll Out Battle [Aincrad]\nSummit Lord Armament Stone\nSummit Lord Blood\n31F Labyrinth – Entry\nNine-tailed Fox Armament Stone\nNine-Tailed Fox Mane\n31F Labyrinth – Interior\n79F Labyrinth – Entry\nOverseer Armament Stone\nOverseer Wing\n79F Labyrinth – Interior\n83F Labyrinth – Entry\nTeaser Tentacle Armament Stone\nTeaser Tentacle Sucker\n83F Labyrinth – Interior\n51F Labyrinth – Entry\nMetal Reaper Armament Stone\nMetal Reaper Femur\n51F Labyrinth – Interior\n17F Labyrinth – Entry\nExtreme Wyrm Armament Stone\nExtreme Wyrm Scale\n17F Labyrinth – Interior\n69F Labyrinth – Entry\nAdamas Snake Armament Stone\nAdamas Snake Scale\n69F Labyrinth – Interior\n23F Labyrinth – Entry\nBloody Eyes Armament Stone\nBloody Eyes Horn\n23F Labyrinth – Interior\n19F Labyrinth – Entry\nOptimized Thing Armament Stone\nOptimized Thing Fluid\n19F Labyrinth – Interior\n33F Labyrinth – Entry\nEliminator Armament Stone\nEliminator Waist Tie\n33F Labyrinth – Interior\nChaos Showdown 195 dungeons can now be attempted with parties.\nDungeons affected:\n・Chaos Showdown 195 - Dark Black Warden\n・Chaos Showdown 195 - Dark Black Butterfly\n・Chaos Showdown 195 - Dark Black Last Number\nIncreased drop rates for Dark Black Series production materials.\nItems affected: Dark Black Series production materials acquired in the following Chaos Showdown Dungeons.\n・Chaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Colossal\n・Chaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Frozen Evil\n・Chaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Evil Spirit\n・Chaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Snake Samurai\n・Chaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Griffin\n・Chaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Sturdy Crab\n・Chaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black Blazing\n・Chaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black Half Beast\n・Chaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black One-Eyed Beast\n・Chaos Showdown 175 - Dark Black Asura\n・Chaos Showdown 175 - Dark Black Crossgigas\n・Chaos Showdown 175 - Dark Black Sticky Thing\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
