    "full_details": "Notices\nGet ready for a new, specially-curated Step-Up Order! \"The Shattering Blow Premium Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-11-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet ready for a new, specially-curated Step-Up Order!\n\"\nThe Shattering Blow Premium Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nAll ★4 Skill Records in this lineup are\nWater or Holy Blunt Sword Skills\n, or useful\nabilities\nfor attacking!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pioneer of the Wasteland] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Shine\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n156\nBreak Gauge\n66\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Undying Flame] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nLightning Fan Burst\nSkill Name\nLightning Fan\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Blunt→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Another Happy Day] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAqua Stamp\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n78\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Welcoming Smile] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPhoton Flip Burst\nSkill Name\nPhoton Flip\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Blunt→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Snow Singer] Yuna\nWeapon Type\nShield\nSkill Name\nWater Slap\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n20\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Streaming Pattern 4/Buff] Petrify resistance +80% for 10 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Raises 2 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blackwing Ace] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Gourmet Overload] Alice\nSkill Name\nCombination/Veteran Sword Technique/Light Dance\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 4] Skill's power is added +100% when used in switch./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Light Dance 4] Deals +20% Holy element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Midnight Duel] Mito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Icy Blade/Prosper\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - November 25, 2025 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers/Details\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
