    "full_details": "Notices\nA free Once Daily 11x Order to celebrate Aincrad Day!\nShop\n2025-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNovember 6 is Aincrad Day!\nA free Once Daily 11x Order to celebrate Aincrad Day every day from today until the November 28 (Fri) maintenance!\nYou will be able to get one free 11x Order per day during the event period, so don't forget!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Higher Than All the Rest] Kirito\nSkill Name\nCrushing Impact/Mallet Blow/Thrust protect\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Crushing Impact 3] Attack +800 when attacking with blunt element./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Thrust protect 3] Reduce damage from 12% thrust element monster.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Can I Take Your Order?] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Break\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n870% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Classical Coordinate] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Shoot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Night Routine] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n23\nSkill Effect\n760% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +800 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Tiny Qipao] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Nova\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack +800 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Persica Girl] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurning Crush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Analyze 3/Debuff] Chance to raise critical damage against enemies by 15% for 15 sec./▲[Bonus] Recovers 5 SP when the monster is defeated with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance.\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
