    "snippet": "아인크라드 데이 특별 이벤트! 히스클리프와 일대일 전투를 벌이세요! \"VS 히스클리프\"가 등장합니다! 히스클리프를 상대로 승리를 거둘 수 있다면 전투 예술 메달을 획득하세요! 권장 총파워 600,000으로 시리어스 매치에서도 승리할 경우 \"...의 초월자\"를 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Day] Show your skills in a one-on-one battle against Heathcliff! \"VS Heathcliff\" is here!\nEVENT\n2025-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAn Aincrad Day special event!\nFight a one-on-one battle against Heathcliff! \"\nVS Heathcliff\n\" is here!\nGet Medals of Combat Arts if you're able to pull off a win against Heathcliff!\nIf you can also win in the Serious Match with a Recommended Total Power of 600,000, you'll receive the \"\nSurpasser of the Holy Sword 2\n\" record that proves your victory!\nParticipation Requirements\nRegular Dungeon: Complete the 74F Main Quest\nSerious Match: Complete the 75F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Heathcliff\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nRewards\nYou can get a total of up to 20 Medals of Combat Arts, with a total of 10 from the regular dungeon and 10 from your first completion of the Serious Match.\nThe \"Surpasser of the Holy Sword 2\" record reward can be acquired through the Serious Match's challenge rewards.\nHeathcliff\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
