    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Day] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"! Drop rate of production materials up to Gaou Integral series is increased!\nCampaign\n2025-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAn Aincrad Day special event!\nFor a limited-time only,\ndrops rates have been boosted for production materials\nused to make anything from the Integral Series to the Gaou Intergral Series of weapons!\nThis is a good opportunity to get any you haven't managed to obtain yet.\nPoints with increased drop rates\nProduction materials\n13F Labyrinth – Entry\nBlazing Armament Stone\nBlazing Flame Arms\n13F Labyrinth – Interior\n14F Labyrinth – Entry\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\nHalf Beast's Horn\n14F Labyrinth – Interior\n20F Labyrinth – Entry\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\nOne-Eyed Beast Fang\n20F Labyrinth – Interior\n25F Labyrinth – Entry\nAsura Armament Stone\nAsura Iron Ball\n25F Labyrinth – Interior\n27F Labyrinth – Entry\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\nCrossgigas Iron Chain\n27F Labyrinth – Interior\n35F Labyrinth – Entry\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\nSticky Thing Fluid\n35F Labyrinth – Interior\n40F Labyrinth – Entry\nWarden Armament Stone\nWarden's Glove\n40F Labyrinth – Interior\n47F Labyrinth – Entry\nButterfly Armament Stone\nButterfly Scale\n47F Labyrinth – Interior\n50F Labyrinth – Entry\nLast Number Armament Stone\nLast Number Claw\n50F Labyrinth – Interior\n61F Labyrinth – Entry\nSea Snake Armament Stone\nSea Snake Fin\n61F Labyrinth – Interior\n74F Labyrinth – Entry\nGleam Eyes Armament Stone\nGleam Eyes Horn\n74F Labyrinth – Interior\n81F Labyrinth – Entry\nLand Devourer Armament Stone\nLand Devourer Sludge\n81F Labyrinth – Interior\n85F Labyrinth – Entry\nHundred Arms Armament Stone\nHundred Arms Armor Piece\n85F Labyrinth – Interior\n91F Labyrinth – Entry\nChaos Drake Armament Stone\nChaos Drake Claw\n91F Labyrinth – Interior\n100F All Out Battle [Aincrad]\nSummit Lord Armament Stone\nSummit Lord Blood\n31F Labyrinth – Entry\nNine-tailed Fox Armament Stone\nNine-Tailed Fox Mane\n31F Labyrinth – Interior\n79F Labyrinth – Entry\nOverseer Armament Stone\nOverseer Wing\n79F Labyrinth – Interior\n83F Labyrinth – Entry\nTeaser Tentacle Armament Stone\nTeaser Tentacle Sucker\n83F Labyrinth – Interior\nLabyrinth - Interior has the highest drop rates of all the floors, so work together as a party to collect the production materials that drop from the bosses!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nIntegral Series (Required Level 101)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nGusion\n1H Sword\n1220\nArc Angel\n1H Rapier\n1197\nStingray\n1H Club\n1220\nAfter Glow\n2H Axe\n1382\nGluttony\n2H Spear\n1357\nRadgrid\nBow\n1331\nNocturne\nDagger\n1197\nNox Integral Series (Required Level 121)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nNox Gusion\n1H Sword\n1434\nNox Arc Angel\n1H Rapier\n1407\nNox Stingray\n1H Club\n1434\nNox After Glow\n2H Axe\n1644\nNox Gluttony\n2H Spear\n1614\nNox Radgrid\nBow\n1583\nNox Nocturne\nDagger\n1407\nLux Integral Series (Required Level 141)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nForneus\n1H Sword\n1648\nDominion\n1H Rapier\n1617\nAlbatross\n1H Club\n1648\nTwilight\n2H Axe\n1905\nGreed\n2H Spear\n1870\nSigrun\nBow\n1835\nRhapsody\nDagger\n1617\nRosso Integral Series (Required Level 161)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nRosso Forneus\n1H Sword\n1862\nRosso Dominion\n1H Rapier\n1827\nRosso Albatross\n1H Club\n1862\nRosso Twilight\n2H Axe\n2167\nRosso Greed\n2H Spear\n2127\nRosso Sigrun\nBow\n2087\nRosso Rhapsody\nDagger\n1827\nYasha Integral Series (Required Level 181)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nAstaroth\n1H Sword\n2076\nPrincipality\n1H Rapier\n2037\nPorcupine\n1H Club\n2076\nMonsoon\n2H Axe\n2429\nEnvy\n2H Spear\n2384\nReginleifr\nBow\n2339\nOratorio\nDagger\n2037\nGaou Integral Series (Required Level 201)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nGaou Astaroth\n1H Sword\n2290\nGaou Principality\n1H Rapier\n2247\nGaou Porcupine\n1H Club\n2290\nGaou Monsoon\n2H Axe\n2690\nGaou Envy\n2H Spear\n2641\nGaou Reginleifr\nBow\n2591\nGaou Oratorio\nDagger\n2247\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nCheck out the link below for more details on each Intergral Series of weapons.\n\"Integral series\"\n\"Nox Integral Series\"\n\"Lux Integral Series\"\n\"Rosso Integral Series\"\n\"Yasha Integral Series\"\n\"Gaou Integral Series\"\nImportant\nThis campaign does not include Character Quests.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
