    "full_details": "Notices\nThanks to you all, we've surpassed 30 million downloads worldwide! We're holding all sorts of events to show our gratitude!\nEVENT\n2025-10-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for playing Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nThanks to all of your support, Sword Art Online Integral Factor has surpassed 30 million downloads worldwide!\nAs a way of expressing our gratitude, we have a variety of events planned such as Panel Missions where you can obtain a total of 3,000 Arcana Gems, a monster transformation event, and more!\nEvents\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event.\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
