    "news_date": 1760601600,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "유우키, 코하루, 시리카, 사치가 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록으로 진실과 정의의 저울을 달았습니다! \"심판 명령의 여신\"이 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 총 드랍률 6%에는 보장된 ★4 스킬 레코드가 포함되어 있지 않으며, 신규 ★4 스킬 레코드가 등장합니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Goddesses of Judgment Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-10-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Koharu, Silica, and Sachi weigh the scales of truth and righteousness as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nGoddesses of Judgment Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Turning Point of Destiny] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Orderly Judgement] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Delicate Balance] Silica\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWind Hash Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Hash\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n52\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Joy of Harmony] Sachi\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Slash/Wind Conversion\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Slash 3] Attack +35% when attacking with slash element./[Wind Conversion 4] Earth element's damage to enemies -10% and wind element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Delicate Balance] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
