    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "전세계 3천만 다운로드! \"Halloween Assault 2025\"에서 몬스터 무리가 공격하는 감사 캠페인입니다! 일정 시간이 지나면 보스 몬스터가 등장합니다. 수많은 몬스터들을 몰아내고 엄청난 경험치를 획득하세요!  보상 인기 할로윈 아바타가 돌아왔습니다! 수많은 EX 외에도...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[30 Million Downloads Celebration] Popular Halloween avatars are back! The \"Halloween Assault 2025\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of monsters!\nEVENT\n2025-10-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n30 Million Downloads Worldwide! Thank You Campaign\nHordes of monsters attack in the \"Halloween Assault 2025\"!\nAfter a certain amount of time passes, the boss monster will appear.\nDrive off hordes of monsters and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nRewards\nPopular Halloween avatars are back!\nIn addition to tons of EXP and the \"Exp Crystals\" you can use to gain EXP, you can get \"Arcana Gems\", \"Medals of Combat Arts\", \"Awakening Stars\" to awaken Skill Records, \"Memoria Niter S\" to Limit Break Skill Records, and much more!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster \"La Spiritual Pump\" will drop Star Fragments.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nAvatar\nAvatar Images\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nWitch Pump Mask A\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask B\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump A\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump B\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrader Rewards\nGet various rewards from Total Score Rewards and by trading the Black Halloween Plates from the event at the Trader.\n\"White Halloween Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the October 22, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on October 29, 2025 (Wed).\nTrade \"Black Halloween Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nTrick-or-Dress Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Hat\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Vest Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Pants Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Cape\n250\n1\nWitch Pump Mask A\n150\n2\nWitch Pump Mask B\n150\n2\nWitch Pump Mask C\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump A\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump B\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump C\n150\n2\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nExp Crystal L\n100\n20\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n30\nTrade \"White Halloween Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nTrick-or-Dress Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Hat\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Cape\n250\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nExp Crystal L\n100\n15\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n20\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n6P\n21P\n21P\n360P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nA one-per-day bonus dungeon where players can go for a high score.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nSpecial\n\"\nA field with unusable items where certain items cannot be used and no revives are allowed.\nMonsters other than the boss also have the same weaknesses and resistances as the boss.\nOf all the difficulties eligible for a Total Score Reward, these dungeons award the highest scores.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×45\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nExp Crystal L×75\nExp Crystal M×70\nExp Crystal S×80\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nPlayful Pumpkin\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Black Halloween Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nNight of Tricks!\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Black Halloween Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Halloween Assault\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the October 22, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nBlack Halloween Plate: Starts after the October 16, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nWhite Halloween Plate: Starts after the October 22, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nLa Spiritual Pump\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict \"Bloodshed\" and \"Paralysis\".\nOn \"Maniac\", \"Special\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nExcept Expert\nBlunt Element\nWind Element\nExpert\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nResistance\nSpecial\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nExpert\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"La Spiritual Pump\" will keep appearing until time is up, even after it has been defeated.\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\nPlates will be deleted on November 12, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-10-15T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-11-05T19:00:00+00:00"
