    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Kirito Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-10-10 11:59:59\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (10/7) is Kirito's birthday!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Kirito's birthday on October 7.\nLet's all celebrate Kirito's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n10/7 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
