    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/8)\nMAINT.\n2025-10-07 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/8, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 10/8, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 64 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Icefog Wolf Hunt\"\nAdded \"Birthday Battle Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for fall\n▼Fixed Issues\nAdjusted the spawn points of some monsters appearing on Underground Labyrinth B6F\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n10/8, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 64 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Icefog Wolf Hunt\"\nAdded \"Birthday Battle Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 10/8 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Harvest Assault\"\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
