    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터 월드와이드 7.5주년 기념! 지금 특별 퀘스트를 통해 엄청난 경험치를 얻을 수 있습니다!  퀘스트를 수락하고, 지정된 맵으로 이동한 후, 몬스터를 처치하고 클리어하면 보상을 받을 수 있습니다. 게다가 퀘스트를 진행하면서 난이도도 높아집니다.  루...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2025-09-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 40 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 18, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the October 2, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the September 18 Maintenance\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n200,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 19 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n400,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 20 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n1,000,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 21 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n1,600,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 22 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n2,400,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 23 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n3,600,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 24 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n4,800,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 25 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 26 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n8,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 27 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 40M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n12,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nClear records up to the Heapin' 30M EXP Event at the time of maintenance on September 18, 2025 (Thu) have been removed from Completed Quests.\nYou can check this by going to Menu, then Quests, then Completed Quests.\nThis was done to mitigate issues with the list being difficult to view as completion records for the Heapin' EXP Events continued to accumulate in the Completed Quests column.\n* We plan to continue to do this in the future.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
