    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/18)\nMAINT.\n2025-09-17 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/18, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 9/18, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 63 begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Harvest Assault\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Unstoppable Force Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue with the Yuuki interaction quest \"Defeat the boss\" where the latest dialogue contained errors\nThis issue affected dialogue only, so there will be no changes to the rewards.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n9/18, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 63 begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Harvest Assault\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 9/18 Maintenance\nThe 8th \"Squad Jumble\"\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
