    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Chain Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Chain Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-09-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Chain Skills\"!\nThe \"\nChain Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Chain Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Chain Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Bright Spring Girl] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly Bite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Scorching Arrow] Sinon\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Air Flow/Back Up\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Air Flow 3] Adds a buff (Wind Pile) where wind damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)/[Back Up 3] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Just You Wait, Stars] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n51\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nSeptember 13, 2025 (Sat) 17:00 - September 22, 2025 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Chain Skill!\nOne ★4 Chain Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
