    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터 월드와이드 7.5주년 기념! 이 캠페인 동안 여러 라운드 하위 퀘스트에서 경험치를 4배로 획득하세요! 플레이어 레벨을 쉽게 올릴 수 있는 기회입니다!  캠페인 기간은 2025년 9월 10일(수) 점검 후부터 시작되어 9월 1일 이전에 종료됩니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\" On Now!\nCampaign\n2025-09-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nDuring this campaign, get\n4x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Subquests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the September 10, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 18, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nSubquests\nYou can accept requests from people with \"!\" marks. These are subquests.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Subquests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the 4x value.\n4x EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the campaign ends before you turn in the subquest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-09-09T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-09-17T19:00:00+00:00"
