    "snippet": "소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터 월드와이드 7.5주년 기념! 이 캠페인 동안 다중 라운드 캐릭터 퀘스트에서 7배의 경험치를 얻으세요! 플레이어 레벨을 쉽게 올릴 수 있는 기회입니다!  이벤트 시작 상인 지구의 게시판에서 캐릭터 퀘스트를 수락하세요.  파티클...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2025-09-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary!\nDuring this campaign, get\n7x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the September 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 10, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the 7x value.\n7x EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-09-02T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-09-09T19:00:00+00:00"
