    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Platinum Prince Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-08-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Klein, and Lisbeth clad themselves in gleaming white formal wear as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPlatinum Prince Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Belle of the Ball] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nEarth Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Thrust→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Royal Star] Alice\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Prosper/Earth Accumulation\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Earth Accumulation 3] Earth element's damage rises by the number of Klein Skill Records in the same set x 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Ivory Aristocrat] Klein\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSand Sweep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Elegant Attire] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFlame Flip Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Flip\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2420% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Force 5/Buff (PT)] Fire element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5900% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Elegant Attire] Lisbeth\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 26, 2025 (Tue) 17:00 - Before the September 25, 2025 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
