    "full_details": "Notices\n[Happy Birthday, Sinon!] The Sinon Birthday Login Bonus is here! Receive up to a total of 1,000 Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2025-08-21 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAugust 21 is Sinon's birthday!\nTo celebrate Sinon's birthday, we're holding the Sinon Birthday Login Bonus!\nThis is a special login bonus where you can get\n100 Arcana Gems each day\nby logging in for a total of\nup to 1,000 Arcana Gems\nover 10 days!\nPeriod\nAugust 21, 2025 (Thu) 4:00 - August 31, 2025 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nArcana Gems×100\nDay2\nArcana Gems×100\nDay3\nArcana Gems×100\nDay4\nArcana Gems×100\nDay5\nArcana Gems×100\nDay6\nArcana Gems×100\nDay7\nArcana Gems×100\nDay8\nArcana Gems×100\nDay9\nArcana Gems×100\nDay10\nArcana Gems×100\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
