    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sinon's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sinon!\nShop\n2025-08-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sinon's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Piercing Gleam] Sinon\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Swiftbolt Archer] Sinon\n(Chain Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSinon's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sinon guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sinon\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Piercing Gleam] Sinon\nSkill Name\nFive Sharp Weapons/Risk Taker\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Five Sharp Weapons 3] Attack +800 when attacking with thrust element./[Risk Taker 4] Adds a buff (Risk Taker 4) when using the Switch, The lower your own HP, attack increases (Stack 5) for 20 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDamage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Swiftbolt Archer] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Shell\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Swiftbolt Archer] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 21, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - August 30, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Sinon\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sinon\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
