    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/20)\nMAINT.\n2025-08-19 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/20, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 8/20, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 62 begins\n\"ghost? Assault 2025\" begins\nPermanent event \"Unital King Incredible Foreigner\" begins\nAdded \"Carnival Beast Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nReorganized the Help categories, so it will be easier to find what you are looking for\nAdded a Festival Dance emote that allows you to move while dancing\nExtended the Carnival Beast Hunt event period and the Festival Area map availability until maintenance on 9/10/2025 (Wed).\nChanged the removal date for the Carnival Plate Trader and the following items to 9/18/2025 (Thu) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nSummer Takoyaki\nSummer Snow Cone\nSummer Cotton Candy\nSeafood Skewer\nTropical Float\nRed Carnival Plate\nBlue Carnival Plate\nAbyss Carnival Beast Hero\n* Both Festival Dance emotes will be removed during maintenance on 9/10/2025 (Wed).\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed the behavior of the Festival Dance emote\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n8/20, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 62 begins\n\"ghost? Assault 2025\" begins\nPermanent event \"Unital King Incredible Foreigner\" begins\nAdded \"Carnival Beast Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 8/20 Maintenance\nThe 7th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Witch\"\n\"Agil Summer Festival 2025\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
