    "full_details": "Notices\nFishing Ranking Event, \"2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2025-08-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFishing Ranking Event \"2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nThe Poyon Fish, Rabbit Fish, Gear Fish, and Honey Fish were selected from user submissions and appear on this Event Map!\nCatch them to get a\nhigh score\n!\nEvent Period\nEvent Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\" Period: Starts after the August 6, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 27, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the August 6, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 14, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2025 Midsummer Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the 2025 Midsummer Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\n2025 Midsummer Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the August 6, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nMS Fishing King 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nMS Fishing Elite 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nMS Fishing Mania 2025\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nThere are 8 locations in total, with day and night versions of the Event Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\", and day and night versions of Serene Shore and Peaceful Forest Path on 22F.\nHead to the day beach by talking to the \"Beach Guide\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nMove to the night beach by talking to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC at the day beach.\nMove on board the boat by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the beach.\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nEvent Map & 22F\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nBeach (Day)\n1～10\nOn Board (Day)\n11～15\nBeach (Night)\n16～20\nOn Board (Night)\n21～\nSerene Shore (Day)\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path (Day)\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:MS Fishing King 2025\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:MS Fishing Elite 2025\n1\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:MS Fishing Mania 2025\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from August 15, 2025 (Fri) 14:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until maintenance begins on August 27, 2025 (Wed)\nImportant\nThe item with your Record will be deleted on September 3, 2025 (Wed) at 13:59(JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-08-05T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-08-26T19:00:00+00:00"
