    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 '클라인의 담력시험 작전 [복귀]'가 돌아왔습니다!  클라인 담력시험작전 [복귀] 키리토와 아스나는 해변 맵에서 이벤트를 즐기고 있었다. 진심을 다하는 듯 보이지만 그들의 대화는 모두 전략이었다. 클라인, 믿으세요...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back!  Get ghost avatars!\nEVENT\n2025-08-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" is back!\nKlein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\nKirito and Asuna were enjoying the event on the beachside map.\nAlthough they looked like they were having a heart-to-heart, their conversation was all strategy.\nKlein, believing their lack of romantic progression was due to getting in their own way, looked to fix this by suggesting they take place in a test of courage event.\nRewards\nGet Brown Wooden Tags from the event and exchange them for the Ghost Costume or the Ghost Mask!\nThe\n★4[Holiday Smile] Yuuki\nswimsuit illustration Skill Record from SWORD ART ONLINE Arcade: Deep Explorer is back as well!\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 75\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 15\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster Soul Musha will drop Star Fragments.\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\n▼Skill Record\n★4[Holiday Smile] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Enhance Bleed Res.\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./●[Enhance Bleed Res. 4] Bleed resistance +60%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n* 【[Holiday Smile] Yuuki's expression will change when transformed.\n* Image is pre-transformation.\nAvatar Images\n* Enjoy the ghost avatar comprised of the \"Ghost Costume Top and Bottom\" and the \"Ghost Mask\" that has 8 different expressions.\nLimited-Time Items.\nIt drops from bosses of dungeon of all difficulties at a fixed rate.\nIt can also be claimed from Score Rewards and the Exclusive Trader.\nLimited Items\nEffect\nSummer Takoyaki\nHot 'n Fresh\nPlayer's attack +7% for 3 min.\nSummer Snow Cone\nBrain Freeze!\nInstantly recover 1000 HP and status ailment.\nSummer Cotton Candy\nFluffy Dreaminess\nInstantly recover 5% of max HP\nTrade \"Light Brown Wooden Tag\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nGhost Mask A\n150\n2\nGhost Mask B\n150\n2\nGhost Mask C\n150\n2\nGhost Mask D\n150\n2\nGhost Mask E\n150\n2\nGhost Mask F\n200\n2\nGhost Mask G\n200\n2\nGhost Mask H\n200\n2\nGhost Costume Top and Bottom\n300\n2\nSummer Takoyaki\n3\n50\nSummer Snow Cone\n3\n50\nSummer Cotton Candy\n3\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Dark Brown Wooden Tag\" for special items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Holiday Smile] Yuuki\n400\n1\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nSummer Takoyaki\n3\n50\nSummer Snow Cone\n3\n50\nSummer Cotton Candy\n3\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n2\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\nTotal Score Reward\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the Total Score Reward, but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus: 1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus: 5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus: 10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:2280P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n2400\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n1120\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon in this event.。\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty\n\"Extreme\"\nYou can clear the \"\nExtreme\n\" one time per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to one time.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×500\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\n\"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nGreat Red Jewel×3\nGreat Green Jewel×3\nGreat Yellow Jewel×3\nGreat Blue Jewel×3\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nTest of Courage Operation\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Light Brown Wooden Tags in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nMushaking in excitement!\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Light Brown Wooden Tags in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nPowerful Expulsion\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Dark Brown Wooden Tags in the time period.\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nFirst, talk to the \"Beach Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to head to the day beach.\nOnce you're at the day beach, talk to \"Klein\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 3 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 6, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 27, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the August 6, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 3, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nSoul Musha\nDetails\nWhen its HP falls below a certain amount, it changes modes and uses the increase attack buff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, and Extreme difficulty levels, it will use the damage-reduction buff Chaos Recollection.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Burn\"\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nIf you have previously played the \"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Light Brown Wooden Tag\", \"Dark Brown Wooden Tag\", \"Summer Takoyaki\", \"Summer Snow Cone\" and \"Summer Cotton Candy\" will be deleted on September 3, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-08-05T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-08-26T19:00:00+00:00"
