    "snippet": "오늘(8/3)은 미토의 생일이에요!  8월 3일 미토의 생일을 기념하여 아르카나 젬 250개를 선물상자로 보내드렸습니다. 모두 함께 미토의 생일을 축하해주세요!  ▼수신일자(Arcana Gems) 8월 3일 ~ 23:59(JST/UTC+9) ▼주의사항 ・일정과 내용을 꼭 확인해주세요.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Mito Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (8/3) is Mito's birthday!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Mito's birthday on August 3.\nLet's all celebrate Mito's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n8/3 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
