    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Get Mito's stamp and Medals of Combat Arts! The \"Intensive Training Event VS Mito\" is here!\nEVENT\n2025-08-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nIn celebration of Mito's birthday, the \"\nIntensive Training Event VS Mito\n\" will be held!\nClear the intensive training with Mito every day and get Medals of Combat Arts!\nThe extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight Mito going all out, is on now! The recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nRewards\nMedals of Combat Arts\nand a\nlimited-edition Mito stamp\nare available as rewards!\nClear the regular and extremely difficult Serious Match dungeons once a day to get a total of 15 Medals of Combat Arts!\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nAfter School\nMemory Stamp 343\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nAugust 1, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - August 8, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nRegular Dungeon\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMemory Stamp 343\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nGlare Dragon Stone\n50\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1200\nGlare Dragon Stone\n100\n1400\nRecord Frame L\n100\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-07-31T19:00:00+00:00",
