    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/30)\nMAINT.\n2025-07-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/30, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 7/30, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Agil Summer Festival 2025\" begins\n\"[Returning] Will of Steel to Catch the King\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Heat the Beach!\"\nAdded \"Fenrir Attack! 2025\" Event rewards\n\"11 Free Once Daily-Agil Guaranteed Order\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the expanded equipment set slots were not functioning properly\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n7/30, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Agil Summer Festival 2025\" begins\n\"[Returning] Will of Steel to Catch the King\" is back\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Heat the Beach!\"\nAdded \"Fenrir Attack! 2025\" Event rewards\n\"11 Free Once Daily-Agil Guaranteed Order\" begins\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
