    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/25)\nMAINT.\n2025-06-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/25, 2025, 12:00, was completed on 6/25, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Market\" and \"Bank\" added\n\"Underground Labyrinth B6F\" Installed\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Rush VS Genie\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAlong with the addition of the Market, the \"View Mode\" and \"VR Mode\" buttons have been moved to the top of the menu screen.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where HP did not recover when entering Lisbeth's Smith Shop.\nFixed an issue where some monsters would not perform any actions.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out rewards for correct answers to the quiz corner on the official livestream on 6/20, 2025.\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter L×10\nReceive by: Until 7/2, 2025 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n6/25, 2025 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Market\" and \"Bank\" added\n\"Underground Labyrinth B6F\" Installed\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Rush VS Genie\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 6/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 60\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Golden Colossus Hunt 2025\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"[Returning] Bride's dress is with a Smile\"\n\"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
