    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Rain Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-06-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (6/21) is Rain's birthday!\nIn celebration of Rain's birthday, we have sent 《250 Arcana Gems》 and a 《Memory Stamp》 to your present box.\nLet's all celebrate Rain's birthday together!\n- Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n6/21 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Receive by date (Memory Stamp)\n6/30 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
