    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Argo Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (6/5) is Argo's birthday!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Argo's birthday on June 5.\nLet's all celebrate Argo's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n6/5 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
