    "news_date": 1749024000,
    "news_category": "Campaign",
    "snippet": "홀리데이 캠페인! 이 캠페인 동안 다중 라운드 캐릭터 퀘스트에서 7배의 경험치를 얻으세요! 플레이어 레벨을 쉽게 올릴 수 있는 기회입니다!  이벤트 시작 상인 지구의 게시판에서 캐릭터 퀘스트를 수락하세요.  참여조건 1F 메인퀘스트를 끝까지 클리어하세요.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2025-06-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nDuring this campaign, get\n7x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the June 4, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 11, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the x7 value.\nx7 EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-06-03T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-06-10T19:00:00+00:00"
