    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ocean Heroes Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-06-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Klein, Leafa, and Sinon struggle upon blazing ships in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nOcean Heroes Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Crimson Deck] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nIndiscreet Heat\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n13\nSkill Effect\n1570% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Blazing Shipwreck] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Storm\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Hero Jumps Aboard] Leafa\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAir Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nAir Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Scorching Arrow] Sinon\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Air Flow/Back Up\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Air Flow 3] Adds a buff (Wind Pile) where wind damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)/[Back Up 3] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Blazing Shipwreck] Klein\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 1, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - June 30, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
