    "news_date": 1746691200,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "\"모노노케 습격\"에서 몬스터 무리가 공격합니다! 일정 시간이 지나면 보스 몬스터가 등장합니다. 수많은 몬스터들을 몰아내고 엄청난 경험치를 획득하세요!  보상 수많은 경험치와 경험치를 획득하는 데 사용할 수 있는 \"경험치 크리스탈\" 외에도 \"아르카나 보석\", \"콤바 메달\"을 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Mononoke Assault\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of monsters!\nEVENT\n2025-05-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHordes of monsters attack in the \"Mononoke Assault\"!\nAfter a certain amount of time passes, the boss monster will appear.\nDrive off hordes of monsters and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nRewards\nIn addition to tons of EXP and the \"Exp Crystals\" you can use to gain EXP, you can get \"Arcana Gems\", \"Medals of Combat Arts\", \"Awakening Stars\" to awaken Skill Records, \"Memoria Niter S\" to Limit Break Skill Records, and much more!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster \"Utsuroubou the Pretender\" will drop Star Fragments.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrader Rewards\nGet various rewards from Total Score Rewards and by trading the \"Orange Mononoke Plate\" from the event at the Trader.\n\"Pink Mononoke Plate\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the May 14, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on May 21, 2025 (Wed).\nTrade \"Orange Mononoke Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nExp Crystal L\n100\n20\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n30\nTrade \"Pink Mononoke Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nExp Crystal L\n100\n15\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n20\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n6P\n21P\n21P\n360P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 200,000 or higher\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nPremium\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nPremium\n\" 1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nSpecial\n\"\nThe \"\nSpecial\n\" difficult is a \"Field with some unusable items,\" where certain items cannot be used and players cannot revive.\nMonsters other than the boss also have the same weaknesses and resistances as the boss.\nOf all the difficulties eligible for a Total Score Reward, these dungeons award the highest scores.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×45\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nExp Crystal L×75\nExp Crystal M×70\nExp Crystal S×80\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nMononoke\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Orange Mononoke Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nSpirit Exorcism\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Orange Mononoke Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Assault Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the May 8, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the May 28, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the May 14, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nOrange Mononoke Plate: Starts after the May 8, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the June 4, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nPink Mononoke Plate: Starts after the May 14, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 4, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nUtsuroubou the Pretender\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict \"Petrify\", \"Curse\" and \"Bloodshed\".\nOn \"Maniac\", \"Special\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nExcept Expert\nSlash Element\nDark Element\nExpert\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nResistance\nSpecial\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nCritical\nExpert\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Petrify\", \"Curse\" and \"Bloodshed\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments,\" please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments.\"\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Utsuroubou the Pretender\" will keep appearing until time is up, even after it has been defeated.\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"Orange Mononoke Plates\" and \"Pink Mononoke Plates\" will be deleted on June 4, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
