    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/8)\nMAINT.\n2025-05-07 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 5/8, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 5/8, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 59 begins\n\"Mononoke Assault\" begins\nAdded \"Unital King Incredible Foreigner\" Event rewards\n\"Dragon-Style Heir Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n5/8, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 59 begins\n\"Mononoke Assault\" begins\nAdded \"Unital King Incredible Foreigner\" Event rewards\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 5/8 Maintenance\n\"Birthday Battle Rush: Otherworldly Bonds\"\n\"Dominant Hunt\"\n\"Fatal Battle: Crossgigas\"\n\"2025 Early Summer Fishing Competition\"\n\"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\"\n\"The East-West Showdown: Eastern Japan Federation VS Western Japan Alliance\"\n\"Fluffy Bunny Panic\"\n\"All Together! IF Kindergarten\"\n\"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\"\n\"Jumping Kibaou\"\n\"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\"\n\"Kiritoland is Open!\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
