    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 사용자 여러분께 알려드립니다. 아래 기간 동안 점검이 진행됩니다.  점검 예정일 2025년 4월 30일 13:00 ~ 17:00(예정)(JST/UTC+9) ▼새로 구현된 신규 이벤트 \"길드 배틀 도전 VS 끈끈한 것\"이 \"치명전...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/30)\nMAINT.\n2025-04-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/30, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild Battle Challenge VS Sticky Thing\" begins\n\"Fatal Battle: Crossgigas\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Unital King Incredible Foreigner\"\nAdded \"Dominant Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/30 Maintenance\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" Season 58\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
