    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/4359.html",
    "news_date": 1745395200,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "★4 신규 스킬 레코드로 크고 검은 날개를 지닌 키리토, 아스나, 코하루, 시논이 등장! \"블랙 레이븐 오더\"가 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 총 드롭률 6%에는 보장된 ★4 스킬 레코드가 포함되어 있지 않으며, 신규 ★4 스킬 레코드에는 높은 등급의 스킬 레코드가 포함되어 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Black Raven Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-04-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Koharu, and Sinon appear with large, dark wings as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBlack Raven Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Blackwing Ace] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blackwing Guardian] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Force 4/Buff] Dark element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Jet Black Wings] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Heat\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2080% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 15 sec (Stack 5) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Flame Force 5/Buff (PT)] Fire element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Watcher in Black] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nTerror Shock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Blackwing Guardian] Asuna\", \"[Jet Black Wings] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 23, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 21, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
