    "full_details": "Notices\nLLENN Birthday Celebration! Including a Memory Stamp Gift!\nCampaign\n2025-04-20 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAs of April 20, 2025 (Wed) at 0：00, we will be sending out a free Memory Stamp in celebration of LLENN's birthday!\nThis item will be delivered to your \"Gifts\" when you log in during the time period.\n-Stamp Present\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nMemory Stamp 330\n-Period of Availability\nApril 20, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - April 29 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n※Please note that this schedule is subject to change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
