    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 사용자 여러분께 알려드립니다. 아래 기간 동안 점검이 진행됩니다.  점검 예정일 2025년 4월 16일 14:00 ~ 17:00 (예정)(JST/UTC+9) ▼새로 구현된 & 신규 이벤트 '길드 오브 길드' 시즌 58 시작 '지배력 사냥' 시작 추가...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/16)\nMAINT.\n2025-04-15 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/16, 2025, 14:00, was completed on 4/16, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 58 begins\n\"Dominant Hunt\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Birthday Battle Rush: Otherworldy Bonds\"\nAdded \"The East-West Showdown\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Full Burst Step-Up Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where tapping the chat menu tab opened the text input screen\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 4/23, 2025, the guild room will no longer be themed for spring.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/16, 2025 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 58 begins\n\"Dominant Hunt\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Birthday Battle Rush: Otherworldy Bonds\"\nAdded \"The East-West Showdown\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Ring Production Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/16 Maintenance\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
