    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Devilish Soldier Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-03-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Eugeo, Argo, and Lisbeth are draped in dark, refined combat outfits as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nDevilish Soldier Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Aerial Dance] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Spark\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n22.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Hands down 4/Buff] 60 sec, the critical rate will increase a little, the higher the Max HP is./▲▲[Bonus] Increase in break gauge to thrust element enemies by +30%./[Bonus] During the buff effect for increased max HP, all the stack buffs on yourself will be reduced -10 (Cannot fall below 1).\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tornado Sword Dance] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Abundance/Back Up\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Abundance 3] Adds a buff (Earth Pile) where earth damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)/[Back Up 2] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Alice's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Earth element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Permeating Dance] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSwift Petal\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1930% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Poison Boost 5/Debuff] Lowers enemy's poison resistance 75% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Poison) and poison damage +100%./[Frostbite Boost 5/Debuff] Lowers enemy's frostbite resistance 75% for 30 sec (easier to inflict frostbite) and frostbite damage +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 2 → 4 → 6 on enemies when using earth skills.\n★4[Armed Dance] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHeat Stamp\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n78\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Permeating Dance] Argo\", \"[Armed Dance] Lisbeth\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the March 5, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - April 8, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
