    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/5)\nMAINT.\n2025-03-04 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/5, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 3/5, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 57 begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\" begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2025\" begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Devilish Soldier Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Teleport Gate Plaza maps have been changed for White Day\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/5, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 57 begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\" begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault 2025\" begins\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/5 Maintenance\n\"Time Trailblazer Order\"\n\"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\"\n\"Bitter Chocolate Road\"\n\"Intensive Training Event VS Nautilus\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
