    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Intensive Training Event VS Nautilus\" is on now! Get an avatar of Ain, the Ordinal Scale mascot, in addition to tons of Medals of Combat Arts!\nEVENT\n2025-02-18 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event VS Nautilus\n\" is on now!\nDressed like Eiji, Nautilus has arrived at the Teleport Gate Plaza!\nDon't miss a single day of intensive training with Nautilus! You can get an accessory avatar of Ain, the Ordinal Scale mascot, in addition to tons of Medals of Combat Arts!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAin Doll\nAccessory Avatar\nAvatar Images\nRewards\nYou can clear both the regular and extremely difficult Serious Match dungeons once a day and get rewards for each daily.\nGet the Ain Doll by clearing day 5 of the regular dungeon and day 1 of the Serious Match!\nEarn up to 30 Medals of Combat Arts by clearing both difficulties!\nExtremely Difficult Serious Matches\nBattle a full-strength Nautilus in this fight that has a recommended Total Power of 250,000.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Nautilus\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nFebruary 18, 2025 (Tue) 4:00 - Before the March 5, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nRegular Dungeon\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nAin Doll\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nAin Doll\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n3200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
