    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sachi's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!\nShop\n2025-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sachi's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Freshly Baked Charm] Sachi\n(Chain Skill)\" and \"\n[Power Beyond Peril] Sachi\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSachi's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sachi guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sachi\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Freshly Baked Charm] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nStorm Shaft\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n2660% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Power Beyond Peril] Sachi\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Assault Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Assault\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Thrust→\nDark\n→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n94\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 4/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +25% for 10 sec./[Dark Force 4/Buff] Dark element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Shadow Demon 5/Buff] Dark element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Freshly Baked Charm] Sachi\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nFebruary 11, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - February 20, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Sachi\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sachi\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
