    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "책에 둘러싸여 열심히 공부하는 유우키, 아스나, 시리카, 유지오의 신작 ★4 스킬 레코드! \"학업 성취 명령\"이 나왔습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 신규 추천 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250 아르카나 젬에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Academic Achievement Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-01-15 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Asuna, Silica, and Eugeo study hard as they're surrounded by books in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAcademic Achievement Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Carrying the Desired World] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Scar\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1660% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 5 → 10 → 15 stacks for buffs that increase defense that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n★4[Poise of a Bookish Girl] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nStorm Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nStorm Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Thrust→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1760% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4850% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fumbled and Fell] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nStorm Converge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n2470% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 when using wind skills while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Avid Reader] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nEnhance Thrust/Gale Blade/Prosper/Accelerated Healing\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Thrust 4] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +24%./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Accelerated Healing 4] Recovers a max of 4% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Fumbled and Fell] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the January 15, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - February 10, 2025 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
