    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Happy New Year Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-01-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Sanya, Leafa, and Koharu are dressed in festive clothing to kick off the New Year as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nHappy New Year Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[New Year's Victory] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Dark Boost\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Dark Boost 4] Elemental damage other than dark dealt to enemies -50%, and dark element's damage to enemies +40%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Sound of Divine Spirits] Sanya\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nInk Rush Burst\nSkill Name\nInk Rush\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→\nDark\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nBreak Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n72\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2030% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4800% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical damage +150% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Peaceful New Year] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Ice\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[New Year's Resolution] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPetal Gong\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n68\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Sound of Divine Spirits] Sanya\", \"[Peaceful New Year] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJanuary 1, 2025 (Wed) 0:00 - January 31, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
