    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Increased Core Metal+++ Drop Rate Campaign is here! Now is your chance to transform the Rosso Integral Series and higher!\nCampaign\n2024-12-25 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nFor a limited time, drop rates have been increased for Core Metal+++, used as a production material for the Stone+++ needed to transform the Rosso Integral Series and higher!\nCore Metal+++ drop rate increased for All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper] and [Aincrad]!\nUse this chance to enjoy the All Out Battle!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the December 25, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nApplicable dungeons\n・75F All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper]\n・100F All Out Battle [Aincrad]\n* Drop rates for Core Metal+++ are set to be higher in the All Out Battle [Aincrad].\nRosso Integral Series (Required Level 161)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nRosso Forneus\n1H Sword\n1862\nRosso Dominion\n1H Rapier\n1827\nRosso Albatross\n1H Club\n1862\nRosso Twilight\n2H Axe\n2167\nRosso Greed\n2H Spear\n2127\nRosso Sigrun\nBow\n2087\nRosso Rhapsody\nDagger\n1827\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nYasha Integral Series (Required Level 181)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nAstaroth\n1H Sword\n2076\nPrincipality\n1H Rapier\n2037\nPorcupine\n1H Club\n2076\nMonsoon\n2H Axe\n2429\nEnvy\n2H Spear\n2384\nReginleifr\nBow\n2339\nOratorio\nDagger\n2037\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nGaou Integral Series (Required Level 201)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities\nGaou Astaroth\n1H Sword\nAttack 2290\nGaou Principality\n1H Rapier\nAttack 2247\nGaou Porcupine\n1H Club\nAttack 2290\nGaou Monsoon\n2H Axe\nAttack 2690\nGaou Envy\n2H Spear\nAttack 2641\nGaou Reginleifr\nBow\nAttack 2591\nGaou Oratorio\nDagger\nAttack 2247\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nMachina Integral Series (Required Level 221)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities\nOtius\n1H Sword\nAttack 2504\nVirtue\n1H Rapier\nAttack 2457\nMudskipper\n1H Club\nAttack 2504\nEl Nino\n2H Axe\nAttack 2952\nLust\n2H Spear\nAttack 2898\nTanngnidr\nBow\nAttack 2843\nCadenza\nDagger\nAttack 2457\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nGale Integral Series (Required Level 241)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4Capabilities\nGale Otius\n1H Sword\nAttack 2638\nGale Virtue\n1H Rapier\nAttack 2588\nGale Mudskipper\n1H Club\nAttack 2638\nGale El Nino\n2H Axe\nAttack 3132\nGale Lust\n2H Spear\nAttack 3074\nGale Tanngnidr\nBow\nAttack 3017\nGale Cadenza\nDagger\nAttack 2588\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★4 rarity, Lv. 80.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
