    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/18)\nMAINT.\n2024-12-17 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 12/18, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 12/18, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 54 begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Nine-Life Snake\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Ringlings for Christmas\"\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdding\n154\nnew hair colors\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for winter\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixing an issue where the switch gauge did not increase properly\nFixing an issue where the icon indicating MOD Skills was not displayed on the equipment screen\nFixing an issue when healing plants reappear where the models may not display correctly\nFixing an issue when opening some treasure boxes where a destruction effect was displayed\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n12/18, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 54 begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Battle Challenge VS Nine-Life Snake\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Ringlings for Christmas\"\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 12/18 Maintenance\n\"GGO Squad Jumble Order\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
