    "snippet": "이 거룩한 밤에 즐거운 선물과 미소를 잔뜩 가져오세요! 유이, 아스나, 앨리스, 시논이 신규 ★4 스킬 레코드로 등장! \"즐거운 선물 주문\"이 왔습니다! 5단계에서 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록 1개를 보장받으세요! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250 아르칸으로 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Joyful Present Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-12-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nBring loads of joyful presents and smiles to this holy night! Yui, Asuna, Alice, and Sinon are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nJoyful Present Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Snow Globe of Memories] Yui\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Thrust/Dark Conversion/Valiant\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Thrust 4] Attack +40% when attacking with thrust element./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Valiant 3] When equipping 3 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +300\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wrapped In Happiness] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Linear\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ring the Sacred Bell] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nArdent Ripper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nFire damage +50% when using fire skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise fire damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Boldly and Head-On] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nNight Blast-Shot Burst\nSkill Name\nNight Blast-Shot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→(\nFire\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Wrapped In Happiness] Asuna\", \"[Ring the Sacred Bell] Alice\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 11, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
