    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/11)\nMAINT.\n2024-12-10 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 12/11, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 12/11, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 54 begins\n\"Ringlings for Christmas\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Joyful Present Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixing an issue where hints for past Riddle Quests were sometimes displayed\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\nAs of the next scheduled maintenance on 12/18, 2024, the guild room will no longer be themed for Holiday Campaign.\nIf you haven't visited yet, please go see the autumn theme while you still can and enjoy taking pictures with your guild members.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n12/11, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 54 begins\n\"Ringlings for Christmas\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 12/11 Maintenance\n\"Tonight's Storyteller Order\"\n\"The Way of the Swordsmen\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
