    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/4060.html",
    "news_date": 1732820400,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "캐릭터 성장을 돕는 육성 던전이 등장했습니다!  시논과 함께 스킬 레코드 강화와 변신 재료가 가득한 던전에 도전해보세요! 스킬 레코드를 강화하기 위해 많은 재료를 모으십시오.  보상 스킬 레코드 강화 아이템인 레코드 프레임 L과 트랜스미션을 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Get Skill Record enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Skills with Sinon\"\nEVENT\n2024-11-29 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nJoin Sinon and take on a dungeon filled with Skill Record enhancement and transformation materials!\nGather lots of materials to power up your Skill Record.\nRewards\nYou can get the Skill Record enhancement item Record Frame L and the transformation items Record Kit M, Record Kit S, all kinds of High Jewels, and all kinds of Jewels,\nas well as the awakening items Awakening Star and all kinds of Great Jewels.\nMonster Drop Items\nAwakening Star\nRed Jewel,  High Red Jewel, Great Red Jewel\nGreen Jewel, High Green Jewel, Great Green Jewel\nYellow Jewel, High Yellow Jewel, Great Yellow Jewel\nBlue Jewel, High Blue Jewel, Great Blue Jewel\nRecord Kit S, Record Kit M\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Sinon\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nNovember 29, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - December 6, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Skills with Sinon\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n25\nAwakening Star\n5\n50\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n75\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n100\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n125\nHigh Blue Jewel\n10\n150\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n175\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n200\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n225\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n250\nAwakening Star\n5\n275\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n300\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n325\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n350\nHigh Blue Jewel\n10\n375\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n400\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n425\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n450\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n475\nAwakening Star\n5\n500\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n525\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n550\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n575\nHigh Blue Jewel\n10\n600\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n625\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n650\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n675\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n700\nAwakening Star\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Kit M\n2\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame L\n20\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Sinon as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
