    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 사용자 여러분께 알려드립니다. 아래 기간 동안 점검이 진행됩니다.  점검 예정일 2024년 11월 29일 11:00 ~ 17:00 (예정)(JST/UTC+9) [11/28 22:15 (JST/UTC+9) 업데이트] ▼새롭게 구현된 & 새로운 이벤트 스위치의 광란...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[11/28 22:15 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Notice for maintenance(11/29)\nMAINT.\n2024-11-28 22:15:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/29, 2024 11:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n[11/28 22:15 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nA wild frenzy of switches and counters! \"Chain Skill\" are here\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 19F\"\nAdded The 2nd \"Squad Jumble\" Event rewards\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Holiday Campaign! Panel Mission\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/29 Maintenance\n\"Six Goddesses Descend Underworld Order\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
