    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Klein Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2024-11-28 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Klein's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Klein's birthday on November 28.\nLet's celebrate Klein's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until November 28, 2024 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
