    "snippet": "보스 주괴 드랍률 UP 캠페인이 진행 중입니다!  보스 주괴 제작에 필요한 금속 스크랩의 드롭률이 기간 한정으로 증가합니다! 파티와 협력하여 금속 조각을 수집하세요!  메인보스 주괴 던전에서는 입장보다 내부에서 드랍율이 높게 설정되어 있습니다.  캄파...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6.5 Year Anniversary] The \"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" is here! Increased drop rate for Metal Scraps needed to produce Boss Ingots!\nCampaign\n2024-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign is on now!\nThe drop rate for Metal Scraps needed to produce Boss Ingots is increased for a limited time!\nWork with your party and collect Metal Scraps!\nMain Boss Ingots\nIn the dungeons, the drop rate is set higher for Interior than in Entry.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the November 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 20, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
