    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Strea's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Strea!\nShop\n2024-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Strea's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Grateful Embrace] Strea\n\" and \"\n[No Guarantees Afterwards] Strea\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nStrea's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Strea guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Strea\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Grateful Embrace] Strea\nSkill Name\nCybermind/Enhance Slash/Inflict Burn\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Cybermind 2] Attack rises 7% x the number of Yui Skill Records in the same set./[Enhance Slash 3] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%./[Inflict Burn] When the target is hit using the Switch, inflict Burn (Stack 5) for 30 sec. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[No Guarantees Afterwards] Strea\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nLightning Scar\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1630% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 5 → 10 → 15 stacks for buffs that increase defense that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nNovember 6, 2024 (Wed) 0:00 - November 15, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Strea\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Strea\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice production when ★4 \"Strea\" Skill Records are drawn.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
