    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Life of Leisure Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-11-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Argo, Sinon, and Agil do as they please in a dreamlike palace in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nLife of Leisure Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Teahouse Darling] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Shear\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1660% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Inscribed Classified Info] Argo\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Aqua Boost\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Sweeping Fantasy View] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Impact Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Impact\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n62\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Late Autumn Feasting] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nLightning Revolver\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n78\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n2030% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Anticlimax 4/Buff] The greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nNovember 1, 2024 (Fri) 0:00 - November 30, 2024 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
