    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 사용자 여러분께 알려드립니다. 아래 기간 동안 점검이 진행됩니다.  점검 예정일 2024년 10월 30일 13:00 ~ 17:00 (예정)(JST/UTC+9) ▼신규 구현 및 신규 이벤트 \"치명적인 낫 사냥\" 시작 \"빛나는 눈 사냥\" 이벤트 추가...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/30)\nMAINT.\n2024-10-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/30, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 10/30, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Fatal Scythe Hunt\" begins\nAdded \"Gleam Eyes Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the return location when defeated at the Chaos Showdown to the area in front of the Chaos Showdown NPC\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/30, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Fatal Scythe Hunt\" begins\nAdded \"Gleam Eyes Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"IF Halloween Party Trick or Treasure!\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/30 Maintenance\nThe 1st \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
