    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/23)\nMAINT.\n2024-10-22 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/23, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 10/23, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Underground Labyrinth B5F\" Installed\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Gleam Eyes Hunt\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixing an issue where new notifications appear continuously under certain conditions\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/23, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Underground Labyrinth B5F\" Installed\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Gleam Eyes Hunt\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/23 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 52\n\"Mist Soul Hunt\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
