    "snippet": "SWORD ART ONLINE 프로그레시브: 깊은 밤의 스케르초 영화 개봉 2주년을 축하합니다! 키리토, 아스나, 아르고, 미토가 신규 ★4 스킬 레코드로 등장! \"빛나는 배너 주문\"이 왔습니다! 5단계에서 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록 1개를 보장받으세요! 신규 요금 인상…",
    "full_details": "Notices\nCelebrating the two-year anniversary of the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie! The \"Illuminating Banner Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-10-17 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe're celebrating the two-year anniversary of the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie!\nKirito, Asuna, Argo, and Mito are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nIlluminating Banner Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Proof of Leadership] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm Bite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1540% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Gale Demon 3/Buff] Wind element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Under the Flag of Faith] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Nova\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n23\nSkill Effect\n1790% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\nReduces all skill's cool times by 2 → 4 → 6 sec when hitting with  dark skills.\n★4[Proclamation of Domination] Argo\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Mallet Blow/Enhance Frostbite\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./●[Enhance Frostbite 4] Frostbite damage -50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Another Way to Fight] Mito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nShadow Flip Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Flip\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1610% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Death Mark/Debuff] Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4430% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the thrust element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Under the Flag of Faith] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the October 17, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nThere is no voice when ★4 Mito's Burst is activated.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
