    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 '별 없는 밤의 아리아 IF'가 돌아왔습니다!  별 없는 밤의 아리아 IF 2021년 소드 아트 온라인 프로그레시브 영화 별 없는 밤의 아리아 개봉 기념 시나리오 이벤트! 영화에 등장한 미토가 시나리오 퀘스트와 던전을 함께 동행합니다.  미토의 과학을 보상으로...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nMito's Scythe-User's Clothes costume avatar has been added to the rewards! Aria of a Starless Night IF is back! Get limited-edition ★3 Skill Records, stamps, Ingots, and more!\nEVENT\n2024-10-17 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" is back!\nAria of a Starless Night IF\nA scenario event celebrating the 2021 SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie!\nMito\n, who appeared in the movie, will accompany you through the scenario quests and dungeons.\nRewards\nMito's Scythe-User's Clothes costume avatar has been added to the trader rewards as of the event's return on October 17, 2024 (Thu)!\nThis is another chance to get the previously limited Scythe-User's Clothes!\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nGet a ★3 Big Mysterious Man Skill Record, Memory Stamps for Kirito and Asuna, and I. Glutton Metal Scraps that can be used to produce the limited-edition I. Glutton Ingot!\nExchange the \"Glutton Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 75\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 15\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nI. Glutton Metal Scraps can be obtained from the scenario quest, Total Score Rewards, and the Trader, and can also drop from monsters in all difficulty levels of the dungeon.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nAvatar\nAvatar Image\nSkill Record\n★3[Assault] Big Mysterious Man\nSkill Name\nAttack Up/Battle Healing\nAttack\n31\nDefense\n28\nHP\n1925\nSkill effect\n[Attack Up 3] Attack +56./[Battle Healing 3] Recovers HP 30 every 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLimited-edition Ingot\nIngots\nItem effect\nI. Glutton Ingot\nPositive Effect:Fire skill weakness damage +10% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than fire\n* An 《Ingot》's positive effect is registered when \"Composition\" reaches the max level.\n* Since the \"increased Fire skill weakness damage\" effect of the \"I. Glutton Ingot\" is not stackable, it will not stack with \"Demon God Flame Ingot\", which has the same effect.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nProgressive Kirito\nProgressive Asuna\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\" and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:2280P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n2400\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\nTrade \"Yellow Glutton Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nScythe-User's Clothes\n400\n1\n★3[Assault] Big Mysterious Man\n400\n1\nI. Glutton Metal Scrap\n50\n10\nMemory Stamp 183\nUse to obtain the \"Progressive Asuna\" stamp.\n150\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n4\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n4\nTrade \"Green Glutton Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\n★3[Assault] Big Mysterious Man\n400\n1\nI. Glutton Metal Scrap\n50\n10\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n3\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n3\nTrader Period\nStarts after the October 17, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 20, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the high-difficulty dungeon \"\nExtreme\n\" is restricted, and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used once.\nThe high-difficulty dungeon \"\nExtreme\n\" has a Recommended Total Power of 120,000. The boss has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★3[Assault] Big Mysterious Man×9\nI. Glutton Metal Scrap×38\nArcana Gems×600\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nProgressive\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Yellow Glutton Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nAria of a Starless Night\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Yellow Glutton Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nInitiation Facing\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Green Glutton Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Event Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 17, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nIndiscriminate Glutton\nDetails\nIt has giant ivy on its body.\nIt attacks players in the dungeon, inflicting them with Stun and Poison.\nIn the dungeon, when its HP goes below a certain amount, its weapon elemental weaknesses will change.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nFire Element\n↓\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nEarth Element\n↓\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Stun\" and \"Poison\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★3 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter M\".\nIf you have previously played the \"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nPlates will be deleted on November 20, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-10-16T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-11-12T19:00:00+00:00"
