    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/17)\nMAINT.\n2024-10-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/17, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 10/17, 2024, 17:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:10/23/2024(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 52 begins\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" is back\nAdded The 1st \"Squad Jumble\" Event rewards\nAdded \"Mist Soul Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Illuminating Banner Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixing the issue where characters became unable to move after moving to another area\nFixing an issue where, after matching in \"Squad Jumble,\" the screen would freeze during the transition to the battlefield, causing the party to disband and players to be returned to the Teleport Gate Plaza\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/17, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 52 begins\n\"Aria of a Starless Night IF\" is back\nAdded The 1st \"Squad Jumble\" Event rewards\nAdded \"Mist Soul Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/17 Maintenance\n\"Paint Out Order\"\n\"72F Start Dash Event\"\n\"Heapin' 30M EXP Event\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
