    "full_details": "Notices\nCelebrating the broadcast of the anime series Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online II! The \"Photon Series Avatar Order\" is here! One Photon Series avatar guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-10-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate the broadcast of the Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online II anime, we've turned the photon sword, which wreaked havoc in the world of Gun Gale Online, into an avatar!\nThe \"\nPhoton Series Avatar Order\n\" is on!\nIn addition to the \"Photon Sword\" 1H Sword, it contains Photon Series avatars like SAOIF original 1H Rapiers, 1H Clubs, and Daggers!\nWhat's more, each Weapon Avatar has seven color variants!\nOn top of it all, one Photon Series avatar is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n* The Photon Series Avatar Order also includes avatars that are not in the Photon Series.\n[Photon Series Avatar]\n[Other Avatars in the Lineup (Partial Introduction)]\n・Cheer Squad Avatar\n・Puppet Master Avatar\n・Cyber Dimension Avatar\n・Resplendent Avatar\nand more.\nAvatar Images\n- Duration\nOctober 5, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - December 31, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nWeapon avatars will only display when they match with the weapon type you have equipped.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nFaces and hairstyles are not included in this Order.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
