    "snippet": "★4 스킬 레코드는 모두 \"액셀 스킬\"입니다! \"Accel Step-Up 명령\"이 왔습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! 추가적으로 3단계에서는 ★4 액셀 스킬 1개 보장!  자세한 액셀 스킬 정보는 여기에서 확인하세요 【일부 ★4 스킬 기록】 ★4[Scorching Ice Strike] Eugeo스킬 이름강화 ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Accele Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-08-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Accele Skills\"!\nThe \"\nAccele Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Accele Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Scorching Ice Strike] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Aqua Boost/Tailwind\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 5] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Girl in Black] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Loiter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] Enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Beast Girl in Full Bloom] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Pain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9)./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When hitting with this skill while using switch, own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 9).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends on September 6, 2024 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nOne ★4 Accele Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
