    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Future Meeting Key Visual Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-08-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito and Asuna are here from the Future Meeting 2024: Departure key visuals, along with Kirito from the \"Secret Key Visual,\" as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFuture Meeting Key Visual Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nAlso, by Transforming \"★4[Crystallized Thoughts] Kirito\" to ★5, not only will you get the usual Memoria Niter L from Achievements, you can also get the Secret Strategy Sword Weapon Avatar!\nBe sure to Transform him if you get him!\n* Two different Achievements have been prepared for the Secret Strategy Sword and the Memoria Niter L.\nYou can get the Secret Strategy Sword via the \"Transform [Crystallized Thoughts] Kirito\" Achievement.\nAcquiring the Secret Strategy Sword will complete the \"Obtain the Secret Strategy Sword.\" Achievement, allowing you to get the Memoria Niter L.\nAvatar Images\nItem Name\nType\nSecret Strategy Sword\n1H Sword Avatar\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Aiming for the Future] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Scar\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1900% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 5 → 10 → 15 stacks for buffs that increase defense that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n★4[Beyond the Light] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nAqua Viper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n2130% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Crystallized Thoughts] Kirito\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Light Magic/Icy Blade\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Light Magic 4] DEF increase with own level ×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Aiming for the Future] Kirito\", \"[Beyond the Light] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the September 11, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
