    "snippet": "\"Wonder Animal Assault 2024\"에서 LafCof 회원들의 무리가 공격합니다! 수많은 LafCof 회원을 몰아내고 엄청난 경험치를 획득하세요!  보상 수많은 경험치와 경험치 획득에 사용할 수 있는 \"경험치 결정체\" 외에도 스킬 회복을 각성시키는 \"아르카나 보석\", \"전투 예술 메달\", \"각성 별\"을 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"LafCof Assault\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of LafCof members!\nEVENT\n2024-08-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHordes of LafCof members attack in the \"Wonder Animal Assault 2024\"!\nDrive off hordes of LafCof members and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nRewards\nIn addition to tons of EXP and the \"Exp Crystals\" you can use to gain EXP, you can get \"Arcana Gems\", \"Medals of Combat Arts\", \"Awakening Stars\" to awaken Skill Records, \"Memoria Niter S\" to Limit Break Skill Records, and much more!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that \"PoH\" will drop Star Fragments.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Red LafCof Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Blue LafCof Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the August 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on August 28, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Red LafCof Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nExp Crystal L\n100\n20\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n30\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Blue LafCof Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nExp Crystal L\n100\n15\nExp Crystal M\n50\n20\nExp Crystal S\n30\n20\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nRed LafCof Plate: Starts after the August 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the September 11, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue LafCof Plate: Starts after the August 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 11, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n6P\n21P\n21P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"Premium\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Premium\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Premium\"\n1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×45\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nExp Crystal L×75\nExp Crystal M×70\nExp Crystal S×80\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCharisma of Evil\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red LafCof Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nQuivering Nightmare\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red LafCof Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Assault Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the September 4, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the August 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss\nPoH\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict you with Paralysis and Curse.\nOn \"Maniac\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nEvery time a player is attacked, the stack buffs that increase attack and defense are added to all LafCof members in the area.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nCritical\nBuffs used\nStack buff \"Increase Attack\" and \"Increase Decrease\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus Ailments \"Paralysis\" and \"Curse\"\nDebuff \"Seal Item\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\nPlates will be deleted on September 11, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-08-14T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-09-03T19:00:00+00:00"
