    "full_details": "Notices\nTwo ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 24% ★4 Skill Record Rate! The \"Evening Breeze Grab Bag 2024 Order\" is here!\nShop\n2024-08-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet\ntwo ★4 Skill Records guaranteed\nat the \"Evening Breeze Grab Bag 2024 Order\"!\nThe\n24% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Idol Mode] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRed Pulsar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +30% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Refreshing Grape Soda] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Boost/Stagehand\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Stagehand 4] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Midday Fruit Parfait] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n1750% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Journey of the Ocean Deep] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Gunner's Song] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGround Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n43\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Ironclad Business Spirit] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGale Split\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n29\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Gust 4/Buff] Attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Poolside at the Resort] Argo\nSkill Name\nKing of Daggers/Poisonous Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[King of Daggers 3] Attack +1000 when using daggers./[Poisonous Blow 4] Attack +24% against poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAugust 10, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - August 19, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
