    "full_details": "Notices\n[7 Huge Campaigns!] Presents on the 7th of each month chosen by posts on X! This time, a \"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\" is here!\nShop\n2024-08-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n7 huge campaigns!\nWe're holding a campaign based on voting results of a poll posted by @saoif_gameinfo on X (formerly Twitter)!\nEveryone will have one try at the \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\"!\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Toward Tomorrow] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nWater Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\n→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1910% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4480% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP32)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Two Powers at Work Together] Silica\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[High Battle Healing 3]Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Descending Deity] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFlame Turbine\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n1010% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Take Aim] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Plasma\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using water skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Water element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - August 27, 2024 (Tue) 11:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nThis 11 Order can only be used once per player.\nThere is no single Order.\nIncludes ★2–★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
