    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Elegant Summer Night Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-08-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Asuna, Kirito, and Koharu enjoy summer festivals at night in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nElegant Summer Night Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Big Flowers in the Sky] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nNight Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n2110% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Flowers in the Night Sky] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Shower Burst\nSkill Name\nNight Shower\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Always Get What You Want] Kirito\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Thrust/Dark Conversion\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Thrust 3] Attack +35% when attacking with thrust element./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Sweet Summer Memories] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nLight Up Swing\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n1520% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[Big Flowers in the Sky] Alice\", \"[Flowers in the Night Sky] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 4, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
