    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Mito Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2024-08-03 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Mito's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Mito's birthday on August 3.\nLet's celebrate Mito's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until August 3, 2024 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
