    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yui's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yui!\nShop\n2024-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yui's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[The View From Here] Yui\n\" and \"\n[Death-Destroying Blade] Yui\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYui's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yui guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yui\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The View From Here] Yui\nSkill Name\nHellfire/Super Enhance Heal/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Hellfire 4] Attack rises 7% x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[High Battle Healing 4] Recovers a max of 1.5% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Death-Destroying Blade] Yui\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Shear Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Shear\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Slash→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Death-Destroying Blade] Yui\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAugust 1, 2024 (Thu) 0:00 - August 10, 2024 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yui\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yui\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
