    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Great Enhancement Event VS Agil\" is here! Get attack-buffing items!\nEVENT\n2024-07-31 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nTake down Agil and get useful items for battle!\nThe \"\nGreat Enhancement Event  VS Agil\n\" will begin.\nThe extremely difficult\n\"Serious Match\"\n, where you can fight Agil going all out, is on now! The recommended total power is 250,000!\nRewards\nYou can get Incense to Increase Strength S, which boosts your attack by 1.3x for 10 minutes when used, by clearing the dungeon!\nUse more than one to increase the effect's duration. Doing so will help you out in a variety of situations.\nClear both the regular and extremely difficult Serious Match dungeons once a day and get a maximum of 6 Incenses to Increase Strength S daily!\nItem Expiration\nUntil August 19, 2024 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nThe items will disappear once the time limit has passed.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Agil\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\n\"Treasure Hunt with Agil\" will also be held Friday 4:00 to Monday 3:59 (JST/UTC+9) during this period. It can also be challenged by going to Agil.\nEvent Period\nAfter the July 31, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - August 16, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Strength S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n1\nCompleted within 5 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nChallenge Rewards [Serious Matches]\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nIncense to Increase Strength S\n3\nCompleted without any tumble(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nLife Potion\n1\nCompleted within 5 minutes(Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nImportant\nThe number of times you can clear it will be reset daily at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
