    "snippet": "SAO 미래 회의 2024를 축하합니다! 키리토, 아스나, 앨리스가 아티스트 의상을 입고 ★4 스킬 레코드로 돌아왔습니다! \"무대 장악 명령\"이 왔습니다! 5단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 복귀 보장! ★4 스킬 레코드의 복귀 특집 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서 당신은...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Future Meeting 2024 Opening Celebration] The \"Stage Takeover Order\" is back! One returning ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-07-28 16:40:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating the SAO Future Meeting 2024!\nKirito, Asuna, and Alice are dressed as artists, and are here as returning ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nStage Takeover Order\n\" is here! Get one returning ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for the featured returning ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne returning ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n* The Step Number from the previous Stage Takeover Order will not be carried over. (Players will start from Step 1.)\n【Returning ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[To the Stage Together] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAbandonment\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1540% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec./[Knight's Shield 4/Buff] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Own DEF increases (Stack 3) +1% per Stack for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using earth skills.\nRecovers 1500 → 3000 → 4500 HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Scarlet Star Singer] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWhite Pulsar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +120%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Jacket Girl] Alice\nSkill Name\nGround Dance/Light Dance/Encircle Break\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Ground Dance 4] Deals +20% Earth element's damage to enemy./[Light Dance 4] Deals +20% Holy element's damage to enemy./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 28, 2024 (Sun) 16:40 - Before the August 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne returning ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
