    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Venus Summer Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-07-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Asuna, Leafa, and Lisbeth are living it up at the summer beach as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nVenus Summer Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Waterfront Warfare] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHeat Flow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n64\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n2090% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Burn (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during %BuffTime4% sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Memories of Summer] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPiercing Water Burst\nSkill Name\nPiercing Water\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2050% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When hitting with this skill while using switch, own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 9).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4840% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Rocked by the Waves] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Martial Artist\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 5]Water element's damage to enemies -15% and fire element's damage to enemies +30%./[Martial Artist 4] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Seaside Maiden] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPrism Gong\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Slash 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing by you and your party +30% for 20 sec./[Holy Force 5/Buff (PT)] Holy element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n\"[Waterfront Warfare] Yuuki\", \"[Memories of Summer] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 1, 2024 (Mon) 0:00 - July 31, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
