    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Night Roamer Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-06-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Eugeo, Leafa, and Yuna arise from the dark of night wearing white hoodies in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nNight Roamer Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Outlaw Wolf] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Bite\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1870% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\nRecovers 1500 → 3000 → 4500 HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Carefree Wolf Boy] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1760% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lollipop Wolf] Leafa\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Prosper/Mallet Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Wolf Town Mascot] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Aqua\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1660% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Thrust Erosion Mark/Debuff] For thrust element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Aqua Pile/Buff(PT)] Water element damage +1% for yourself and party per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Outlaw Wolf] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 12, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
