    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Sweet Wedding Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-06-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record of a character dressed for their wedding day is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nSweet Wedding Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nJune 7, 2024 (Fri) 17:00 - June 16, 2024 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Way to Happiness] Alice\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Incarnation: Force\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Incarnation: Force 4] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Endless Blessing] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Earth\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1570% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Absolute Vow] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Fire\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Bridal Church] Sinon\nSkill Name\nOutmatch/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n46\nHP\n1930\nSkill Effect\n●[Outmatch 4] 300 of additional damage to enemy when attack./[Frostbite Blow 4] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Flower Bride] Silica\nSkill Name\nOutmatch/Golden Bell\nAttack\n24\nDefense\n62\nHP\n3050\nSkill Effect\n●[Outmatch 4] 300 of additional damage to enemy when attack./[Golden Bell 4] While the buff of your own additional damage is in effect, critical rate becomes +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cutey Bride] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Eruption\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n780% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Deal 15% of your Maximum HP as Additional damage./[Bonus] Critical rate +300% while the buff that raises your own flinch resistance is in effect.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shiny Bride] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nCelerity Hit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n680% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Combination 4/Buff] Switch damage multiples +300% for 5 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[First Bite] Leafa\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Leaf\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] 25% of player's reduced HP is additional damage to the enemy.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Happiness Bride] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nCrowd Control\nAttack\n40\nDefense\n60\nHP\n1250\nSkill Effect\n[Crowd Control 4] Attack +8% towards the enemy in Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite), damage from the enemy in Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) -8%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Bouquet Toss] Koharu\nSkill Name\nFighting spirit\nAttack\n46\nDefense\n50\nHP\n1200\nSkill Effect\n[Fighting spirit 4] While buff attack+ is effective, defense +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Silver Haired Bride] Sanya\nSkill Name\nVampire Sword/ Dark Invitation\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n●[Vampire Sword 5] Recovers 800HP of yourself when Switch is activated./[Dark Invitation 3] Deals +15% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
