    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Lily-White Bride Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-06-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Sinon, Leafa, and Silica are wearing pure-white bridal outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nLily-White Bride Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Japanese Bride] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Charging Loss/Break the Dam\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Charging Loss 1] Defense -30% and, when HP is under 50%, damage -1000% to enemies weak to thrusting.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Break the Dam 3] Break gauge amount +30% at enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Rainbow Omen] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Impact\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n1640% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 3 → 6 → 9 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\nRaises 1 → 2 → 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself when hitting with skills and equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set.\n★4[With My Beloved Sword] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow V Square Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow V Square\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Slash→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2050% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4840% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[White Kimono Debut] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nFire Curve\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n18\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +0.3% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[With My Beloved Sword] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 1, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - June 30, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
