    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】Get equipment enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Equipment with Lisbeth +1\"! For a limited time, you can clear the dungeon twice!\nEVENT\n2024-05-17 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nJoin Lisbeth and take on a dungeon filled with tons of equipment enhancement and transformation materials!\nCelebrate Lisbeth's birthday this year with a limited-edition Lisbeth Stamp!\nClear it twice a day during the event!\nGather lots of materials to power up your equipment.\nRewards\nYou can get\nGlare Dragon Stones\nfor equipment enhancement,\nRefining Hammers and Refining Hammers+\nfor transformation, and each kind of\nstone for transformation\nfrom dungeon rewards.\nYou can get the equipment refinement items Red Hot Ore and Common Metal Scrap from score rewards.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLady Style\nMonster Drop Items\nRefining Hammer,Refining Hammer+\nSlicing Stone,Slicing Stone+,Piercing Stone,Piercing Stone+,Striking Stone,Striking Stone+,Blocking Stone,Blocking Stone+\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Lisbeth\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nMay 17, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - May 24, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Equipment with Lisbeth+1\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n10\nMemory Stamp 283\nUse to obtain the \"Lady Style\" stamp.\n1\n30\nRefining Hammer\n15\n60\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n90\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n130\nStriking Stone\n15\n160\nStriking Stone+\n10\n190\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n230\nPiercing Stone\n15\n260\nPiercing Stone+\n10\n290\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n330\nRefining Hammer\n15\n360\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n390\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n430\nSlicing Stone\n15\n460\nSlicing Stone+\n10\n490\nCommon Metal Scrap\n4\n530\nBlocking Stone\n30\n560\nBlocking Stone+\n20\n590\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n630\nRefining Hammer\n20\n660\nRefining Hammer+\n15\n690\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\n730\nRefining Hammer\n15\n760\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n790\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n830\nStriking Stone\n15\n860\nStriking Stone+\n10\n890\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n930\nPiercing Stone\n15\n960\nPiercing Stone+\n10\n990\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\n1030\nRefining Hammer\n15\n1060\nRefining Hammer+\n12\n1090\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n1130\nSlicing Stone\n15\n1160\nSlicing Stone+\n10\n1190\nCommon Metal Scrap\n4\n1230\nBlocking Stone\n30\n1260\nBlocking Stone+\n20\n1290\nRed Hot Ore\n1\n1330\nRefining Hammer\n20\n1360\nRefining Hammer+\n15\n1390\nCommon Metal Scrap\n5\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRefining Hammer\n4\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGlare Dragon Stone\n5\nImportant\nThe dungeon can be cleared twice daily and will reset at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Lisbeth as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
