    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/30)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-29 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/30, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 4/30, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\"\n\"SAO Games 10th Anniversary! Alicization Avatar Order\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the designs of some Skill Record illustrations\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 4/26, 2024, 600 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 5/9, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/30, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\"\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/30 Maintenance\n\"Wild Seahorse Hunt\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
