    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Charmthrope Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-04-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki and Argo in charming werebeast forms are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCharmthrope Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Beast Girl in Full Bloom] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSand Pain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9)./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When hitting with this skill while using switch, own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 9).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Mischievous Beast] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShredding Flame\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n64\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n1730% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Burn (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
