    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Kiritoland is Open!\" is here! Get ★4 Skill Records, stamps, avatars, and more!\nEVENT\n2024-04-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Kiritoland is Open!\" is on now!\nMr. Kirito and Miss Asuna start life in a new land inside the world of SAOIF?!\nWelcome to Kiritoland, Mr. Kirito's fun and exciting world that spreads across Aincrad!\nMr. Kirito and Miss Asuna, its adorable mascots, await you with their beaming smiles!\nRewards\nGet Kiritoland Tickets and Mr. Kirito Coins through quests and exchange them for\n★4 Leafa and Sachi Skill Records, stamps, avatars, and more!\nSkill Records and some accessory avatars are also available as Quest Rewards.\nAvatar Images\nSkill Record\n★4[Yellow-green Magic Girl] Leafa\nSkill Name\nSteel Armor\nAttack\n25\nDefense\n70\nHP\n1250\nSkill Effect\n●[Steel Armor] Critical rate decrease 100%, flinch resist will increase 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shining Magic] Sachi\nSkill Name\nGiant's Elixir\nAttack\n15\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2000\nSkill Effect\n[Giant's Elixir] Recovery items and objects on the fields decrease the recovery rate by 50% and Max HP will increase 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nSpring is here\nI'll do my best!\nskip\nPinky Promise\nEvent-limited recovery item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nMiss Asuna Bun\nRecover 1600 HP of the party members who are in the same field.\nTrade \"Kiritoland Ticket\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Yellow-green Magic Girl] Leafa\n300\n7\nLucky Magical Bottoms\n500\n1\nHappy Magical Bottoms\n500\n2\nLucky Magical Patch\n200\n2\nHappy Magical Patch\n200\n2\nMemory Stamp 17\nUse to obtain \"Spring is here\" stamp.\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 18\nUse to obtain \"I'll do my best!\" stamp.\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 19\nUse to obtain \"skip\" stamp.\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 20\nUse to obtain \"Pinky Promise\" stamp.\n200\n1\nTrade \"Mr. Kirito Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Shining Magic] Sachi\n60\n7\nLucky Magical Top\n50\n1\nHappy Magical Top\n50\n2\nLucky Magical Mask (Left)\n30\n1\nLucky Magical Mask (Right)\n30\n2\nHappy Magical Mask (Left)\n30\n2\nHappy Magical Mask (Right)\n30\n2\nTrader Period\nStarts after the April 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 22, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Mr. Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nYou can also get \"Mr. Kirito Coins\" by exchanging \"Kiritoland Tickets\" for them.\n\"Kiritoland Ticket\", \"Mr. Kirito Coin\", and \"Miss Asuna Bun\" will be deleted on May 22, 2024 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nQuests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
