    "news_category": "IMPORTANT",
    "snippet": "반다이남코의 서비스 및 제품을 이용해 주셔서 감사합니다. 2024년 4월 27일(토)~2024년 5월 6일(월)(JST) 연휴 기간 동안 접수된 문의에 대해 사용자에게 알려드립니다. ■ 위 연휴 기간 동안 문의 건수가 증가할 것으로 예상되므로...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice regarding Inquires Received during Golden Week Holidays\nIMPORTANT\n2024-04-26 11:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for using the services and products of Bandai Namco.\nThis is to inform our users about inquiries received during the holidays from:\nApril 27,2024(Saturday)--May 6,2024(Monday)JST\n■ Please be informed that during the holidy period above, the number of inquiries are expected to increase, so it will take us longer than usual to respond to you.\n■  For some inquiries that needed to be escalated to developers, will be attended from May 7,2024 (Tusesday), and will be answered in order of receipt after the investigation from developers are done properly.\nWe deeply apologize for any inconvenience it will cause you.\nYour understanding and patients are highly appreciated.\nGo to Notice List"
