    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/3)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-02 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 4/3, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 4/3, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"All Together! IF Kindergarten\" is back\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nAs a reward for the correct answers to the quiz portion of the official live stream on 3/29, 2024, 500 Arcana Gems have been sent to all players.\nReceive by: Until 4/10, 2024 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\n2 chat stamps have been added to the \"[1x Only] Medal of Combat Arts Trader\".\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/3, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Chaos Showdown\" New Boss and Dark Black Armor Added\n\"All Together! IF Kindergarten\" is back\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/3 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary! Grand Order\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary Login Bonus\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
