    "full_details": "Notices\n[4/1 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] Now's your chance to produce up to Lv. 155 Dark Black Series! The Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign is on now!\nCampaign\n2024-04-01 15:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[4/1 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe campaign period will be extended.\nStarts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n-----------------------------\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nThe Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign is on now!\nThe drop rates Dark Black Series production materials up to Lv. 155 have been increased\nfor a limited time!\nYou can take on any applicable Chaos Showdown dungeon with a party.\nUse this chance to tackle the Chaos Showdown together and complete the Dark Black Series!\nDungeons Affected\nItems with Increased Drop Rates\nChaos Showdown 90 - Dark Black King\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nDark Black King Fang\nChaos Showdown 90 - Dark Black Thunder Bull\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nDark Black Thunder Bull Horn\nChaos Showdown 90 - Dark Black Spirit Tree\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nDark Black Spirit Tree Branch\nChaos Showdown 95 Dark Black Sea Horse\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nAmber Crystal Shard\nDark Black Sea Horse Hoof\nChaos Showdown 95 Dark Black False Statue\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nAmber Crystal Shard\nDark Black False Statue Crestf\nChaos Showdown 95 - Dark Black Beast\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nAmber Crystal Shard\nDark Black Beast Hair\nChaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Colossal\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nDark Black Colossal Bone\nChaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Frozen Evil\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nDark Black Frozen Evil Hair\nChaos Showdown 110 - Dark Black Evil Spirit\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nDark Black Evil Spirit Thorn\nChaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Snake Samurai\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nDark Black Snake Samurai Large Sleeve\nChaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Griffin\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nDark Black Griffin Wing\nChaos Showdown 135 - Dark Black Sturdy Crab\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nDark Black Sturdy Crab''s Hard Shell\nChaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black Blazing\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nDark Black Blazing Flame Arm\nChaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black Half Beast\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nDark Black Half Beast's Horn\nChaos Showdown 155 - Dark Black One-Eyed Beast\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Eye\n* Does not apply to dungeons not held during this event.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nStarts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 10, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 10F Main Quest\nDark Black Series\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 90.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 95.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 110.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 135.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 155.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
