    "full_details": "Notices\n[4/1 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] The Lv.235 Dark Black series \"Dark Black Land Devourer\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nEVENT\n2024-04-01 15:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[4/1 15:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe event period will be extended.\nMarch 21, 2024 (Thu) 14:00 - April 10, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n-----------------------------\nThe boss monster \"Land Devourer Chaos\" and the Lv.235 Dark Black equipment series \"Dark Black Land Devourer\" have been added!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black King, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black Sea Horse, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Colossal, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Snake Samurai, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black Blazing, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nMarch 21, 2024 (Thu) 14:00 - April 3, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nMarch 21, 2024 (Thu) 14:00 - April 10, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nNew Boss monster\nLand Devourer Chaos\nDetails\nSince this is a field with unusable items, some items cannot be used.\nWhen battle starts, it will use a buff that gradually recovers its own HP and a Critical Resistance buff.\nAdditionally, once its HP falls below a certain amount, it will use a buff that gradually recovers its own HP and the \"increase attack\" buff on itself, as well as remove any debuffs from itself.\nYou can break it with 2H Axe skills.\nWhen HP falls below a certain amount, Break condition changes to 1H Club.\nWith each Break, it will be weakened by a stack debuff that increases damage dealt from players.\nWhen its HP falls beneath a certain amount, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nDark Element\nResistance\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nCritical\nDamage\nStatus Ailments\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Critical resistance\", \"Increase Attack\",\"Gradual recovery\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\", \"Fatal Poison\" and \"Paralysis\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nObtainable Chaos Crystals\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nBlunt Element\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nAmber Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nTopaz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nEmerald Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nSlash Element\n・\nDark Element\nSapphire Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Asura\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nIndigo Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Warden\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nAmethyst Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black White Wyrm\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nQuartz Chaos Crystal\nChaos Showdown 235\nDark Black Land Devourer\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nRose Quartz Chaos Crystal\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using Chaos Crystals and production materials dropped from the boss.\nEach \"Chaos Crystal\" can be obtained by collecting the correlating \"Crystal Shards\" and using them for production.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Asura Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Asura Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Warden Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Warden Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Land Devourer Armor[NEW!]\n1772\n31900\nLv.235\nDark Black Land Devourer Greaves[NEW!]\n1453\n19303\nLv.235\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 235 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n90\n50\nHP\n2500\n4500\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Land Devourer Armor, defense will increase by 270 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, 215 and 235 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nCheck the game for details about the rewards of each dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
