    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(4/1)\nMAINT.\n2024-04-01 11:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from April 1, 2024 15:00, was completed on April 1, 2024 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixing the issue where the switch gauge did not increase properly in some cases\nFixing the issue where the switch gauge was increasing with the Assisting Character's attacks\nFixing the following issues with the transformation feature\n・Pressing the Cancel Transformation button does not cancel the transformation\n・While transformed, Burst and Full Burst can be activated\n・While transformed, the player is not blown away even when taking a blow-away attack\n・While transformed, the player appears to be standing on other players' screens when defeated\n・While transformed, the field of vision is incorrect when using VR Mode\n・While transformed, the player may become buried in the ground\n・While transformed and warping with warp devices, etc, the player may become stuck\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n300 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\nApril 10, 2024 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Event responses related to this issue\nThe following event period will be extended until before maintenance on April 10, 2024.\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Chaos Crystal Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n\"Chaos Showdown\"\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\nApril 1, 2024 15:00 to 17:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixing the issue where the switch gauge did not increase properly in some cases\nFixing the issue where the switch gauge was increasing with the Assisting Character's attacks\nFixing the following issues with the transformation feature\n・Pressing the Cancel Transformation button does not cancel the transformation\n・While transformed, Burst and Full Burst can be activated\n・While transformed, the player is not blown away even when taking a blow-away attack\n・While transformed, the player appears to be standing on other players' screens when defeated\n・While transformed, the field of vision is incorrect when using VR Mode\n・While transformed, the player may become buried in the ground\n・While transformed and warping with warp devices, etc, the player may become stuck\n* Controls return to normal when transformation is canceled.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
