    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Philia's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Philia!\nShop\n2024-03-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Philia's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Attack From the Forest] Philia\n\" and \"\n[Easy Leap] Philia\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nPhilia's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Philia guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Philia\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Attack From the Forest] Philia\nSkill Name\nBleed Counter/Enhance Clotting/Retribution\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Bleed Counter 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Bleed), Attack +1000./●[Enhance Clotting 2] Bleed damage -10%./[Retribution 1] Adds Bloodshed effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 30). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) evasion rate decrease.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Easy Leap] Philia\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Cutter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1400% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Dark Shadow Demon 3/Buff] Dark element damage +45% for 8 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 31, 2024 (Sun) 0:00 - April 9, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Philia\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Philia\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
