    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/27)\nMAINT.\n2024-03-26 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/27, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 3/27, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor 2024\" begins\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nModifications to display \"Evasion\" when a monster evades\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for spring\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue with the 91F floor boss where it would move outside of the area when performing attacks with movement\nFixed an issue when using \",\" in the chat, where chat logs from the text using \",\" would disappear from the next time logging in\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n3/27, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Strategy Event Witch's Manor 2024\" begins\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Alicization Boss Rush\" Event rewards\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 3/27 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\"\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 6x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
