    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\" is here! Get a ★4 Kirito Skill Record, Avatars, and stamps!\nEVENT\n2024-03-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nWhite Day Assault 2024 is here, featuring the \"Save Kirito! Recover the Candy!\" scenario event!\nHordes of monsters attack in the \"White Day Assault 2024\"!\nAfter a certain amount of time passes, the boss monster will appear.\nDrive off hordes of monsters and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nIn addition to tons of EXP, this year's event will also offer re-released limited rewards.\n\"Save Kirito! Recover the Candy!\" Scenario Event\nKirito took part in the White Day event and managed to get his hands on the \"Sweet Candy\" item to give to Asuna as a present.\nHowever, in an unexpected turn of events, it got stolen by monsters!\nSweet Candy is a one-of-a-kind special order, so he can't just go get another one. And that's exactly why he's called the two of you to help him try and get it back.\nRewards\nGet some White Sugar from the event and exchange it for the re-released ★4 Kirito Skill Records, stamps, and avatars at the Trader!\nNow's your chance to collect what you're missing!\n\"Icing Cookies\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on March 21, 2024 (Thu).\nAdditionally,\nAwakening Medals\ncan also be obtained as Total Score Rewards during this event.\nAwakening Medals can be exchanged for awakening materials in \"Kibaou and the Secret Deal\", so get out there and collect those medals!\nSee here for more details on Kibaou and the Secret Deal.\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\n, and up to 120\n\"Awakening Medals\"\nfrom the event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster \"Candy Shrewman\" will drop Star Fragments.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\n▼Skill Record\n★4[Candy Macer] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHoly Impulse\nSP Cost\n40\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1100% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]\n* Damage will decrease by 1/4 when this skill is used at switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAvatar Images\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nBashful\nHappy White Day\nSo happy...\nGo for it!\nTrade \"White Sugar\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Candy Macer] Kirito\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 12\nUse to obtain the \"Bashful\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 13\nUse to obtain the \"Happy White Day\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 14\nUse to obtain the \"So happy...\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 15\nUse to obtain the \"Go for it!\" stamp.\n100\n1\nPastel Candy Top\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Top\n200\n1\nPastel Candy Bottoms\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Bottoms\n200\n1\nPastel Candy Hat\n200\n1\nPastel Candy Cape\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Pin\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Bow\n200\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nTrade \"Icing Cookie\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\n★4[Candy Macer] Kirito\n400\n1\nColorful Candy Top\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Bottoms\n200\n1\nPastel Candy Hat\n200\n1\nPastel Candy Cape\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Pin\n200\n1\nColorful Candy Bow\n200\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nTrader Period\nWhite Sugar: Starts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nIcing Cookie: Starts after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n6P\n21P\n21P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"Premium\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Premium\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Premium\"\n1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×500\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×50\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nExp Crystal L×75\nExp Crystal M×70\nExp Crystal S×80\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAwakening Medal×120\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nA Surprise Return\nLet's collect a total of 2000 White Sugars in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nUltimate Sweet Tooth\nLet's collect a total of 5000 White Sugars in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 27, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nCandy Shrewman\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict \"Bloodshed\" and \"Curse\".\nOn \"Advanced\", \"Premium\", \"Maniac\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Curse\"\nDebuff \"Seal Item\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Candy Shrewman\" will keep appearing until time is up, even after it has been defeated.\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"White Sugars\" and \"Icing Cookies\" will be deleted on April 3, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-03-05T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-03-26T19:00:00+00:00"
