    "full_details": "Notices\nHigh difficulty \"Chaos Showdown\" updated! Get your hands on the powerful Dark Black Series armor!\nEVENT\n2024-03-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe high-difficulty dungeon, \"Chaos Showdown\", has been updated!\nGet the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" armor!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get Dark Black Spirit Tree, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get Dark Black Beast, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get Dark Black Evil Spirit, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get Dark Black Sturdy Crab, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get Dark Black One-Eyed Beast, which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nMarch 6, 2024 (Wed) 14:00 - March 21, 2024 (Thu) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* This dungeon will be held 1 day longer than usual.\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Beast\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Sticky Thing\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Last Number\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using production materials dropped from the boss.\nDark Black Series List\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Sticky Thing Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Last Number Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nExample: Equippable Lv. 215 Dark Black Series\nStatus\nUpper\nLower\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n80\n50\nHP\n2500\n4000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Gleam Eyes Armor, defense will increase by 240 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nRewards\nThe following items can be obtained from score rewards, challenge rewards, and achievement rewards.\nDungeon\nRewards\nChaos Showdown 90 \"Dark Black Spirit Tree\"\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 95 \"Dark Black Beast\"\nAmber Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 110 \"Dark Black Evil Spirit\"\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 135 \"Dark Black Sturdy Crab\"\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 155 \"Dark Black One-Eyed Beast\"\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 175 \"Dark Black Sticky Thing\"\nIndigo Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 195 \"Dark Black Last Number\"\nAmethyst Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 215 \"Dark Black Gleam Eyes\"\nQuartz Crystal Shard\nCheck in-game for more details on the rewards.\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, and 215 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
