    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] The \"Awakening Support Panel Mission\" is here! Get 100 Awakening Stars and 20 Great Jewels of each kind!\nEVENT\n2024-03-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nThe\n\"Awakening Support Panel Mission\"\nwhere you can get awakening materials and Col every time you clear a mission is here!\nUse this chance to gather awakening materials and awaken your skills!\nRewards\nClear all the missions to get a total of 100 Awakening Stars, 20 of each kind of Great Jewel, 1.5 million Col, and more!\nPeriod\nMarch 1, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - March 31, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* This Panel Mission Reward is available until April 7, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Aincrad 10F\nStar Fragment\nSaleable Col Bag\n10\n3\nReach Lv90or higher.\nAwakening Star\n15\nForge an Awakening Star.\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n5\n5\n5\n3\nObtain 5 Awakening Stars.\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n5\n5\n5\n3\nObtain 25 Awakening Stars.\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n5\n5\n5\n3\nObtain 50 Awakening Stars.\nGreat Red Jewel\nGreat Green Jewel\nGreat Yellow Jewel\nGreat Blue Jewel\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n5\n5\n5\n3\nClear the Chaos Showdown 1 time.\nAwakening Star\n20\nClear the Chaos Showdown 15 times.\nAwakening Star\n20\nEquip Dark Black Series\nAwakening Star\n20\n* Rewards for missions set as \"Pack\" are automatically obtained when the mission is completed.\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nBy selling all 15 that are available, you will earn 1,500,000 Col.\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nAwakening Star\n25\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
