    "snippet": "앨리스, 코하루, 시논, 시리카가 신비한 힘을 지닌 검을 들고 있는 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록! \"룬블레이드 오더\"가 등장합니다! 5단계에서 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록 1개 획득이 보장됩니다!새로운 ★4 스킬 기록에 대한 비율이 높아졌습니다!1단계에서는 아르카나 보석 1,250개로 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! ★4 스킬 기록 1개는 보장됩니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Rune Blade Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-02-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Koharu, Sinon, and Silica carry swords with mystic powers in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nRune Blade Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Command of Sorcery] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRaged Earth\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sorcery by Hand] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAir Stamp\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Force 5/Buff(PT)] Wind element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Combination 3/Buff(PT)] When the target is hit using the Switch, switch damage multiples +200% for you and your party for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Enchanted by Sorcery] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Volt Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Volt\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Thrust→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n47\nSwitch Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n94\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1890% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4390% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Critical rate +300% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Apprentice Sorceress] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Frostbite Blow 5] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Sorcery by Hand] Koharu\", \"[Enchanted by Sorcery] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends March 31, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
