    "full_details": "Notices\nA small gift from Koharu for celebrating her birthday! \"Koharu's Surprise: Free Once Daily 11x Order\" is on now!\nShop\n2024-02-24 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAs thanks for celebrating her birthday, Koharu has a gift for everyone!\nGet a free 11x Order each day with \"\nKoharu's Surprise: Free Once Daily 11x Order\n\"!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Koharu!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Crossing Into Death Together] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Putting Feelings to Brush] Koharu\nSkill Name\nKing of Rapiers/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[King of Rapiers 3] Attack +1000 when using 1H Rapier./[Frostbite Blow 4] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 24%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Calming Space] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nGaia Serpent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n1200% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Motion Range]/[Cat Lover/Buff] Adds a buff that makes enemies like cats (no particular effect) for 30 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Integral Existence] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDark Edge\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +30% against poisoned enemies./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 24, 2024 (Sat) 4:00 - March 1, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring the event, players can try the 11x Order once a day.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
