    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" is here! Get the Koharu stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2024-02-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" is here! Get the Koharu stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of her birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Koharu\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500 \"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nPeriod\nFebruary 23, 2024 (Fri) 4:00 - March 1, 2024 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nGazing Into the Future\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 267\nUse to obtain the \"Gazing Into the Future\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\n- Important\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
