    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ordinal Scale: Memories of Battle Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-02-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Eiji, and Yuna from Sword Art Online the Movie -Ordinal Scale- are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nOrdinal Scale: Memories of Battle Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[For Precious Memories] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Switching to Melee\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 5] Holy element's damage to enemies -15% and dark element's damage to enemies +30%./[Switching to Melee 4] Attack +20% when not equipping any Sinon's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Refined Swordwork] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Pain\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1820% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Even if Slightly Taboo] Eiji\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind V Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1460% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Yuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Still More to Sing] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWind Impulse\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n118\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\n1920% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack2) during 20 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack6) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Refined Swordwork] Asuna\", \"[Still More to Sing] Yuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nFebruary 18, 2024 (Sun) 0:00 - March 8, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
