    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Hunting Event \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt 2024\" is on now! Get the returning Midnight Coat avatar!\nEVENT\n2024-02-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDefeat the Greedy Kobold Lord and get rewards!\nRewards\nThe\n\"Midnight Coat\"\navatar returns as a reward!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 200\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nThis time you can get enhancement and transformation materials for Skill Records, including all kinds of Great Jewels and High Jewels, Record Frame L, and Record Kit M.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nAvatar Images\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Yellow Kobold Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Green Kobold Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the February 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on February 28, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Yellow Kobold Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMidnight Coat Top\n500\n1\nMidnight Coat Bottoms\n350\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n15\nTrade \"Green Kobold Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMidnight Coat Top\n500\n1\nMidnight Coat Bottoms\n350\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n14\nTrader Period\nYellow Kobold Plate: Starts after the February 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nGreen Kobold Plate: Starts after the February 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 80,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×13\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAwakening Star×125\nGreat Red Jewel×11\nGreat Green Jewel×11\nGreat Yellow Jewel×11\nGreat Blue Jewel×11\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry\nDepth\nDANGER\nGaining Ground\nSpecial\nExtreme\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\n★4[A Tune of Red Beans] Sinon\nBow\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Blue Rose in the Night Sky] Kirito\nAbility\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Scary Things Are Scary...] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★4[Gentle Chocola]Kirito\nAbility\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★3[Peaceful Smile] Yui\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\nBow\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nDevoted to Desire\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Yellow Kobold Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nBerserker's Etiquette\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Yellow Kobold Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the February 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the March 6, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Abyss will be implemented after the February 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGreedy Kobold Lord\nDetails\nSkill Break with Thrust Element.\nFor the Abyss difficulty, Skill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Blunt Element and Wind Element.\nOn \"Special\", \"Extreme\" and \"Abyss\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", \"Extreme\" and \"Abyss\" difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nWind Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Decrease defense\" and \"Seal item\"\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nPlates will be deleted on March 13, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
