    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/24)\nMAINT.\n2024-01-23 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/24, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Underground Labyrinth B3\" Installed\nReduced difficulty of production for Integral Series shield \"Fermat\"\nAdded \"Wonder Animal Assault 2024\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/24 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 43\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\n\"Intense Dragon Hunt\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
