    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The Memory Defrag Illustration Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-12-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nKirito, Asuna, Yuuki, and Eugeo from SWORD ART ONLINE: Memory Defrag are here in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe\nSAO Games 10th Anniversary Memory Defrag Illustration Order\nis here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Hero Rises] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlower Beat\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1680% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Blaze 4/Buff] When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] When equipping 3 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Unstoppable Friendship] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSharp Grief\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +120%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Invincible Journey] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Earth Conversion/Sword Demon\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Earth Conversion 5] Wind element's damage to enemies -15% and earth element's damage to enemies +30%./[Sword Demon 4] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Heart Full of Memories] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSand Scrap Burst\nSkill Name\nSand Scrap\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n102\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2090% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4960% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Hero Rises] Kirito\", \"[Heart Full of Memories] Eugeo\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
