    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 \"크리스마스 오푸스\" 개최 중!크리스마스 트리를 찾아 스노우드 숲에 도착한 일행. 그곳에서 수수께끼의 소녀 유이를 만나게 됩니다. 보상이벤트 한정 스킬 레코드 \"★4[파티 시작] 유이\"와 메모리 스탬프 등을 획득하세요!에서 획득한 \"레드 크리스마스 장식\"을...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Christmas Opus\" is on now! Get a ★4 Yui Skill Record and stamps!\nEVENT\n2023-12-13 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nScenario Event \"Christmas Opus\" is on now!\nIn search of a Christmas tree, your group arrives in Snowood Forest.\nThere, you meet the mysterious girl, Yui.\nRewards\nGet the event-limited Skill Record \"★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\", Memory Stamps, and more!\nExchange the \"Red Xmas Ornament\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Gold Xmas Ornament\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the December 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on December 27, 2023 (Wed).\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 25\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 300\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nSkill Record\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\nSkill Name\nReduced Battle Wounds/Dark Invitation\nAttack\n32\nDefense\n30\nHP\n1975\nSkill Effect\n●[Reduced Battle Wounds 3] Reduces damage from slash, thrust, and blunt element monsters and status ailment damage by 3%./[Dark Invitation 3] Deals +15% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp 258\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLovely Present\nEvent-limited item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nFluffy Mashed Potatoes\nMelts in your mouth.\nInstantly recovers 2,000 HP.\nTrade \"Red Xmas Ornament\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 258\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Gold Xmas Ornament\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui\n400\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nRed Xmas Ornament: Starts after the December 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nGold Xmas Ornament: Starts after the December 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\n\"Gaining Ground\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nNote that the Quick Party participation requirement will be a Total Power of 40,000 or higher.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★4[Let the Party Begin] Yui×7\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter S×120\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×40\nGreat Red Jewel×4\nGreat Green Jewel×4\nGreat Yellow Jewel×4\nGreat Blue Jewel×4\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nSentimental Xmas\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Xmas Ornaments in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nTrial & Error\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Xmas Ornaments in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Extreme will be implemented after the December 20, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Xmas event 2023\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 6 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nStory Replay\nAfter completing the scenario quest, you can replay it via the dungeon NPC for the event.\nStory Replay is displayed beneath the dungeon.\nBoss Monster\nNicholas Chaos\nDetails\nYou can perform breaks.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, and Extreme difficulties, the enemy uses a Chaos Recollection buff and a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nEarth Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Curse\" and \"Frostbite\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Red Xmas Ornament\", \"Gold Xmas Ornament\", and \"Fluffy Mashed Potatoes\" will be deleted on January 17, 2024 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-12-12T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-01-10T19:00:00+00:00"
