    "full_details": "Notices\nOnly for 24 hours! An All-Out Battle with an increased drop rate of Core Metal+++ is now available! \"Aincrad Conquest Support Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2023-11-06 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNovember 6, 2023 is the Aincrad Conquest 1st Anniversary of the original SWORD ART ONLINE!\nIn celebration of this, SAOIF will have an\n\"Aincrad Conquest Support Event\"\nfor only 24 hours!\nA 24-hour All-Out Battle with an increased drop rate of\n\"Core Metal+++\"\nis now available on 75F and 100F!\n- Conquest Support Event [The Skull Reaper]\n- Conquest Support Event [Aincrad]\nUse this chance to challenge the All-Out Battle!\nEvent Period\nNovember 6, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nBoth 75F All-Out Battle The Skull Reaper and 100F All-Out Battle Aincrad can be challenged.\nCore Metal+++\nThis valuable material is required for transforming the following Integral Series.\nUsing Core Metal+++ as one of the materials, you can produce Slicing Stone+++, Piercing Stone+++, and Striking Stone+++, which then become the materials for each Integral Series transformation.\nRosso Integral Series ★4 Transformation\nRosso Integral Series ★5 Transformation\nYasha Integral Series ★4 Transformation\nYasha Integral Series ★5 Transformation\nGaou Integral Series ★4 Transformation\nGaou Integral Series ★5 Transformation\nImportant\nThis will be an event dungeon, so it will be a different All-Out Battle than the equivalent All-Out Battle.\nThe monsters' strength is the same as normal All-Out Battles.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
