    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/25)\nMAINT.\n2023-10-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/25, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 38F\"\n\"38F Start Dash Event\" begins\nAdded \"Halloween Assault 2023\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/25 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 40\n\"Heapin' 20M EXP Event\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
