    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Silica Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2023-10-04 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Silica's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Silica's birthday on October 4.\nLet's celebrate Silica's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until October 4, 2023 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
