    "full_details": "Notices\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] The Hunting Event \"Mermaid Hunt\" is here! Get tons of Memoria Niter to Limit Break Skill Records, as well as transformation and enhancement materials!\nEVENT\n2023-09-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5.5 Year Anniversary!\nDefeat the Lively Mermaid and get rewards!\nRewards\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 200\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nThis time you can get enhancement and transformation materials for Skill Records, including all kinds of Great Jewels and High Jewels, Record Frame L, and Record Kit M.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Red Mermaid Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Blue Mermaid Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on October 11, 2023 (Wed).\nTrade \"Red Mermaid Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n15\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n15\nTrade \"Blue Mermaid Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n14\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n14\nTrader Period\nRed Mermaid Plate: Starts after the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue Mermaid Plate: Starts after the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 80,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×13\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAwakening Star×125\nGreat Red Jewel×11\nGreat Green Jewel×11\nGreat Yellow Jewel×11\nGreat Blue Jewel×11\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry\nDepth\nDANGER\nGaining Ground\nSpecial\nExtreme\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\n★4[Leader of the Human Empire] Kirito\n1H Sword\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Goddess of the Human Empire] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Putting Feelings to Brush] Koharu\nAbility\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Crossing Into Death Together] Koharu\nDagger\n20\n40\n60\n120\n240\n480\n600\n1200\n600\n1200\n1000\n2000\n★4[Next Move] Koharu\nDagger\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Fishing Girl] Yuuki\n1H Sword\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Combination Play] Koharu\nDagger\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★4[Swordsman's Pride] Kirito\nAbility\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★3[Freshly Harvested Apples] Koharu\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\n★3[Madder Red] Sanya\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nBubbly Mermaid\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Mermaid Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nVitality Incarnate\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Mermaid Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Event Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Abyss will be implemented after the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nLively Mermaid\nDetails\nBreak with Slash Element.\nOn Abyss difficulty, you can break it with the Thrust Element.\nOn Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Sleep\", \"Bloodshed\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\", \"Decrease defense\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nPlates will be deleted on October 25, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-09-26T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-10-17T19:00:00+00:00"
