    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Autumn Colors Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-09-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne autumn-themed ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nAutumn Colors Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Taste of an Autumn Night] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBlaze Gong\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n750% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +75% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Visitor from the Moon] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Brandish\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n64\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Dark Shadow Demon 4/Buff] Dark element damage +55% for 8 sec./[Dark Element Weak 4/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +25% for 10 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Malus Queen] Asuna\nSkill Name\nAcceleration/Enhance Blunt\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Acceleration 3] Critical damage +20% when HP is under 50%./[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Persica Girl] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurning Crush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Analyze 3/Debuff] Chance to raise critical damage against enemies by 15% for 15 sec./▲[Bonus] Recovers 5 SP when the monster is defeated with this skill.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Fresh Fruit] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Destruction\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 175%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Harvest of Nature's Mountain] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSpinning Earth Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Bohemian Paint] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFlame Waltz\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Find Weakness 4/Debuff] Finds the enemy's weakness for 15 sec at a specific rate.　The critical rate +20% to enemy that has their weakness found./[Mountain of Bodies 3/Buff] Additional damage based on current HP for 30 sec when hitting with switch./[Perish 3/Debuff] Receive 3x damage for 30 sec when hitting with switch.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Priestess Daily Duties] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Rock Fencer\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n9.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n14\nSkill Effect\n600% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Critical rate +300% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite)./[Bonus] Attack +25% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
