    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Moonlit Night Story Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-09-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nBeautiful maidens who protect the moonlit night! Sinon, Leafa, Yuuki, and Sachi are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMoonlit Night Story Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sky Splitting Arrow] Sinon\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Charging Loss\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Charging Loss 1] When defense -30% and HP is under 50%, damage -1000% to enemies weak to thrusting.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Light that Illuminates Night] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBurn Scrap\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nSkill Effect\n1770% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\nFire element damage +50% → 100% → 150% when using break.\n★4[Return of the Full Moon] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nAqua Spinning Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 8 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Watchful Eyes] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWide Dark Fencer\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +150% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Recovers 10% of your own Max HP when this skill is used and when you hit.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
