    "full_details": "Notices\n\"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\" is back! Get each Bear Avatar and a Weapon Avatar with glowing special effects!\nEVENT\n2023-09-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\" is back!\n[Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom\nLooking to raise his level, Kirito ventured into a forest area. There, he discovered a strange mushroom sprouting from a cliff.\nAccording to Argo, these mushrooms only grow on cliffs and precipices, have a mellow aroma, and possess an unbeatable flavor. They were the mushrooms on everyone's mind.\nKirito decided to discuss with Asuna how they might be able to harvest these mushrooms to eat later.\nThus, Kirito, Asuna, and the player headed together to the location.\nRewards\nGet the tradable \"Golden Fruit\" and \"Big Nuts\" items as rewards or drops. Use these to get each Bear Avatar and the \"Rare Mush Bow Bright\" Weapon Avatar with glowing special effects that appeared before!\nAll 4 colors of the \"Bear Avatar\" from the Avatar contest are back!\nBear Avatar\nThe Bow Weapon Avatar \"Rare Mush Bow Bright\" obtainable at Trader has glowing\nspecial effects\n.\nThe Bow Weapon Avatar \"Rare Mush Bow\" you can acquire in the Scenario quest has regular effects.\nRare Mush Bow Bright\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nhaha\n*Sigh*\nGot your back!\nPassing out…\nLimited Items\nEffect\nHappy Grape\nHP recovers 1000 in an instant.\r\nA rich taste that makes you happy\nTrade \"Golden Fruit\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nBear Paw Badge A(For both Male/Female)\n30\n2\nBear Paw Badge B(For both Male/Female)\n30\n2\nBear Paw Badge A White(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBear Paw Badge B White(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBear Paw Badge A Brown(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBear Paw Badge B Brown(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBear Paw Badge A Peach(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBear Paw Badge B Peach(For both Male/Female)\n60\n2\nBig Nuts\n10\n300\nHappy Grape\n30\n30\nTrade \"Big Nuts\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nBear Suit Top and Bottom(For both Male/Female)\n300\n2\nBear Suit Head A(For both Male/Female)\n50\n2\nBear Suit Head B(For both Male/Female)\n50\n2\nBear Suit Top and Bottom White(For both Male/Female)\n600\n2\nBear Suit Head A White(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nBear Suit Head B White(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Brown(For both Male/Female)\n600\n2\nBear Suit Head A Brown(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nBear Suit Head B Brown(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nBear Suit Top and Bottom Peach(For both Male/Female)\n600\n2\nBear Suit Head A Peach(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nBear Suit Head B Peach(For both Male/Female)\n100\n2\nRare Mush Bow Bright\n300\n2\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n5\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Golden Fruit Big Nuts Trade\" banner.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nScore Rewards\nHarvest\nEntry\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n150\nMemory Stamp 41\nUse to obtain the \"*Sigh*\" stamp\n1\n150\nBig Nuts\n10\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n450\nAwakening Star\n1\n450\nAwakening Star\n1\n600\nGolden Fruit\n15\n600\nBig Nuts\n15\n750\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n750\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n900\nHealing Potion\n10\n900\nHealing Potion\n10\n1050\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n1050\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n1200\nHappy Grape\n5\n1200\nHappy Grape\n10\n1350\nAwakening Star\n1\n1350\nAwakening Star\n1\n1500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n1500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n1800\nRecord Frame M\n20\n1800\nRecord Frame M\n30\n2400\nGolden Fruit\n30\n2400\nBig Nuts\n35\n3000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n3000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n3600\nAwakening Star\n3\n3600\nAwakening Star\n3\nInterior\nDepth\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n200\nBig Nuts\n15\n250\nBig Nuts\n20\n400\nRestorative Potion\n5\n500\nRestorative Potion\n10\n600\nAwakening Star\n1\n750\nAwakening Star\n1\n800\nBig Nuts\n20\n1000\nBig Nuts\n30\n1000\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n1250\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n1200\nRestorative Potion\n10\n1500\nRestorative Potion\n15\n1400\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n1750\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n1600\nHappy Grape\n15\n2000\nHappy Grape\n20\n1800\nAwakening Star\n1\n2250\nAwakening Star\n1\n2000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n2500\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n2400\nRecord Frame L\n20\n3000\nRecord Frame L\n30\n3200\nBig Nuts\n40\n4000\nBig Nuts\n50\n4000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n5000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n4800\nAwakening Star\n3\n6000\nAwakening Star\n3\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nStrange Taste\nLet's collect a total of 500 Golden Fruits in the time period.\nMemory Stamp 42\nUse to obtain the \"Got your back!\" stamp\nThe one with a kick\nLet's collect a total of 100 Big Nuts in the time period.\nMemory Stamp 43\nUse to obtain the \"Passing out…\" stamp\nEssence of Appetite\nLet's collect a total of 2500 Big Nuts in the time period.\nAwakening Star×5\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the [Returning] Search for the Phantom Mushroom banner to go to the Autumn Leaves of the Forest.\nalk to Kirito in the \"Autumn Leaves of the Forest\" to accept the scenario quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 4, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGluttontherium\nDetails\nIt attacks players by shredding them with its claws, charging at them, and breathing fire.On the Depth difficulty, it unleashes a focus attack that sharply upheaves the ground beneath the player.On the Interior and Depth difficulties, it uses a buff that increases its attack when its HP is below a certain amount.\r\nRemove its attack buff to tip the battle in your favor!\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nYou can get lots of Golden Fruit in the Dungeon \"Horrific grudge over food - Harvest\".\n* You cannot acquire \"Big Nuts\" from this Dungeon.\nYou can get Big Nuts in the Dungeons \"Horrific grudge over food - Entry\", \"Horrific grudge over food - Interior\", and \"Horrific grudge over food - Depths\".\n* \"Big Nuts\" are easier to get from more difficult Dungeons.\n* \"Big Nuts\" may also be obtained by trading \"Golden Fruit\".\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nGolden Fruits, Big Nuts, and Happy Grapes will be deleted on October 11, 2023 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
