    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Sunshine Goddess Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-09-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nEnveloping the world in the gentle warmth of sunlight, Asuna, Lisbeth, Koharu, and Alice are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSunshine Goddess Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Priestess Gazing at the Sky] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Burdock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +120%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Wishing for A Good Harvest] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurning Smash\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n45\nSkill Effect\n1630% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Party's attack +15% for 15 sec./[Flame Force 5/Buff (PT)] Fire element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Drawing In Joy] Koharu\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Wind Boost/Tailwind\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Wind Boost 4] Elemental damage other than wind dealt to enemies -50%, and wind element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 2] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Oracle from the Halo] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Bump\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[Wishing for A Good Harvest] Lisbeth\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nSeptember 1, 2023 (Fri) 0:00 - September 30, 2023 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
