    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023] A special program will be streamed!\nEVENT\n2023-08-27 09:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nSAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023 on now!\nFor this memorable occasion, we'll premiere a special program presented by well-known members of the Weekend IF team!\nThe program will answer your questions, and may also include rare data reports you've been wanting to see.\nWe hope you enjoy this special program jam-packed with information!\n▼ Summary\nDate/Time:\nStarts August 27, 2023 (Sun) 12:00 (JST/UTC+9)\nURL：\n◆YouTube Live\nhttps://youtu.be/FKmqQEz9k94\nAfter logging in, tap the URL to launch the YouTube app or browser app.\nImportant\nThe content and schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nThe live stream will be presented in Japanese.\nGo to Notice List"
