    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023] The Fishing Ranking Event \"Strategy Meeting Fishing Competition\" is on now!\nEVENT\n2023-08-27 09:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nSAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023 on now!\nFishing Ranking Event \"Strategy Meeting Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"Strategy Meeting Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\n▼ Ranking Period\nAugust 27, 2023 (Sun) 13:00 - 15:00 (JST/UTC+9)\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > Strategy Meeting Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nThe ranking rewards will be equivalent to those from the Midsummer Fishing Competition 2023!\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nStrategy Mtg Fishing King\nRevive Crystal×1\nStrategy Mtg Fishing Elite\nRevive Crystal×1\nStrategy Mtg Fishing Mania\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nThere are 8 locations in total, with day and night versions of the Event Maps \"Beach\" and \"On Board\", and day and night versions of Serene Shore and Peaceful Forest Path on 22F.\nHead to the day beach by talking to the \"Beach Guide\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nMove to the night beach by talking to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC at the day beach.\nMove on board the boat by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the beach.\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nEvent Map & 22F\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nBeach (Day)\n1～10\nOn Board (Day)\n11～15\nBeach (Night)\n16～20\nOn Board (Night)\n21～\nSerene Shore (Day)\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path (Day)\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing King\n1\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing Elite\n1\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing Mania\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing Elite\n1\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing Mania\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:Strategy Mtg Fishing Mania\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from August 28, 2023 (Mon) 15:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until September 6, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
