    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023] The \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-08-27 09:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nSAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023 on now!\nUse hints to guess the next destination and discover the treasure box!\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is on now.\nIn the \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\", use the on-screen hints to get to your destination.\nOnce you've arrived, new hints will appear to help you get to the next one.\nComplete the quest by reaching the final destination and finding the treasure box.\nIf you lose track of the hints along the way, you can check them at any time by tapping \"Show hint\" on the quest details screen.\nQuest Reward\nArcana Gems×100\n1,500,000Col\nEXP 3,000,000\nSAOIF Strategy Mtg T-Shirt D\nReward Avatar\nItem Name\nAvatar Images\nSAOIF Strategy Mtg T-Shirt D\nAchievement Rewards\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nDiscovery! SM Treasure Hunt\nClear the [Riddle] Strategy Meeting Treasure Hunt\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to Argo in the Tolbana Amphitheater to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nAugust 27, 2023 (Sun) 15:00 - 17:00 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [From Knowledge, Life]\nImportant\nThe \"Discovery! Riddle Quest\" is a 1x Only quest.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
