    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The \"Intensive Training Event VS Kirito\" is here! Get tons of Skill Records, and earn lots of Medals of Combat Arts in Serious Matches!\nEVENT\n2023-08-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nClear the intensive training with Kirito every day and get a lot of Skill Records!\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event  VS Kirito\n\" will begin.\nThe extremely difficult\nSerious Match\n, where you can fight a dual-wielding Kirito, is on now! The recommended Total Power is 250,000!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nRewards\nSkill Records that were rewards in past events or are available in quests can now be obtained from score rewards!\nYou can also get up to 25 Medals of Combat Arts in the extremely difficult Serious Match added to the event this time around!\nAvailable Skill Records (Partial)\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mr. Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 23, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n100\n★3[Dashing Sword-Point] Yuuki\n1\n200\n★1[Cool Strike] Kirito\n1\n300\n★3[Fishing Master] Nishida\n1\n400\n★1[Tough Girl] Leafa\n1\n500\n★3[Sleeping In] Alice\n1\n600\n★1[Charismatic] Diavel\n1\n700\n★3[Brave Fight] Kirito\n1\n800\n★1[Craftsman's Pride] Lisbeth\n1\n900\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n1\n1000\n★1[Spear Girl] Sachi\n1\n1100\n★4[Scarlet Loyalty] Asuna\n1\n1200\n★1[Passionate Smith] Agil\n1\n1300\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n1\n1400\n★1[Pure and Naive] Koharu\n1\n1500\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n1\n1600\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\n1\n1800\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n1\n2000\n★4[Swordsman's Pride] Kirito\n1\n2200\n★4[Straight-forward Will] Eugeo\n1\n2400\n★4[Azure Swordsman's Memory] Eugeo\n1\n2600\n★4[Black Swordsman's Memory] Kirito\n1\n2800\n★3[Madder Red] Sanya\n1\n3000\nRecord Frame S\n80\n3200\nRecord Kit S\n80\n3400\nRed Jewel\n40\n3600\nGreen Jewel\n40\n3800\nYellow Jewel\n40\n4000\nBlue Jewel\n80\n4200\nRecord Frame M\n40\nSerious Match\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n1600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n1800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2200\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2400\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2600\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n2800\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Matches.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
