    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Summer Festival Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-08-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne yukata- or summer festival-themed ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nSummer Festival Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nAfter the August 16, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - August 31, 2023 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Wavering Water & Sky Tones] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSand Rain\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n670% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 175%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shrine Carrier Supporter] Yui\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Wind\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Summer Festival Night] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Thrust Protect/Gale Blade\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Festival Stroll] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n32\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 20%./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Hands Full of Snacks] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nStorm Blow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1150% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 15 sec (Stack 5) +0.5% for every Stack 1./[Bleed Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's bleed resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Bleed) and bleed damage +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Top Idol] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Sound\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 3) at a specific rate for 30 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Burn (Stack 5) for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] 20% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[New Heroine Idol] Koharu\nSkill Name\nBurn Precision Attack/Burning Blow\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n60\nHP\n1510\nSkill Effect\n●[Burn Precision Attack 3] Critical rate +10% towards opponents with burn./[Burning Blow 4] Attack against burned enemies increases 22%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Colossal Fireworks] Silica\nSkill Name\nGiant's Gauntlet\nAttack\n35\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2700\nSkill Effect\n[Giant's Gauntlet 4] While the buff of your own additional damage is in effect, attack becomes +25%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
