    "name": "점검 안내(8/16)",
    "image": "https://saoif-com.akamaized.net/web/shop_login/en/img/information/6bdfd7fdf5de7b4ce36e01c54059a954.png",
    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/3179.html",
    "news_date": 1692090000,
    "news_category": "MAINT.",
    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  2023년 8월 16일 14:00부터 실시한 점검이 2023년 8월 16일 17:00(JST/UTC+9)에 완료되었습니다. 다음은 새로운 업데이트입니다.  ▼새로 구현된 신규 이벤트 '길드 오브 길드' 시즌 38 시작 '카다 헌트' 시작 '차...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/16)\nMAINT.\n2023-08-15 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/16, 2023 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 38 begins\n\"Kada Hunt\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/16 Maintenance\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Explore the dungeon with Yui\"\n\"Fatal Battle: Sticky Thing\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n\"Evening Breeze Grab Bag 2023 Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
