    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/9)\nMAINT.\n2023-08-08 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/9, 2023 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 38 begins\n\"Klein's Test of Courage Operation [Returning]\" begins\n\"2023 Midsummer Fishing Competition\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nAdded [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Yui, Glow of the Heart\" Event rewards\n\"New Order\" begins\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
