    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드에서는 코하루, 아스나, 산야, 시논이 펑크 록 패션을 입고 등장합니다! \"펑크 록 걸즈 오더\"가 왔습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! ★4 스킬 레코드 1개는 다음과 같습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Punk Rock Girls Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-07-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Asuna, Sanya, and Sinon are dressed in punk rock fashion in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPunk Rock Girls Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Cute Walker] Koharu\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Flame Conversion\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Idol Mode] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRed Pulsar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +30% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Off-shot] Sanya\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nEarth Punishment\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n59\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Knight's Shield 4/Buff]Own DEF increases (Stack 3) +1% per Stack for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Cool Beat] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHeat Plasma\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 21, 2023 (Fri) 17:00 - August 20, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
