    "full_details": "Notices\nImproved the drop rates for production materials up to the Lux Integral Series!\nUPDATE\n2023-07-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nThe July 5, 2023 (Wed) maintenance improved the drop rates of Integral Series, Nox Integral Series, and Lux Integral Series production materials in Labyrinth.\nThis is a good opportunity to get any you haven't managed to obtain yet.\nLocations of Drop Rate Improvements\nProduction materials\n13F Labyrinth – Entry\nBlazing Armament Stone\nBlazing Flame Arms\n13F Labyrinth – Interior\n14F Labyrinth – Entry\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\nHalf Beast's Horn\n14F Labyrinth – Interior\n20F Labyrinth – Entry\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\nOne-Eyed Beast Fang\n20F Labyrinth – Interior\n25F Labyrinth – Entry\nAsura Armament Stone\nAsura Iron Ball\n25F Labyrinth – Interior\n27F Labyrinth – Entry\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\nCrossgigas Iron Chain\n27F Labyrinth – Interior\n35F Labyrinth – Entry\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\nSticky Thing Fluid\n35F Labyrinth – Interior\n40F Labyrinth – Entry\nWarden Armament Stone\nWarden's Glove\n40F Labyrinth – Interior\n47F Labyrinth – Entry\nButterfly Armament Stone\nButterfly Scale\n47F Labyrinth – Interior\n50F Labyrinth – Entry\nLast Number Armament Stone\nLast Number Claw\n50F Labyrinth – Interior\nFor whichever floor, the drop rate in the Labyrinth - Interior will be set much higher.\nWork with your party and collect production materials dropped from the bosses to get your hands on powerful weapons!\nIntegral Series (Required Level 101)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nGusion\n1H Sword\n1220\nArc Angel\n1H Rapier\n1197\nStingray\n1H Club\n1220\nAfter Glow\n2H Axe\n1382\nGluttony\n2H Spear\n1357\nRadgrid\nBow\n1331\nNocturne\nDagger\n1197\nNox Integral Series (Required Level 121)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nNox Gusion\n1H Sword\n1434\nNox Arc Angel\n1H Rapier\n1407\nNox Stingray\n1H Club\n1434\nNox After Glow\n2H Axe\n1644\nNox Gluttony\n2H Spear\n1614\nNox Radgrid\nBow\n1583\nNox Nocturne\nDagger\n1407\nLux Integral Series (Required Level 141)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nForneus\n1H Sword\n1648\nDominion\n1H Rapier\n1617\nAlbatross\n1H Club\n1648\nTwilight\n2H Axe\n1905\nGreed\n2H Spear\n1870\nSigrun\nBow\n1835\nRhapsody\nDagger\n1617\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nOn higher floors, the Rosso Integral Series (Required Level 161) and other higher-level weapons will appear.\nClear the floors of Aincrad, and try to get the series that best suits your level!\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
