    "full_details": "Notices\nPlayer and Assisting Character level caps have been raised!\nUPDATE\n2023-07-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nThe level caps for players and Assisting Characters were raised as of the maintenance on July 5, 2023 (Wed).\nPlayer Level Cap Raised\nThe player level cap has been raised from\nLv.210 to Lv.220\n.\nThe new Dark Black series equipment has also been added.\nIt can be equipped from Lv.215, so make sure you're at a high enough level!\nThe Lv.215 Dark Black Series \"Dark Black Sea Snake\" is here! New boss monster added to the \"Chaos Showdown\"!\nAssisting Characters' Level Cap Raised\nThe Assisting Character level cap has been raised from Lv.100 to\nLv.120\n.\nThe Friendship Rank cap has also been raised to 70.\nStarting at Lv.101, Assisting Characters will equip Integral Series weapons.\n* Alice and Eugeo will have weapons equal to that of the Integral Series.\nAt Lv.100-Lv.109, they will have Lv.95 Dark Black Series armor. At Lv.110 and above, they will have Lv.110 Dark Black Series armor.\nForm a party with Assisting Characters and get stronger together!\nGo to Notice List"
