    "snippet": "새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드에는 리파, 앨리스, 코하루, 에길이 바다 깊은 곳에 살고 있습니다! \"심해 유토피아 질서\"가 여기에 있습니다! 5단계에서 새로운 ★4 스킬 기록 1개를 보장받으세요! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! ★4 스킬 레코드 1개는...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Deep Sea Utopia Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-07-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLeafa, Alice, Koharu, and Agil reside deep beneath the sea in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe  \"\nDeep Sea Utopia Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\r\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Journey of the Ocean Deep] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the critical damage -300%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Calculating Smile] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Bump\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1860% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Envoy of the Dragon Palace] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHoly Demolishing\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1760% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers +4 → 12 → 20 SP when this skill direct hits.\n★4[To the Dragon Palace!] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nPhoton Split\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Gust 4/Buff] Attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n\"[Calculating Smile] Alice\", \"[Envoy of the Dragon Palace] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 1, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - July 31, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
