    "snippet": "새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드에서 키리토와 사치가 아름답고 행복한 왕국을 통치합니다! \"우아한 왕국 질서\"가 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! 3단계에서는 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개가 보장됩니다!  【신규 ★4 스킬 기록】 ★4...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Graceful Kingdom Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-06-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito and Sachi rule over a beautiful and happy kingdom in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nGraceful Kingdom Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black Hero King] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShut In Prison\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1620% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Stern Determination] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurrowing Fire\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2100% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Black Hero King] Kirito\", \"[Stern Determination] Sachi\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJune 25, 2023 (Sun) 17:00 - July 21, 2023 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Duration\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
