    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Connect Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Connect Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-06-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Connect Skills\"!\nThe \"\nConnect Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Connect Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Connect Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[On Track to the Future] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nEarth Orbit\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Fishing Girl] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVorpal Storm\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers 1500 → 3000 → 4500 HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Purifying Katashiro] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nShadow Reap\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nJune 18, 2023 (Sun) 17:00 - June 30, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Connect Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Connect Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Connect Skill!\nOne ★4 Connect Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
