    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  2023년 6월 7일 13:00부터 실시한 점검이 2023년 6월 7일 17:00(JST/UTC+9)에 완료되었습니다. 다음은 새로운 업데이트입니다.  ▼새롭게 구현된 & 신규 이벤트 \"길드 오브 길드\" 프리시즌 36 시작 [홀리데이 캠페인] \"멀...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/7)\nMAINT.\n2023-06-06 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n6/7, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 36 begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Holiday Campaign] \"Sweet Meiolania Hunt\"\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 6/7 Maintenance\n[Holiday Campaign] \"100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
