    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Sunshine After the Rain Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-05-31 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Leafa, Sinon, and Silica are enjoying a walk under sunny skies in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe  \"\nSunshine After the Rain Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\r\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Seven Colors After the Rain] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Shower\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n70\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1710% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using dark skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Dark element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Rainbow After The Rain] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1500% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Rainbows, Droplets, and...] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShadow Volt\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Walking After The Rain] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Back Up\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Back Up 1] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 3 or more of Silica's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records: Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +15%.When equipping 1 or more of Agil's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDragon Qi\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n[Seven Colors After the Rain] Asuna is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the May 31, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - June 30, 2023 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
