    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/25)\nMAINT.\n2023-05-25 11:21:48\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nWe will be implementing maintenance to correspond to defects in effect within the scheduled dates down below.\n-Scheduled maintenance dates\nMay 25, 2023 11:45 to 12:45 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n-Maintenance Contents\nWe will fix the numbers to the correct value for the 47F field monsters that were appearing with a higher HP than expected.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
