    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Spy Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-05-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Sinon, Argo, and Sachi are all dressed as spies in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSpy Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Supporter from the Shadows] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nVigor Shadow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1560% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Hunter's Eye 4/Buff] The lower you HP, critical rate increases for 15 sec./[Adversity 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec.\n- Uncharged -\n970% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 3)\n*Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Noiseless Intruder] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nIce Down\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Restore 2000 HP when hitting with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Code Breaker] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nEarth Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1400% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Shots Will Be Fired] Kirito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Petrify Res./Power Rise/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Petrify Res. 4] Petrify resistance +50%./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[High Battle Healing 3]Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAfter the May 10, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - June 9, 2023 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
