    "snippet": "게임 운영팀의 도전! 거의 불가능합니다! 게임팀의 지옥으로의 초대. 극도로 어려운 던전 '치명전'이 등장했습니다! 우리의 능력을 최대한 활용하고, 있는 힘껏 도전해 봅시다!  보상 두 가지 던전이 있습니다: 치명적인 전투 지원...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nA challenge from the game's management team! Extremely Difficult \"Fatal Battle: Centaur Chieftain\"!\nEVENT\n2023-05-02 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA challenge from the game's management team!\nAlmost impossible! An invitation to hell from the game team.\nThe extremely difficult dungeon \"Fatal Battle\" has appeared!\nLet's make full use of our abilities and challenge it with all we've got!\nRewards\nThere are two dungeons available: Fatal Battle Super and Fatal Battle Super (Group OK).\nIf you defeat the boss of \"Fatal Battle Super\", you will receive the \"\nF.C. Chieftain Victor S\n\" item as proof and the \"F.C. Chieftain Victor S\" record from the achievements.\nDefeat the \"Fatal Battle Super (Group OK)\" boss and receive the \"\nF.C. Chieftain Opponent S\n\" item as well as the \"F.C. Chieftain Opponent S\" record from the achievements as proof of defeating a powerful enemy.\nDungeon\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nFatal Battle Super\nF.C. Chieftain Victor S\nObtain the F.C. Chieftain Victor S\nRevive Crystal×1\nFatal Battle Super (Group OK)\nF.C. Chieftain Opponent S\nObtain the F.C. Chieftain Opponent S\nRevive Crystal×1\nF.C. Chieftain Victor S Record Background\nF.C. Chieftain Opponent S Record Background\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Fatal Battle\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nMay 2, 2023 (Tue) 12:00 - Before the May 10, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nFatal Centaur Chieftain\nDetails\nThis is a vicious monster with high HP, attack, and defense.\nYou can perform breaks.\nWhen a break happens, it receives a stack debuff that increases the damage it takes.\nEach crystal adds a powerful debuff to the player when it appears.\nWhen each crystal is destroyed, it removes the debuff that was added when it appeared.\nIt uses many buffs, debuffs, and status ailments that drag players closer to their demise.\nDetermine the boss's state and the progress of the battle, and use your battle experience to defeat it.\nWeakness\n？？？\nResistance\nWeapon Elemental Attributes Other Than Weapon Elemental Weakness\nCritical\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n\"Groups\"\nYou can take on \"Fatal Battle Super (Group OK)\" with a group of up to 18 members.\nHow to Join Groups\nTo create or join a group, talk to the Fatal Battle NPC and select Fatal Battle Super (Group OK), then choose \"Challenge with a group (18)\".\nYou will automatically move to the standby map.\nYou can display the standby member list from the action button on the bottom right of the screen.\nWhen groups are formed, players who are not already in a party will be put into a party together and sent to the dungeon automatically.\nIf you would like to join a random group, we recommend using \"Quick Group\" to automatically join a group you can participate in.\nWhile on the Fatal Battle group Waiting Room screen, players can check the number of members, view the weapons equipped to Set 1, and see the Group Total Power.\nThe \"18\" on the button indicates the maximum number of group members.\nIf you are in a party, only the party leader can create or join a Group.\nScore Rewards\nFatal Battle Super\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nRevive Crystal\n3\nFatal Battle Super (Group OK)\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nRevive Crystal\n3\nChallenge Rewards\n·Fatal Battle Super\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss\nF.C. Chieftain Victor S\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nHealing Crystal\n1\nUsed switch 6 chain and above\nLife Potion\n1\n·Fatal Battle Super (Group OK)\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss\nF.C. Chieftain Opponent S\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nHealing Crystal\n1\nUsed switch 6 chain and above\nLife Potion\n1\nImportant\nThe same boss will appear in both \"Fatal Battle Super\" and \"Fatal Battle Super (Group OK)\" dungeons.\nYou can get the \"F.C. Chieftain Victor S\" and \"F.C. Chieftain Opponent S\" items from challenge rewards.\nThe \"F.C. Chieftain Victor S\" and \"F.C. Chieftain Opponent S\" items will be deleted on May 10, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nCan be attempted in a party of up to 6 players.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-05-02T03:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-05-09T19:00:00+00:00"
