    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Rest & Relaxation Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-05-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Leafa, and Sachi are taking a breather in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nRest & Relaxation Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Perfect Day for a Nap] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Torrent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n108\nBreak Gauge\n46\nSkill Effect\n1750% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9)./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] When hitting with this skill while using switch, own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 9).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Midday Fruit Parfait] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n34\nSkill Effect\n1750% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Stray Cat Playtime] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFlame Divide\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n95\nBreak Gauge\n63\nSkill Effect\n1640% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Holiday Knitting] Sachi\nSkill Name\nCombination/Hold the Front/Tailwind\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Combination 5] Skill's power is added +150% when used in switch./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.［Tailwind 1］ Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nMay 1, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - May 31, 2023 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
