    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 20 Happy Birthday: \"LLENN Birthday GGO Login Bonus\" is here!\nEVENT\n2023-04-14 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn celebration of LLENN's birthday on April 20, the \"LLENN Birthday GGO Login Bonus\" will be held.\nGet Memory Stamps and avatars of\n\"LLENN\"\nand\n\"Pitohui\"\nfrom the SAO Alternative GGO anime when you log in during the event.\nPeriod\nApril 14, 2023 (Fri) 4:00 - June 1, 2023 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nType\nItem Icon\nDay1\nLLENN Avatar Costume Cap\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay2\nLLENN Avatar Costume Pouch\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay3\nLLENN Avatar Costume Scarf\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\nDay4\nLLENN Avatar Costume Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nDay5\nLLENN Avatar Costume Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nDay6\nMemory Stamp 231\nUse to obtain the \"Urgh...\" stamp.\nItems\nDay7\nPitohui Costume Tattoo\nAccessory Avatar\nDay8\nPitohui Costume Pouch\nAccessory Avatar\nDay9\nPitohui Costume Set\nFull Body Avatar/For both Male Female\nDay10\nArcana Gem×100\nItems\n* Memory Stamps will be sent directly to the Present box. The stamp will be registered automatically when you receive it.\nImmerse yourself in the world of SAOIF as \"LLENN\" and \"Pitohui\"!\nImportant\nSome of the avatars available have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nYou can receive the login bonus after completing the quest \"Another Reality\".\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
