    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  2023년 4월 12일 13:00부터 실시한 점검이 2023년 4월 12일 17:00(JST/UTC+9)에 완료되었습니다. 다음은 새로운 업데이트입니다.  ▼새롭게 구현된 & 신규 이벤트 '길드 오브 길드' 프리시즌 34 시작, 대숙련 아이템...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/12)\nMAINT.\n2023-04-11 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/12, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 34 begins\nGreat Proficiency Items Event \"April Boss Rush\" begins\nThe Scenario Event \"Advanced Notice Full of Dreams\" is back\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the Scenario event \"All Together! IF Kindergarten\"\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/12 Maintenance\n【5 Year Anniversary】Hunting Event \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\"\n【5 Year Anniversary】The Scenario Event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\"\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"The Way of the Swordsmen Panel Mission\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
