    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  2023년 4월 5일 13:00부터 실시한 점검이 2023년 4월 5일 17:00(JST/UTC+9)에 완료되었습니다. 다음은 새로운 업데이트입니다.  ▼새롭게 구현된 & 신규 이벤트 시나리오 이벤트 '히로인 파괴 랩소디'가 돌아왔습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(4/5)\nMAINT.\n2023-04-04 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n4/5, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe Scenario Event \"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\" is back\nThe Scenario Event \"Jumping Kibaou\" is back\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAdded【5 Year Anniversary】Hunting Event \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 4/5 Maintenance\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
