    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Over Gear Technology Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-03-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Yuuki, Lisbeth, and Agil in mechanized equipment are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nOver Gear Technology Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sky Cruising] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nEnhance Stun Res./Power Rise/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Stun Res. 4] Stun resistance +70%./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[High Battle Healing 3]Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pioneering an Era] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStone Rush\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1390% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Element Weak 3/Debuff] Earth element damage to monster +15% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Gear Soldier] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nBurning Fan\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n1850% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[The Trial That Awaits] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHeat Asterisk\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Flame Force 5/Buff (PT)] Fire element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Thrust Erosion Mark/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, for thrust element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 22, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends April 23, 2023 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
