    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다.  2023년 2월 28일 12:00부터 실시한 점검이 2023년 2월 28일 17:00(JST/UTC+9)에 완료되었습니다. 다음은 새로운 업데이트입니다.  ▼새롭게 구현된 & 새로운 이벤트 【5주년 기념】\"길드 전략 이벤트 밀레니엄 숲\"...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/28)\nMAINT.\n2023-02-27 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/28, 2023 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"Guild Strategy Event  Millennium Woods\" begins\n\"Boost Mode Multiplier UP Campaign\" begins\nAdded  Hunting Event \"Cat Hunt\" Event rewards\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"Daily Dungeon +2\" begins\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/28 Maintenance\nThe Scenario Event \"Female Swordman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back\n\"Ordinal Scale Selection Order\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
