    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Koharu's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Koharu!\nShop\n2023-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Koharu's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Gazing Into the Future] Koharu\n\" and \"\n[Next Move] Koharu\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKoharu's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Koharu guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Koharu\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Gazing Into the Future] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Boost/Talent Shift\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Boost 4] Elemental damage other than dark dealt to enemies -50%, and dark element's damage to enemies +40%./[Talent Shift 5] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, +success rate for Frostbite.Attack +20% when equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Next Move] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Wind\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 23, 2023 (Thu) 0:00 - March 4, 2023 (Sat) 23:59\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n★4 \"Koharu\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Koharu\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
