    "snippet": "지금 바로 앨리시제이션 이벤트를 플레이하고 특별 \"앨리시제이션 패널 미션\"에서 보상을 받으세요!  보상 앨리시제이션 이벤트 퀘스트를 클리어하여 Dragonbone Axe 아바타, 견고한 전투 검과 같은 유용한 아이템을 얻으세요. 청장미검 아바타에게서 티제 스탬프를 받고, 니니에게서 로니 스탬프를 받아보세요.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Alicization Panel Mission\" is on now! Play the Alicization Event and get 1,000 Arcana Gems as a completion reward!\nEVENT\n2023-02-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nPlay the Alicization Event, and get rewards from the special\n\"Alicization Panel Mission\"\non now!\nRewards\nClear the Alicization Event quest to get useful items like the Dragonbone Axe avatar and Sturdy Battle Sword.\nGet the Tiese stamp from the Blue Rose Sword avatar, and the Ronie stamp from the Night-Sky Blade avatar.\nGet 1,000 Arcana Gems as a completion reward for clearing all the missions listed on a panel.\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nTiese\nRonie\nWeapon Avatar\nIcon\nEquipment Name\nEquipment Type\nDragonbone Axe\n2H Axe\nWeapon\nIcon\nItem Name\nAttack ₍Maximum₎\nSturdy Battle Sword\n368\n* \"Sturdy Battle Sword\" is an item that is not available for Transformation or Succession.\nPeriod\nStarts after the February 22, 2023 Maintenance - (End date TBD)\nMission Details\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear all quests from The Myserious Duo\nDragonbone Axe\n1\nClear all quests from Another World\nGlare Dragon Stone\n120\nClear all quests from A Flurry of Reunions\nSturdy Battle Sword\n1\nClear all quests from The Knight and Blacksmith's Quattro Mani\nFragrant Olive Piece\n2\nClear all quests from The Blade That Cuts Evil\nRecord Frame L\n120\nClear all quests from Welcome to Aliceland!\nRevive Crystal\n60\nClear all quests from Unlasting\nFruit Water\n120\nGet a Blue Rose Sword\nMemory Stamp 70\nUse to obtain the \"Tiese\" stamp.\n1\nGet a Night-Sky Blade\nMemory Stamp 69\nUse to obtain the \"Ronie\" stamp.\n1\nComplete Reward\nAmount\nArcana Gems\n1000\nAlicization Event\nAn event in celebration of the broadcast of the SWORD ART ONLINE –Alicization– anime and SWORD ART ONLINE –Alicization– War of Underworld.\nTalk to the Alicization Event Guide at the Teleport Gate Plaza to head to the Event Map, where you can accept Alicization Event quests.\nImportant\nIf the requirements for a mission have already been met, the mission will be marked achieved at the time of the event.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
