    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Valentine's Selection 2023 Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2023-02-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record that has appeared in Valentine's Orders up until 2022 is guaranteed!\nThe \"\nValentine's Selection 2023 Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nFebruary 4, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - Before the February 14, 2023 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Trick Cookie] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Split\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] Critical damage +15% against enemies with the thrust element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Valentine's Assault] Leafa\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Bleed Aim\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n3025\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./●[Enhance Bleed Aim 4] Chance of bleed UP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Attention to Detail] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRock Torrent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n46\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Confectionery Training] Alice\nSkill Name\nIcy Blade/Light Dance/Outmatch\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Light Dance 4] Deals +20% Holy element's damage to enemy./●[Outmatch 5] 500 of additional damage to enemy when attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lively Whipper] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nDevotion/Full Swing\nAttack\n40\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Devotion 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 75%./[Full Swing 4] Critical rate +20% when HP is above 75%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Lovely Mint] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nVigor Earth\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSwitch Gauge\n102\nBreak Gauge\n32\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1420%damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Evasion 3/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)/▲[Bonus] Additional damage according to number of HITs.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n- Uncharged -\n630% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Evasion 3/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)\n*Gauge value is when charging\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fainted Love] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nHeart Dive\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n780% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Make it Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shy Sweet] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHeart Sting\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n13.0\nSwitch Gauge\n23\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Additional 200 damage per 1 Stack of enemy's Status Ailment (Poison)./[Bonus] Critical rate increases per 1 Stack of enemy's Status Ailment (Bleed).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
