    "snippet": "시나리오 이벤트 '여검사와 여기사와 초콜릿'이 돌아왔습니다!  '여검사와 여기사와 초콜릿'이란? 마을에 갑자기 '키리토'(?) 처럼 생긴 NPC가 나타나 뭔가를 요구하기 시작하는데...!?  보상 던전에서 거래 가능한 \"발렌타인 카드\"를 수집하세요...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back! Get ★4 Yuuki and Asuna Skill Records!\nEVENT\n2023-01-31 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back!\nWhat is \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\"?\nA NPC who looks like \"Kirito\"(?)\nappeared in the town all of a sudden and started demanding things...!?\nRewards\nCollect tradable \"Valentine Cards\" from dungeon monsters and rewards!\nTrade the \"Valentine Cards\" for exclusive Memory Stamps, or\n★4 \"Asuna\"\nand\n\"Yuuki\"\nSkill Records!\nThe limited-edition recovery item \"Friendship Chocolate\" drops on \"DANGER\" and \"Special\" dungeon difficulties.\nGet up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nfrom the entire event.\nSkill Record\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\nSkill Name\nPrecise Attack\nAttack\n39\nDefense\n40\nHP\n800\nSkill Effect\n[Precise Attack 4] Critical rate +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nWeakness Attack\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n38\nHP\n750\nSkill Effect\n[Weakness Attack 4] Critical damage +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n* [Chef in Love] Asuna and [Sweet Affection] Yuuki start with a max level of 30! Max Limit Break them and reach level 100!\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nMaking Chocolate\nGift of Rose\nGift of Blue Rose\nGift of Fragrant Olive\nLimited-Edition Recovery Item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nFriendship Chocolate\nRecover 500 HP of the party members who are in the same field\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" banner to go to the \"Valentine Town\" event map.\nTalk to \"Mr. Kirito\" in the \"Valentine Town\" event map to accept the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the January 31, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the February 28, 2023 (Tue) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nStarts after the January 31, 2023 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the March 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nItem use inside the\n\"Special\"\ndifficulty dungeon is restricted, and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nYou can complete the\n\"Special\"\ndifficulty dungeon is 3 times per day.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nPinky Choco Glutton\nDetails\nIt uses long vine or bite attacks.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nChocolatier Heart Seeker\nDetails\nAppears on \"Special\" difficulty.\r\nIt attacks by charging, performing a body press, or using large cacao beans as weapons.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nTrade \"Valentine Card\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n400\n1\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n500\n4\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n400\n1\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n500\n4\nMemory Stamp 60\nUse to obtain the \"Making Chocolate\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 61\nUse to obtain the \"Gift of Rose\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 62\nUse to obtain the \"Gift of Blue Rose\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMemory Stamp 63\nUse to obtain the \"Gift of Fragrant Olive\" stamp.\n100\n1\nFriendship Chocolate\n30\n50\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n400\nValentine Card\n5\n500\nValentine Card\n10\n800\nHealing Potion\n5\n1000\nHealing Potion\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame M\n10\n1500\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1600\nValentine Card\n10\n2000\nValentine Card\n15\n2000\nHealing Potion\n10\n3000\nCleansing Potion\n10\n2500\nFriendship Chocolate\n5\n4000\nFriendship Chocolate\n10\n3000\nValentine Card\n20\n6000\nValentine Card\n35\n3500\nRecord Frame M\n20\n8000\nRecord Frame L\n25\n4000\nArcana Gem\n50\n10000\nArcana Gem\n50\n5000\nValentine Card\n40\n12000\nValentine Card\n60\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n800\nValentine Card\n15\n900\nValentine Card\n20\n1600\nRestorative Potion\n5\n1800\nRestorative Potion\n10\n2400\nRecord Frame L\n10\n2700\nRecord Frame L\n15\n3200\nValentine Card\n20\n3600\nValentine Card\n30\n4000\nRestorative Potion\n10\n6100\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n6500\nEmergency Crystal\n10\n8600\nEmergency Crystal\n15\n9000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\n11100\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11500\nRecord Frame L\n20\n14000\nValentine Card\n50\n14000\nArcana Gem\n50\n17000\nArcana Gem\n50\n17000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n20000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n3000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n4500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n6000\nSmall Gift\n1\n7500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n20\n9000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\n10500\nRelease Crystal (M)\n20\n12000\nMemoria Niter M\n10\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Female Swordsman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Valentine Cards\" will be deleted on March 8, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a \"Special\" difficulty dungeon 3 times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe high-difficulty level \"Special\" and scenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
