    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Defense Battle ver. 2: \"Attack of the Giant Boar! [Returning]\" is here! Get your hands on the returning Boar Head accessory avatar!\nEVENT\n2023-01-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA defense battle to protect the crystal from the monsters that keep appearing and from the boss monster, Giant Boar!\nGet a higher score by defeating monsters quickly and preventing the crystals placed on the map from taking too much damage.\nPlus, you can get EXP that will help you get stronger.\nRewards\nExchange \"Gi. Boar Medal\" at the Trader for one of the 4 different colored \"Boar Head\" accessory avatars modeled after the Boar.\nGet up to 250\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 50\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 10\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\nThere's a chance that the monsters that appear will drop \"Release Crystals (S)\".\nThere's a chance that \"Star Fragments\" will drop at \"Maniac\" difficulties.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nBoar Head A\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head B\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head C\nAccessory Avatar\nBoar Head D\nAccessory Avatar\nTrade \"Gi. Boar Medal\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nBoar Head A\n300\n2\nBoar Head B\n300\n2\nBoar Head C\n300\n2\nBoar Head D\n300\n2\nArcana Gems×50\n100\n3\nMedal of Combat Arts\n100\n4\nAwakening Star\n25\n50\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n3\nRelease Crystal (M)\n40\n40\nTrader Period\nStarts after the January 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nRunning Dog\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nGreen Vandal\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nComing At You Hard\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Gi. Boar Medals in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Defense Battle\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the January 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nNormal:Unlocked after clearing the 5F Main Quest.\nAdvanced:Unlocked after clearing the 9F Main Quest.\nManiac:Unlocked after clearing the 20F Main Quest.\nBoss Monster\nGiant Boar\nDetails\nUses the Chaos Recollection Buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Increase Attack\" and \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Paralysis\"\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nScore Rewards\nNormal\nAdvanced\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\n250\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n500\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\n500\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n1000\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\n1000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n3000\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\n3000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n5000\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\n5000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n8000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n8000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n11000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n11000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n15000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n15000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n20000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n20000\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n25000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n25000\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n30000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n30000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n35000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n35000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n40000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n40000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n45000\nGi. Boar Medal\n25\n45000\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\n50000\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n50000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\nManiac\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n500\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n1000\nGi. Boar Medal\n100\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n5000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n8000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n11000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n15000\nGi. Boar Medal\n300\n20000\nArcana Gems\n100\n25000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n30000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n35000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n40000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n45000\nGi. Boar Medal\n200\n50000\nGi. Boar Medal\n300\nScore Rank Rewards\nNormal\nRank\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n2000－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n1\nRecord Kit S\n1\nA\n1800－1999\nGi. Boar Medal\n4\nRestorative Potion\n1\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nRecord Frame M\n1\nB\n1500－1799\nGi. Boar Medal\n3\nRestorative Potion\n1\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nC\n800－1499\nGi. Boar Medal\n2\nRestorative Potion\n1\nD\n300－799\nGi. Boar Medal\n1\nAdvanced\nRank\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n2000－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n3\nEmergency Crystal\n3\nRecord Frame L\n2\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\nA\n1800－1999\nGi. Boar Medal\n7\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n1\nB\n1500－1799\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nRestorative Potion\n2\nEmergency Crystal\n1\nC\n800－1499\nGi. Boar Medal\n4\nRestorative Potion\n2\nD\n300－799\nGi. Boar Medal\n3\nManiac\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\nS\n2000－99999\nGi. Boar Medal\n50\nRestorative Potion\n5\nHealing Crystal\n3\nRecord Frame L\n3\nRelease Crystal (S)\n3\nA\n1800－1999\nGi. Boar Medal\n30\nRestorative Potion\n3\nHealing Crystal\n2\nRecord Frame L\n2\nB\n1500－1799\nGi. Boar Medal\n20\nRestorative Potion\n3\nEmergency Crystal\n2\nC\n800－1499\nGi. Boar Medal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n3\nD\n300－799\nGi. Boar Medal\n5\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nWhen the dungeon is finished, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\n\"Gi. Boar Medal\" will be deleted on February 15, 2023 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
