    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Hoverboard Rider Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2023-01-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNew ★4 Skill Records featuring Kirito, Sinon, Argo, and Koharu riding hoverboards have arrived!\nThe \"\nHoverboard Rider Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Higher Than All the Rest] Kirito\nSkill Name\nCrushing Impact/Mallet Blow/Thrust protect\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Crushing Impact 3] Attack +800 when attacking with blunt element./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Thrust protect 3] Reduce damage from 12% thrust element monster.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Trick Jump] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nStone Flux\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n53\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec./[Transforming Switch 4/Buff] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch, your own Evasion rate increases for 20 sec. (Stack 5)+0.3% per 1 Stack. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[High-Speed Floater] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Gust\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1850% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Flying Over Obstacles] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nVortex Fissure\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 22, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
