    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Divine New Year Dress Avatar Order\" is here! Color the New Year with elegant outfit!\nShop\n2022-12-31 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nColor the New Year with elegant outfit!\nThe \"\nDivine New Year Dress Avatar Order\n\" is here including the \"New Year Dress Avatar\", \"Priestess and Priest Avatar\", and \"New Year's Avatar '21\"!\n【New Year Dress Avatar Images】\n【Priestess and Priest Avatar Images】\n【New Year's Avatar '21 Avatar Images】\n- Duration\nDecember 31, 2022 (Sat) 17:00 - January 15, 2023 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nKirito's and Asuna's faces and hairstyles are not included.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
