    "snippet": "홀리데이 캠페인! 지금 바로 키리토, 코하루 등과 대화하여 기념파티에서 유용한 선물을 받으세요!  보상 먼저 '텔레포트 게이트 광장'에 있는 미스 아스나와 대화하면 이벤트 맵 '화려한 축제 지역'으로 이동합니다. 이벤트 맵 '화려한 축제 지역'에서 하루에 한 번씩 키리토와 친구들과 대화를 나눠보세요...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Holiday Campaign】\"Memorial Party\" is here! Talk to Kirito, Koharu, and others to get gifts!\nEVENT\n2022-11-30 16:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nTalk to Kirito, Koharu, and others to get useful gifts in the Memorial Party, on now!\nRewards\nFirst, talk to Miss Asuna in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to go to the Event Map \"Glamorous Festival Area\".\nIn the Event Map \"Glamorous Festival Area\", talk to Kirito and friends once a day to accept Quests where you can get gifts as rewards.\nAdditionally, Kirito and others may have conversations ready based on your status, if you have cleared certain floors.\nCharacter name\nGifts\nAmount\nKirito\nGlare Rigid Stone\n5\nGlare Dragon Stone\n2\nAsuna\nRestorative Potion\n10\nLife Potion\n1\nLeafa\nRecord Frame M\n5\nRecord Frame L\n2\nSinon\nRelease Crystal (S)\n2\nLisbeth\nCommon Metal Scrap\n3\nSilica\nEnergy Fruit\n1\nYuuki\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nSachi\nRevive Crystal\n2\nMater\nExp Crystal S\n5\nLueur\nGolden Bells\n1\nStilla\nSmall Gift\n1\nTyphon\nRed Hot Ore\n1\nKoharu\nCleansing Potion\n10\nFruit Water\n2\nAlice\nRecord Kit S\n6\nRecord Kit M\n2\nEugeo\nRefining Hammer\n6\nRefining Hammer+\n2\nKlein\nSlicing Stone\n3\nSlicing Stone+\n1\nAgil\nStriking Stone\n3\nStriking Stone+\n1\nArgo\nPiercing Stone\n3\nPiercing Stone+\n1\nYuna\nYellow Jewel\n3\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n1\nNautilus\nGreen Jewel\n3\nHigh Green Jewel\n1\nKibaou\nBlue Jewel\n6\nHigh Blue Jewel\n2\nLiten\nBlocking Stone\n6\nBlocking Stone+\n2\nSanya\nRed Jewel\n3\nHigh Red Jewel\n1\nEvent Period\nAfter the November 30, 2022 (Wed) maintenance - December 31, 2022 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nImportant\nThe Quests daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
