    "snippet": "★4 신규 스킬 레코드에는 시논, 리파, 리즈벳, 싼야가 간호사 복장을 하고 있습니다! \"성역 천사 명령\"이 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! ★4 스킬 레코드 1개가 보장됩니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ministering Angels Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-11-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSinon, Leafa, Lisbeth, and Sanya are dressed as nurses in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nMinistering Angels Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Medical Supporter] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nStorm Wheel\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n980% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 30 sec./[Wind Element Weak 3/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +15% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Healing Nutrionist] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nShadow Crush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[The Call of Blood] Sanya\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Out of Sorts\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Out of Sorts 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP, the attack and damage -99% when using normal attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[High Tech Nurse] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nCross Ray\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n670% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to the enemies that have a buff effect./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nNovember 11, 2022 (Fri) 17:00 - December 4, 2022 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
