    "snippet": "100F 기념! 매일 키리토와 함께 집중훈련을 클리어하고 스킬레코드를 많이 획득하자! \"집중훈련 이벤트 VS 키리토\"가 시작됩니다.  과거 이벤트 보상이나 퀘스트 보상이었던 보상 스킬 기록을 이제 점수 보상으로 획득할 수 있습니다!  사용 가능한 스킬 기록...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Intensive Training Event  VS Kirito\" is here! Get tons of Skill Records!\nEVENT\n2022-11-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating 100F!\nClear the intensive training with Kirito every day and get a lot of Skill Records!\nThe \"\nIntensive Training Event  VS Kirito\n\" will begin.\nRewards\nSkill Records that were rewards in past events or are available in quests can now be obtained from score rewards!\nAvailable Skill Records (Partial)\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Mr. Kirito\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the November 9, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 30, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n100\n★3[Dashing Sword-Point] Yuuki\n1\n200\n★1[Cool Strike] Kirito\n1\n300\n★3[Fishing Master] Nishida\n1\n400\n★1[Tough Girl] Leafa\n1\n500\n★3[Sleeping In] Alice\n1\n600\n★1[Charismatic] Diavel\n1\n700\n★3[Brave Fight] Kirito\n1\n800\n★1[Craftsman's Pride] Lisbeth\n1\n900\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n1\n1000\n★1[Spear Girl] Sachi\n1\n1100\n★4[Scarlet Loyalty] Asuna\n1\n1200\n★1[Passionate Smith] Agil\n1\n1300\n★4[Man of the Day] Kirito\n1\n1400\n★1[Pure and Naive] Koharu\n1\n1500\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n1\n1600\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\n1\n1800\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n1\n2000\n★4[Swordsman's Pride] Kirito\n1\n2200\n★4[Straight-forward Will] Eugeo\n1\n2400\n★4[Azure Swordsman's Memory] Eugeo\n1\n2600\n★4[Black Swordsman's Memory] Kirito\n1\n2800\n★3[Madder Red] Sanya\n1\n3000\nRecord Frame S\n80\n3200\nRecord Kit S\n80\n3400\nRed Jewel\n40\n3600\nGreen Jewel\n40\n3800\nYellow Jewel\n40\n4000\nBlue Jewel\n80\n4200\nRecord Frame M\n40\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
