    "news_date": 1666771200,
    "news_category": "Campaign",
    "snippet": "붉은 뜨거운 광석, 뜨거운 광석, 강렬하게 뜨거운 광석을 얻을 수 있는 기회입니다. 캠페인 기간 동안 모든 토끼종 출현율이 2배! 게다가 현장에 두 배 더 오래 머물게 됩니다!  캠페인 기간은 2022년 10월 26일(수) 점검 후부터 11월 1일 전까지 종료됩니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nRabbit Fever is here! All rabbit species appear twice as often and stay in the field twice as long!\nCampaign\n2022-10-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThis is your chance to get Red Hot Ores, Scorching Hot Ores, and Intensely Hot Ores.\nDoubled\nappearance rates during the campaign for all rabbit species!\nPlus, they'll stay\ntwice\nas long in the field!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the October 26, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 9, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRabbits\nRagout Rabbits, Cher Rabbits, and Roi Rabbits appear occasionally on the field and drop Hot Ores, a material used for Equipment Refinement.\nEach rabbit type drops a different kind of Hot Ore.\nMore Equipment Refinement Details Here\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
