    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/26)\nMAINT.\n2022-10-25 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/26, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Theatrical Release Celebration Progressive Campaign\" begins\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Rabbit Fever\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the Defense Battle ver. 2: \"Halloween Attack!\"\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/26 Maintenance\n\"99F Start Dash Event\"\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 28\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
