    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice of Schedule Changes\nMAINT.\n2022-10-11 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n▼Notice of Schedule Changes\nThe maintenance that was scheduled for 10/12 (Wed) has been changed to 10/13 (Thu).\nDue to this change, the currently ongoing events and Orders will proceed as follows.\n\"Puppet Master Order\"\nThe period will be extended until maintenance on 10/13 (Thu).\n\"Search for the Phantom Mushroom ['20 Returning]\" is back\nThe period will be extended until maintenance on 10/13 (Thu).\nWorldwide 4.5 Year Anniversary! The Hunting Event \"Scorpion Hunt\"\nThe scheduled date for adding rewards to the Trader has been changed from 10/12/2022 (Wed) following maintenance to 10/13/2022 (Thu) following maintenance.\n\"94F Start Dash Event\"\nThe end of the Trader Period has been changed from 10/12/2022 (Wed) until maintenance to 10/12/2022 (Wed) at 14:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe date for the \"99F\" installation, announced in the  \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\" live stream will also be changed.\n\"99F\" installed\n\"99F Start Dash Event\"\nIt will be released and the event will start after the maintenance on 10/13 (Thu).\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
