    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Tales of Series Collab Order Part 2\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-08-31 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Leafa, Yuuki, and Sinon are dressed in Tales of series character outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe\n\"Tales of Series Collab Order Part 2\"\nis here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Peace-Seeking Knight] Alice\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nHoly Assault\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1440% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Alice Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills while the buff to raise Holy element's damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Passionate Avenger] Sinon\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Seventh Fonic Hymn] Leafa\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Exciting\nAttack\n50\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Exciting 4] Defense -30% and critical damage -300% during the buff effect for increased max HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tempestuous Umbrella Wielder] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPiercing Ray\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 31, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends on September 28, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
