    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Tales of Series Collab Order Part 1\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-08-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Eugeo, and Koharu are dressed in Tales of series character outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe\n\"Tales of Series Collab Order Part 1\"\nis here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Intense Dual Blades] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFalcon's Crest\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Effect\n1500% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Ever Present Battlefied 4/Buff] Attack +8% for 30 sec./[Healing 4/Buff] Slowly recovering its own HP for 60 sec. (1.8%/3 sec.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Master of the Four] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nElemental Mastery\nSP Cost\n32\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Force 4/Buff] Fire element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Aqua Force 4/Buff] Water element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Attuned Mage] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nLightning Swing\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Thrust Erosion Mark/Debuff] For thrust element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Blade of Faith] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nEnhance Attack/RUSH/Fast and Easy\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Attack 5] Attack +18%./[RUSH4] Recovers SP by 30 when hitting with switch and HIT number exceeds 50./[Fast and Easy] Lowers flinch resistance by 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends on September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
