    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Flowers of the Festival Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-08-10 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Sinon, Yui, and Agil are fired up for the festival in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFlowers of the Festival Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Wavering Water & Sky Tones] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSand Rain\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n670% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 175%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Flower of the Shrine] Alice\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Combination\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./●[Combination 3] Skill's power is added +75% when used in switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Shrine Carrier Supporter] Yui\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Wind\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Ironclad Business Spirit] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGale Split\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Gust 4/Buff] Attack +45% for 5 sec./[Sky Talisman 4/Buff] Thrust element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec./[Human Talisman 4/Buff] Slash element damage -80% to enemies for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends on August 31, 2022 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
