    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Aria of a Starless Night Returning Order Part 2\" is here! On Step 5, get one ★4 Skill Record from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 4 and 5 guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-07-08 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Aria of a Starless Night Order, which celebrated the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie, is back with a new lineup!\nOn Step 5 of the \"\nAria of a Starless Night Returning Order Part 2\n\", get one ★4 Skill Record from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 4 or Part 5 guaranteed!\nThe ★4 Skill Records from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 4 and 5 are featured with a higher drop rate!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 5, get one ★4 Skill Record from Part 4 or Part 5 of the Aria of a Starless Night Order guaranteed!\n【★4 Skill Records from Parts 4 & 5 of the Aria of a Starless Night Order】\n★4[Taking the Initiative] Kirito\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurn Spike\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Blaze Demon 3/Buff] Fire element damage +45% for 8 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Critical damage +20%.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n［When Rush Activates］ Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[In My Sight] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Flame\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Secret Wish] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Hold the Front\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill effect\n[Advance Trooper 2] Attack +200./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n［During Rush］ Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Strike of Hope] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Rush\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 1./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Charging Into the Future] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSharp Sprinkler\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Flash of Purple Wind] Mito\nSkill Name\nIcy Blade/Gale Blade/Hot Pursuit\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy./[Hot Pursuit 3] Deal 5000 additional damage against enemies with debuff status.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nJuly 8, 2022 (Fri) 12:00 - July 18, 2022 (Mon) 11:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record from Part 4 or Part 5 of the Aria of a Starless Night Order is guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n★4 Skill Records from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 1-3 will not appear.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
