    "full_details": "Notices\nSWORD ART ONLINE 10th Anniversary! Beginner's Support \"Up to 110 Free Orders\" is here!\nShop\n2022-07-08 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSWORD ART ONLINE 10th Anniversary!\n\"\nUp to 110 Free Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 110 Skill Records!\nDuring the \"\nUp to 110 Free Orders\n\", one free 11x Order will be available every day. Players can take advantage of this for up to 10 days!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Blue Rose in the Night Sky] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Spirit Color\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Spirit Color] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Attack +20%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Additional damage +500.When equipping 1 or more of Alice's Skill Records: Critical rate +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Critical damage +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSwordman's Awakening\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Legendary Sword Succession] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Effect\n1510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Friendship's Combination/Buff] When equipping 1 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Switch damage multiples +300% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill./[Bonus] Additional damage according to number of HITs.\n* Greater increase in switch gauge than normally.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nJuly 8, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - September 1, 2022 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Order per day for up to 10 days total.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
