    "full_details": "Notices\n[6/29 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Weekly! \"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\"! One ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-06-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[6/29 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\nThe \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\" is here!\nTake advantage of the \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\" once per event period!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Battle Style] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Impulse\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers your SP by 8 → 16 → 24 when critical is activated.\n★4[Mermaid Dancer] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage Ground Roar\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1180% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dusk 4/Debuff] Enemy's hit rate -15% for 15 sec.(Evasion more likely to occur)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Event Periods\n①Starts after the May 31, 2022 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n②Starts after the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 15, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n③Starts after the June 15, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n④Starts after the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑤Starts after the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑥Starts after the July 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑦Starts after the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑧Starts after the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the July 27, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑨Starts after the July 27, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 3, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑩Starts after the August 3, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑪Starts after the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 17, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑫Starts after the August 17, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑬Starts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends before the August 31, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
