    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 Dagger Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-06-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none Dagger★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Daggers\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Integral Existence] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDark Edge\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +30% against poisoned enemies./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Greatest Informant] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Temptation\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n840% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack +25% to enemies with (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) Status Ailment./[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 3 on enemies when an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit. Increase status ailment stacks by 5 on enemies when hitting using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Black Attired Dragon Tamer] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nBlaze Slice Burst\nSkill Name\nBlaze Slice\nSP Cost\n22\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nSlash→Slash→\nFire\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n800% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] It will Burn (Stack 3) at a specific rate for 30 sec.\n* When this skill is used in switch and hits, the Burn (Stack 1) will also affect the player.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1600% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Burn/Status Ailments] Make it burn (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] When the Status Ailment (Burn) is on yourself, the attack +20% and critical rate +300%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 18, 2022 17:00 - June 25, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
