    "snippet": "홀리데이 캠페인! 시논과 함께 스킬 레코드 강화와 변신 재료가 가득한 던전에 도전해보세요! 스킬 기록을 강화하기 위해 많은 재료를 모으십시오.  보상 스킬 레코드 강화용 '레코드 프레임 L'을 비롯해 '레코드 키트 M', 각종 '하이 쥬얼' 등을 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Holiday Campaign】Get skill Record enhancement and transformation materials in \"Build Up Skills with Sinon\"\nEVENT\n2022-06-17 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nJoin Sinon and take on a dungeon filled with Skill Record enhancement and transformation materials!\nGather lots of materials to power up your skill Record.\nRewards\nYou can get\n\"Record Frame L\"\nfor Skill Record enhancement, as well as\n\"Record Kit M\", all kinds of \"High Jewels\", and all kinds of \"Jewels\"\nfor transformation from dungeon rewards.\nYou can also get the awakening items\n\"Awakening Star\"\nand\nall kinds of \"Great Jewels\"\nfrom score rewards.\nMonster Drop Items\nRed Jewel,High Red Jewel,Green Jewel,High Green Jewel,Yellow Jewel,High Yellow Jewel,Blue Jewel,High Blue Jewel\nRecord Kit S,Record Frame M\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Sinon\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nJune 17, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - June 24, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nScore Rewards\nBuild Up Skills with Sinon\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n25\nAwakening Star\n5\n50\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n75\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n100\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n125\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n150\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n175\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n200\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n225\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n250\nAwakening Star\n5\n275\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n300\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n325\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n350\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n375\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n400\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n425\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n450\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n475\nAwakening Star\n5\n500\nHigh Red Jewel\n5\n525\nHigh Green Jewel\n5\n550\nHigh Yellow Jewel\n5\n575\nHigh Blue Jewel\n5\n600\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n625\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n650\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n675\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n700\nAwakening Star\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Kit M\n2\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame L\n10\nImportant\nThe dungeon daily clear will update at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Sinon as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
