    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Lisbeth Birthday Present Campaign!\nNOTICES\n2022-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Lisbeth's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Lisbeth's birthday on May 18.\nLet's celebrate Lisbeth's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until May 18, 2022 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
