    "snippet": "지금 바로 '리스벳을 위한 보조 캐릭터 육성 캠페인'으로 리즈벳의 생일을 축하해주세요! 당신과 당신의 보조 캐릭터가 일반 던전보다 더 많은 경험치를 얻을 수 있는 \"지원 캐릭터 키우기 캠페인\"에 참여하세요.  보상 플레이어는 현재 아이템과 체력을 회복할 수 있는 아이템을 획득할 수 있습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Lisbeth\" is here! Build up your Assisting Characters with the dungeon and rewards!\nCampaign\n2022-05-13 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate Lisbeth's birthdays with the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Lisbeth\", on now!\nTake on the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\", where you and your Assisting Characters can earn more EXP than in normal dungeons.\nRewards\nPlayers can acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAlso available are limited items including an Lisbeth Memory Stamp and the \"Special Gift for Lisbeth\", which is a present item that increases Friendship EXP for \"Lisbeth\".\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nDash!\nLimited Items\nEffect\nSpecial Gift for Lisbeth\nA gift for Lisbeth, to maybe get along better.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nEvent Period\nMay 13, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 - May 20, 2022 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 201\nUse to obtain the \"Dash!\" stamp.\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Lisbeth\n1\n300\nRecord Kit M\n25\n400\nSmall Gift\n1\n500\nTasty Bread\n5\n600\nSpecial Gift for Lisbeth\n1\n700\nFresh Fish\n5\n800\nSmall Gift\n1\n900\nEnergy Fruit\n5\n1,000\nSpecial Gift for Lisbeth\n1\n1,100\nAsuna's Handmade Seasoning\n5\n1,200\nSmall Gift\n1\n1,300\nBeautiful Flower\n5\n1,400\nGlittering Blue Butterfly\n5\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nCompleted within Target Time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n1\nImportant\nThe Assisting Character Lisbeth will be unlocked when you complete the 4F main quest.\nThe \"Special Gift for Lisbeth\" does not expire.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nIt is possible to take characters other than \"Lisbeth\" as Assisting Characters into the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2022-05-12T19:00:00+00:00",
