    "full_details": "Notices\nGet Chaos Boss avatars! Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 20 Open for Challengers!\nEVENT\n2022-04-27 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"Last Number Chaos\" has arrived in the high-difficulty Chaos Boss Dungeon!\nThe \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 20\" is open.\nReward\nProduction materials which may drop from the boss can be used to produce\nChaos Boss avatars\n.\nYou can also receive production materials from rewards.\nAvatar Images\nChaos Boss Dungeon/Black Last Number Recommended Total Power\nDifficulty\nTotal Power\nInterior\n100,000 × 6\nDepth\n120,000 × 6\nTotal Power is a number that gives an approximation of the player's overall strength.\nIt changes based on factors like equipment, Skill Records, and weapon proficiency level.\n* Each dungeon has a different total power recommendation.\nCheck it by going to Menu > Status > Player.\nWhen your Total Power is near the recommended amount, challenge the boss with a party!\nHow to Participate\nAccept the Chaos Boss Dungeon from the NPCs \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Interior\" and \"Chaos Boss Dungeon Depth\" in the Blackiron Palace.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nDungeon Duration\nThis dungeon can be challenged after the maintenance on April 27, 2022.\nChaos Boss Dungeon/Black Last Number (\nVS Last Number Chaos\n)\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n5,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n10,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n15,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n20,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n25,000\nBlack Last Number Stones from Abyss\n1\n30,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n35,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n40,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n45,000\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\n50,000\nBlack Last Number Stones from Abyss\n1\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nCompleted without any tumble\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\nDefeat boss\nBlack Last Number Mask\n1\nCompleted within 10 minutes\nBlack Last Number Stones from Abyss\n1\nImportant\nEach dungeon difficulty can be accepted from a different NPC.\nOnce you clear the dungeon, you can't challenge it again until the system resets at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9).\nThe rewards for both Interior and Depth difficulties are the same.\nThe Challenge Rewards can only be earned once.\nGo to Notice List"
