    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 Dagger Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-04-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none Dagger★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Daggers\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Integral Existence] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDark Edge\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +30% against poisoned enemies./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Musician Idol] Yuna\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nMusical Slice\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n900% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Find Weakness 4/Debuff] Finds the enemy's weakeness for 15 sec at a specific rate.　The critical rate +20% to enemy that has their weakness found./[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Will Bleed (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Free Captain] Yuuki\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nViking Fang Burst\nSkill Name\nViking Fang\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→Slash\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n950% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Will Bleed (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Additional damage according to number of HITs.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1900% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's poison resistance 50% for 60 sec (easier to inflict Poison) and poison damage +100%./[Bleed Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's bleed resistance 50% for 60 sec (easier to inflict Bleed) and bleed damage +100%./[Bonus] When an enemy with Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite) was hit, increase status ailment stacks by 10 on enemies./[Bonus] Additional damage according to number of HITs.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 23, 2022 17:00 - April 30, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 Dagger Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
