    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Chronicler of Legends Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2022-04-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDressed as bards, Kirito, Yuuki, Sinon, and Koharu are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nChronicler of Legends Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Tune that Transcends Time] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nThrust of Rain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 500 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Restore 2000 HP when hitting with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Brave Song] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Wind Boost/Black Panther\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Wind Boost 4] Elemental damage other than wind dealt to enemies -50%, and wind element's damage to enemies +40%./[Black Panther 4] When equipping 1 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Survival Song] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nRock Projection\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Transforming Switch 4/Buff] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch, your own Evasion rate increases for 20 sec. (Stack 5)+0.3% per 1 Stack. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tune of the Journey] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Ray\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1260% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Evasion 3/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)/[Death Mark/Debuff] Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts April 22, 2022 (Fri) 17:00 and ends before the May 11, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
