    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Eugeo Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2022-04-10 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Eugeo's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Eugeo's birthday on April 10.\nLet's celebrate Eugeo's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until April 10, 2022 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
