    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 1H Rapier Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 1H Rapier Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-04-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 1H Rapier Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none 1H Rapier★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"1H Rapiers\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Glimmering Flash] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Nova\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1150% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against enemies with Frostbite increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[One and Only Flash] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Hit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n880% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Precise Attack 4/Buff] Critical rate +25% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Light of Love] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nVortex Torrent Burst\nSkill Name\nVortex Torrent\nSP Cost\n20\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nThrust→Thrust→\nWind\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n820% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Recovers 2.5% of your own Max HP when this skill hits./[Bonus] Attack +20% to enemies when using break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1640% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Recovers 30% of your own Max HP when this skill hits./[Bonus] Attack +40% to enemies when using break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the April 9, 2022 17:00 - April 16, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 1H Rapier Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
