    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Alice's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Alice\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-04-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Alice's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Rulid's Protector] Alice\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Knight's Pride] Alice\n\" are now available!\n\"\nAlice's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Alice Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Alice is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Alice and are at an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Rulid's Protector] Alice\nSkill Name\nAqua Boost/Icy Shield\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Icy Shield 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch. Your defense increases for 40 sec. (STACK 10)+0.3% per 1 STACK. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Knight's Pride] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Spike\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 1./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nApril 9, 2022 (Sat) 0:00 - April 18, 2022 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Alice!　One ★4 Alice guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
