    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Alice Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2022-04-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIt's Alice's birthday today!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Alice's birthday on April 9.\nLet's celebrate Alice's birthday together!\n- Time Limit\nAvailable until April 9, 2022 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\n* The schedule and content may change without prior notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
