    "snippet": "SWORD ART ONLINE 프로그레시브 영화 '별 없는 밤의 아리아' 개봉을 기념한 '별 없는 밤의 아리아 오더'가 새로운 라인업으로 돌아왔습니다! 별없는 밤의 아리아 복귀 명령서 5단계에서 별없는 밤의 아리아 명령서 파트 1~3 구아에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개를 획득합니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Aria of a Starless Night Returning Order\" is here! On Step 5, get one ★4 Skill Record from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 1-3 guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-03-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Aria of a Starless Night Order, which celebrated the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie, is back with a new lineup!\nOn Step 5 of the \"\nAria of a Starless Night Returning Order\n\", get one ★4 Skill Record from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 1-3 guaranteed!\nThe ★4 Skill Records from the Aria of a Starless Night Order are featured with a higher drop rate!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 5, get one ★4 Skill Record from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 1-3 guaranteed!\n【★4 Skill Records from the Aria of a Starless Night Order Parts 1-3】\n★4[Screen Hero] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDarkness V Arc\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1260% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +25% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Will to Survive] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nGale Linear\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Flash of Gale] Mito\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Transforming Switch\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Transforming Switch 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch, your own Evasion rate increases for 20 sec. (Stack 5)+0.3% per 1 Stack. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Command Knight] Diavel\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Devil's Orders\nAttack\n36\nDefense\n68\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Devil's Orders] (Invalid when equipped by Partner) When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff that recovers your HP (3%/3 sec) for 30 sec.Also, it adds additional effects depending on Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Diavel's Skill Records: attack, critical rate, and critical damage +15% to you and your party for 15 sec.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: activates a debuff where elemental damage -80% for elements other than \"\"non-elemental\"\" to you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Final Blow] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nProminence Recoil\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Offensive Turn] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Blazer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Skill Enlightenment] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nExploding Hit\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Thrust 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +25% for 20 sec./[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Fate that Cuts] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Flame Conversion/Meeting a Friend\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 3] Attack +300./[Flame Conversion 3]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +20%./[Meeting a Friend] Recovers 80 HP every 3 sec when equipping 3 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 27, 2022 (Sun) 17:00 - April 15, 2022 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record from Parts 1-3 of the Aria of a Starless Night Order is guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n★4 Skill Records from the \"Aria of a Starless Night Order\" Parts 4 and 5 will not appear.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
