    "full_details": "Notices\n【4 Year Anniversary】\"Anniversary MOD Step-Up Order Part 2\"! Includes ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, Daggers, 1H Clubs, and Bows! Get 1 ★4 \"MOD Skill\" guaranteed on STEP5!\nShop\n2022-03-19 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary Order!\nThe \"\nAnniversary MOD Step-Up Order Part 2\n\" is here, featuring ★4 \"MOD Skill\" for 1H Swords, Daggers, 1H Clubs, and Bows!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\nOn Step 4 and Step 5, the total drop rate for ★4 MOD Skills increases to 2.0%!\nAdditionally, on Step 5, one of the ★4 MOD Skills is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some Featured ★4 MOD Skills】\n★4[Black Ogre Beater] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRock Tempest\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1220% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Dragon Show] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Flame\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Full-On Street] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nShine Disruption\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Cool Archer] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nVigor Shine\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500./[Bonus] Attack +30% to the enemies that have a buff effect.\n- Uncharged -\n890% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 19, 2022 (Sat) 12:00 - April 3, 2022 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed! 2.0% Total Drop Rate for ★4 MOD Skills\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
