    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Agil's Birthday Order\" is here! The total drop rate is boosted for new ★4 \"Agil\" on STEP3!\nShop\n2022-03-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Agil's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Skull Crush] Agil\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[A Focused Blow] Agil\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAgil's Birthday Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nThe ★4 lineup of STEP3 is limited to Agil only, and the total drop rate for the new ★4 \"Agil\" is boosted by 2.0%!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Skull Crush] Agil\nSkill Name\nShadow Indemnity/Encircle Break\nAttack\n37\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Shadow Indemnity 3] When you are cursed, dark element damage +40%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Focused Blow] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nShadow Waltz\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] +25% damage towards enemy on break./[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 9, 2022 (Wed) 0:00 - March 18, 2022 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.24% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.24% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Agil! Total drop rate of 2.0% for new ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
