    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Rescue Girls Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-03-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLeafa and Koharu are firefighters and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nRescue Girls Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Faster Than Flames] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Recoil\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Increases additional damage by your own level ×150 (max 30000)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Resounding Alarm] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShredding Water\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\n- Duration\nMarch 4, 2022 (Fri) 17:00 - March 27, 2022 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Duration\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nTotal drop rate of 0.65% for new ★4 Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
