    "snippet": "새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드가 되어 키리토, 리파, 리즈벳, 실리카가 사이버 공간으로 질주합니다! \"사이버 디멘션 오더\"가 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 1,250개의 아르카나 보석에 대한 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다! ★4 스킬 레코드 1개가 보장됩니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Cyber Dimension Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-02-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Leafa, Lisbeth, and Silica are racing into cyberspace as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCyber Dimension Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Civilta Spada] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShining Beat\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n★4[Civilta Ascia] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Lightning\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Civilta Drago] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Earth Conversion/More Deban\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Earth Conversion 4] Wind element's damage to enemies -10% and earth element's damage to enemies +25%./[More Deban 1] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Civilta Club] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nShadow Swing\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +130%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 17, 2022 (Thu) maintenance until March 8, 2022 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
