    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 1H Club Skill Record guaranteed in the ★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order!\nShop\n2022-02-12 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the ★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order where you are\nguaranteed\none 1H Club★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"1H Clubs\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Enthusiastic Club User] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Fall\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1030% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Talented Merchant] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nHoly Crush\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n980% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Thrust Attack Down 4/Debuff] Enemy thrust attack -20% for 15 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage to enemy of 10% own current HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Blessing Alight] Lisbeth\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBurn Disruption Burst\nSkill Name\nBurn Disruption\nSP Cost\n24\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nBlunt→Blunt→\nFire\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n840% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +10% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] +20% damage towards enemy on break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1680% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +10% for 30 sec./[PT Precise Attack 3/Buff] Party critical rate +20% for 30 sec./[Bonus] +40% damage towards enemy on break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 12, 2022 17:00 - February 19, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
