    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/2)\nMAINT.\n2022-02-01 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/2, 2022, 13:00, was completed on 2/2, 2022,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe Valentine Scenario Event \"Female Swordman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back!\nIf you have previously played the \"Female Swordman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Upcoming Update\n\"Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\"\nPlanned to start 2/4, 2022 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/2, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe Valentine Scenario Event \"Female Swordman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" is back!\nIf you have previously played the \"Female Swordman, Female Knight, and a Chocolate\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/2 Maintenance\n・\nHunting Event \"Warder Chief Hunt\"\n・\n\"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 5\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
