    "snippet": "\"소드 아트 온라인 인테그럴 팩터\"에 로그인하신 분들을 위한 공지입니다. 무술 상인 메달의 거래 가능 한도는 2022년 2월 1일 4:00(JST/UTC+9)에 재설정됩니다.  \"전투 예술의 메달\"을 수집하고 상인에서 다양한 아이템을 획득하세요! \"핵심금속\", \"군비석...\"을 준비했습니다.",
    "full_details": "Notices\nAvailable trade limit for Medal of Combat Arts Trader resets on 2/1, 2022!\nNOTICES\n2022-01-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe available trade limit for the Medal of Combat Arts Trader will reset on 2/1, 2022 at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nCollect \"Medals of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metals\", \"Armament Stones\", and \"Release Crystals\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup\n* The trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n50\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n47\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n44\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n10\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n5\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\nGhost Mask A\n13\n1\nGhost Mask B\n13\n1\nGhost Mask C\n13\n1\nGhost Mask D\n13\n1\nGhost Mask E\n13\n1\nGhost Costume Top and Bottom\n41\n1\n★3[Silica's Partner] Lisbeth\n29\n1\n★3[Asuna's Partner] Yuuki\n29\n1\n★3[Leafa's Partner] Sinon\n29\n1\n★3[Dashing Sword-Point] Yuuki\n29\n1\n★3[Fishing Boy] Kirito\n29\n1\n★3[Happy Companion] Asuna\n29\n1\n★3[Fishing Master] Nishida\n29\n1\nMahi-Mahi Sword\n27\n1\nHalfbeak Rapier\n27\n1\nPorcupinefish Hammer\n27\n1\nSawshark Lance\n27\n1\nTuna Axe\n27\n1\nSaury Dagger\n27\n1\nAngelfish Bow\n27\n1\n★4\t[Returning Seaman] Agil\n47\n1\nBridal Tuxedo\n35\n1\nBridal Dress\n35\n1\nBridal Pin\n1\n1\nBridal Tiara\n4\n1\nBridal Bracelet\n1\n1\nBridal Necklace\n1\n1\nCalming Swimsuit Top\n26\n1\nPassion Bikini Top\n26\n1\nCalming Swimsuit Bottoms\n15\n1\nPassion Wrap Skirt Bottoms\n15\n1\nPassion Bikini Bottoms\n15\n1\nCalming Straw Hat\n7\n1\nPassion Elegant Hat\n7\n1\nCalming Sunglass\n3\n1\nPassion Sunglass\n3\n1\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\n26\n1\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n26\n1\nAvatar Images\nImportant\n‧There are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\n‧The next lineup update is planned for 4/1, 2022 (Fri) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n‧Depending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\n‧The schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
