    "full_details": "Notices\nIssue with All Out Battle \"The Skull Reaper\"\nNOTICES\n2021-12-14 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThere was an issue with the All Out Battle \"The Skull Reaper\" where EXP and Col could not be gained and no items were dropping when defeating the boss under certain conditions. This issue was fixed during our maintenance on 12/8 (Weds).\nThe following items will be compensated to users who had these issues up until our scheduled maintenance on 12/8 (Weds) during our 12/15 maintenance.\n▽Compensation\n2500 Arcana Gems\nIncense to Increase Exp S x2 xNumber of occurrences\nIncense to Increase Luck S x2 xNumber of occurrences\nIncense to Increase Weapon EXP S x2 xNumber of occurrences\nSaleable Col Bag x1 xNumber of occurrences\nExp Crystal M x1 xNumber of occurrences\nWe apologize for any inconvenience caused at this time.\nGo to Notice List"
