    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/2048.html",
    "news_date": 1638950400,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "길드 층 보스 사냥 이벤트 '층 보스 VS 마녀'가 개최됩니다. 길드원들과 함께 플로어 보스와 싸워보세요! 이번에는 8층 플로어 보스 '마녀부러움'이 최대 30명의 길드원이 도전할 수 있는 던전 레이드 보스로 등장합니다. 두 힘을 합쳐 보스를 물리치세요...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nA Hunting Event for up to 30 guild members! The Guild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Witch\" is here!\nEVENT\n2021-12-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Guild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Witch\" is here. Fight the floor boss alongside your guild members!\nThis time, the 8F Floor Boss, \"\nEnvy the Witch\n\", appears as a dungeon Raid Boss who can be challenged by up to 30 guild members.\nTake on the boss using the combined strength of your guild members!\nRewards\nReceive \"8F Floor Boss Battle Badge\" by completing \"Entry\", \"Depth\", or \"Special\" difficulty.\nGather 40 of these to get the Limited Record \"8F Strategy Guild\" as an achievement reward.\nReceive \"Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badge\" by completing Extreme difficulty.\nGather 40 of these to get the Limited Record\n\"Excellent Gang\"\nas an achievement reward.\nYou can get items like Medals of Unity, Awakening Star awakening materials, all kinds of Great Jewels, and Memoria Niter S from this event.\nEvery player will receive their own score and challenge rewards if they clear it.\nThere's a chance that Star Fragments will drop at \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulties.\nRecord Background\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\n8F Strategy Guild\nLet's collect a total of 40 8F Floor Boss Battle Badges\nRevive Crystal×1\nExcellent Gang\nLet's collect a total of 40 Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badges\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raid Boss Dungeon\" NPC in the \"Guild Room\" to challenge the dungeon.\nTalk to the \"Guild Room Guide\" NPC in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to go to your \"Guild Room\".\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 8, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 6, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\n‧Must be a member of a guild.\n‧Complete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nGuilds\nGuilds can be created and joined through the \"Guild Counter\" NPC.\nYou can gain the benefits of Guild Skills that will help in your journeys, such as increased item drop rates and increased Weapon Proficiency acquisition by joining a guild and increasing its Guild Level.\nThe Guild Raid buff acquirable from Guild Level 16 is useful for challenging Raid Boss Dungeons.\nPlayers who do not belong to a guild should use this opportunity to join one!\nPlease see below for more details on guilds.\nCreating a Guild\nGuild Skills\nBoss Monster\nEnvy the Witch\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict Poison, Frostbite, Burn, Bleed, and Stun; or debuffs that decrease attack, decrease defense, or make you unable to use items.\nIts attack can remove your buffs.\nOnce its HP goes below a certain amount, it will summon \"Envy the Witch Shadow\" and \"Shadow Attendant\".\nWhen that occurs, it will also remove any debuffs or status ailments it has.\nWhen its HP goes below a certain amount, it will gain an attack buff and a stack buff that reduces the damage it takes from the player.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nHoly Element\nSpecial items that can be received from Score Rewards\nEntry\nDepth\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n2400\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n12480\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n2550\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n13260\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n2700\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n14040\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n2850\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n14820\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n3000\nAwakening Star\n5\n15600\nAwakening Star\n5\n3450\nMedal of Unity\n2\n17940\nMedal of Unity\n3\n3750\nAwakening Star\n5\n19500\nAwakening Star\n5\nSpecial\nExtreme\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n6450\nGreat Red Jewel\n1\n5900\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n7740\nGreat Green Jewel\n1\n7080\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n9030\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n1\n8260\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n10320\nGreat Blue Jewel\n1\n9440\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n11610\nAwakening Star\n5\n10620\nAwakening Star\n5\n20640\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n24780\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n23220\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n25960\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n25800\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n28320\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n27090\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n31860\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n28380\nAwakening Star\n5\n35400\nAwakening Star\n5\n38700\nMedal of Unity\n5\n38940\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n42570\nAwakening Star\n5\n54280\nAwakening Star\n5\n46440\nMemoria Niter S\n1\n59000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n54180\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n88500\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n64500\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n106200\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n123900\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n177000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nー\nー\nー\n236000\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nChallenge Rewards\n·Entry\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n8F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame M\n10\nCompleted within 2 minutes\nGlare Rigid Stone\n5\n·Depth\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n8F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRestorative Potion\n5\nCompleted within 5 minutes\nRevive Crystal\n1\n·Special\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\n8F Floor Boss Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n5\nCompleted within 7 minutes\nCleansing Potion\n10\n·Extreme\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nFloor Boss Extreme Battle Badge\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nLife Potion\n10\nCompleted within 12 minutes\nRelease Crystal (M)\n5\nImportant\n‧Please check all Score Rewards in the game.\n‧Raid Boss Tickets are not required to challenge the Raid Boss.\n‧If any guild member is already attempting a Floor Boss Battle, that dungeon must be cleared or finished before another Floor Boss Battle can be attempted.\n‧The boss \"Envy the Witch\" is different from the one that appears in the Main Quest.\n‧8F Floor Boss Battle Badges and Floor Boss Extreme Battle Badges will be deleted on January 13, 2022 (Thu) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n·The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\n20th \"Guild of Guilds\" Announcement\nThe \"Guild of Guilds\" Event where you can fight alongside your guild members is planned to start on January 6, 2022 (Thu) (JST/UTC+9).\nThe appearing boss \"Terror Gaze\" will be weak to the natural element \"Wind Element\" \"Earth Element\" and the weapon element \"Blunt Element\".\nIn addition, the \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event is scheduled to begin on January 13, 2022 (Thu) (JST/UTC+9). It will be a High Score Ranking, where guilds compete for ranks based on their high scores.\nGo to Notice List",
