    "news_date": 1637262000,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "SWORD ART ONLINE 프로그레시브: 별 없는 밤의 아리아 영화 개봉을 축하하세요! 솔로 이벤트 '미토와 함께 즐거운 던전'이 시작됩니다! 영화에 등장하는 미토와 코하루와 함께 던전에 도전해보세요!  보상 이벤트 기간 동안 매일 던전을 클리어하면 '아르카나 보석'을 최대 500개 획득할 수 있습니다. ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Happy Dungeon with Mito Too\" is here! Get Arcana Gems daily!\nEVENT\n2021-11-19 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie!\nThe solo event \"Happy Dungeon with Mito Too\" is here! Attempt the dungeon with\nMito\n, who appears in the movie, and Koharu!\nRewards\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to get up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nThe I. Glutton Metal Scraps available in the Aria of a Starless Night IF event can also be obtained once daily from the challenge rewards in this event!\nYou can use I. Glutton Metal Scraps to produce\nI. Glutton Ingots\n.\nIngots\nItem effect\nI. Glutton Ingot\nPositive Effect:Fire skill weakness damage +10% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than fire\n* An 《Ingot》's positive effect is registered when \"Composition\" reaches the max level.\n* Since the \"increased Fire skill weakness damage\" effect of the \"I. Glutton Ingot\" is not stackable, it will not stack with \"Demon God Flame Ingot\", which has the same effect.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Happy Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nNovember 19, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 - November 26, 2021 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMonster\nCrabby Mimic/Hard Mimic\nDetails(All ｍimic are common)\nWatch out for its scratches and bites.\nWeakness(All ｍimic are common)\nBlunt Element\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gems\n50\n200\nArcana Gems\n50\n300\nArcana Gems\n50\n400\nArcana Gems\n100\n500\nArcana Gems\n50\n600\nArcana Gems\n50\n700\nArcana Gems\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nI. Glutton Metal Scrap\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gems\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gems\n50\nImportant\n‧Cleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2021-11-18T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2021-11-25T18:59:00+00:00"
