    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 2\" is here! One of the new Skill Records is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-10-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrate the release of the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie! Kirito, Asuna, Mito, and Diavel are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nAria of a Starless Night Order Part 2\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Final Blow] Kirito\nweapon type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nProminence Recoil\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Offensive Turn] Asuna\nweapon type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nDark Blazer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1290% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Flash of Gale] Mito\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Transforming Switch\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Transforming Switch 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch, your own Evasion rate increases for 20 sec. (Stack 5)+0.3% per 1 Stack. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Command Knight] Diavel\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Devil's Orders\nAttack\n36\nDefense\n68\nHP\n2500\nSkill effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Devil's Orders] (Invalid when equipped by Partner) When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff that recovers your HP (3%/3 sec) for 30 sec.Also, it adds additional effects depending on Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Diavel's Skill Records: attack, critical rate, and critical damage +15% to you and your party for 15 sec./\nWhen equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: activates a debuff where elemental damage -80% for elements other than \"non-elemental\" to you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 30, 2021 (Sat) 17:00 - December 6, 2021 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
