    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/27)\nMAINT.\n2021-10-26 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n[10/27 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/27, 2021, 13:00, was completed on 10/27, 2021,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\n▼Maintenance content\n・Added Tons of EXP Event \"Halloween Assault [Returning]\" Event rewards\n・\"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\" is back\n・Hunting Event \"Elder Mush Hunt\" ends\n・The Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for fall.\n・Changed the \"Hide Effects\" setting in the \"Display Rush Effect\" menu to support the light pillar effect.\n・Fixed an issue with the weapon enhancement results where the enhanced attack values were not displayed when the attack reached four digits.\n・Made adjustments to an issue where Kagachi the Samurai Lord seemed to warp when using a charging attack.\n・Other small adjustments and fixations\n▼Upcoming Update\n・\"Collect Materials with Sanya\"\nPlanned to start 10/28, 2021 (Thu) 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n・\"Theatrical Release Celebration Login Bonus\"\nPlanned to start 10/30, 2021 (Sat) 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n-New Events\nAdded Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/27, 2021 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・Added Tons of EXP Event \"Halloween Assault [Returning]\" Event rewards\n・\"Avatar Order\" is back\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/27 Maintenance\n・\nHunting Event \"Elder Mush Hunt\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
