    "snippet": "마녀 앨리스, 리파, 유이가 빗자루를 타고 하늘을 나는 동료 마녀 산야와 함께 등장, 모두 신규 스킬 기록 ★4! \"클래식 마녀 주문\"이 여기에 있습니다! 3단계에서 ★4 스킬 레코드 1개 보장! 새로운 ★4 스킬 레코드의 확률이 높아졌습니다!  1단계에서는 11개의 주문을 받을 수 있습니다...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Classic Witch Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2021-10-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWitches Alice, Leafa, and Yui are here with fellow witch Sanya, who's flying through the sky on a broom, and all of them are new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nClassic Witch Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Brimming With Wisdom] Leafa\nweapon type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Flying Mage] Sanya\nweapon type\nBow\nSkill Name\nSpark Rain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill effect\n1300% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus Attack 4/Buff] Additional damage according to own Attack for 10 sec./[Fire Element Weak 4/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Evolving Intelligence] Alice\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Auto Analysis\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2425\nSkill effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Auto Analysis 4] Slight chance to add a debuff (Analyze) that raises critical damage to enemies by 20% for 15 sec, when hitting with switch. (Invalid when equipped by partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Little Witch] Yui\nweapon type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Bouncer\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill effect\n1400% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/\n▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] Restore 2000 HP when hitting with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the October 20, 2021 (Wed) maintenance - November 13, 2021 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·All Steps are 11 Orders.\n·The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n·After Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
