    "full_details": "Notices\nGet tons of EXP and healing items in \"Get loads of EXPs! Klein's Training Regimen\"!\nEVENT\n2021-10-15 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nProgress through the Main Quests and you'll have the chance to clear up to four dungeons in one day of \"Get loads of EXPs! Klein's Training Regimen\".\nIn these dungeons, you can receive tons of EXP and healing items as rewards.\nRewards\nEarn \"Healing Potions\" from score rewards and\nitems like \"Martial Arts Texts\", \"Revive Crystals\", and \"Release Crystals (S)\" from challenge rewards by clearing the dungeons daily.\nYou can get EXP from monsters appearing in dungeons, and \"Exp Crystal M\" is available as a Challenge Reward for difficulty levels \"L\" and \"XL\".\n* The dungeon will update every day at  4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDifficulty\nEXP amount\nKlein's Training Regimen : S\n20,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : M\n30,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : L\n50,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL\n100,000\nUse Boost Mode to greatly increase the amount of EXP gained!\nSee here for more details on Boost Mode.\nNormal\nDifficulty\nDaily EXP Earned\nEXP Earned (7 Days)\nLv Reached When Starting from Lv 1\nS\n20,000\n140,000\nLv1→Lv48\nM\n30,000\n210,000\nLv1→Lv54\nL\n150,000\n1,050,000\nLv1→Lv69\nXL\n600,000\n4,200,000\nLv1→Lv77\n* Includes \"Exp Crystal M\"\nUsing Boost Mode\nDifficulty\nDaily EXP Earned\nEXP Earned (7 Days)\nLv Reached When Starting from Lv 1\nS\n80,000\n560,000\nLv1→Lv64\nM\n120,000\n840,000\nLv1→Lv67\nL\n300,000\n2,100,000\nLv1→Lv73\nXL\n900,000\n6,300,000\nLv1→Lv80\n* Includes \"Exp Crystal M\"\nEvent Period\nOctober 15, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 - October 22, 2021 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"klein\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nParticipation Requirements\nKlein's Training Regimen : S  - Unlocked after clearing 1F Main Quest \"The Indomitable Fang\"\nKlein's Training Regimen : M  - Unlocked after clearing the 4F Main Quest.\nKlein's Training Regimen : L  - Unlocked after clearing the 7F Main Quest.\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL - Unlocked after clearing the 20F Main Quest.\nChallenge Rewards\nKlein's Training Regimen : S\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : M\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCleansing Potion\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : L\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nExp Crystal M\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nExp Crystal M\n5\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRelease Crystal (S)\n2\nImportant\n‧Check in-game for more information on score rewards.\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
