    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(10/6)\nMAINT.\n2021-10-05 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n[10/6 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nMaintenance we have implemented from 10/6, 2021, 14:00, was completed on 10/6, 2021,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\n▼Maintenance content\n・18th \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event begins\n・Hunting Event \"Elder Mush Hunt\" begins\n・Added Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" Event rewards\n・\"Chaos Showdown\"UPDATE\n・\"68F Start Dash Event\" ends\n・The limited-time-only emotes Cheer are no longer available.\n・Fixed some of the cliff edges in the 48F field\n・Other small adjustments and fixations\n▼Upcoming Update\n・\"Build Up Skills with Sinon\"\nPlanned to start 10/8, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n-New Events\n-Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n10/6, 2021 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・18th \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event begins\n・Hunting Event \"Elder Mush Hunt\" begins\n・Added Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" Event rewards\n・\"Chaos Showdown\"UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 10/6 Maintenance\n・\n\"68F Start Dash Event\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
