    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Tokyo Game Show 2021\" Live Stream Celebration Campaign!\nCampaign\n2021-10-02 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThis is an announcement to all those who are logged into Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nOn October 3, 2021 (Sun) at 17:30 (JST/UTC+9), there will be a live stream about the original story, anime, and game of \"Sword Art Online\" at Tokyo Game Show 2021!\nTo celebrate this live stream, we'll be holding a campaign!\n■A Giant Mr. Kirito Appears\nThe giant Mr. Kirito will appear somewhere within the game!\nAnd he's ○x bigger than the original!\n▽Period of Appearance\nOctober 2, 2021 (Sat) 12:00 - October 9, 2021 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n■Mr. Kirito Mask Accessory Present\nWe've sent out the Mr. Kirito mask accessory, \"Lucky Magical Mask (Left)\"!\nSo put on your \"Lucky Magical Mask (Left)\" and go take a commemorative picture with giant Mr. Kirito!\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nLucky Magical Mask (Left)\nAccessory Avatar\n▽Distribution Period\nOctober 2, 2021 (Sat) 12:00 - October 9, 2021 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n■About the Live Stream\nTime and date：\nOctober 3, 2021 (Sun) at 17:30 (JST/UTC+9) (scheduled)\nLive Stream URL：\n◆YouTube Live\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3mu-vEeB29s\n*Tapping the URL will either open your external browser or the YouTube application.\nGo to Notice List"
