    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/29)\nMAINT.\n2021-09-28 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n[9/29 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/29, 2021, 13:00, was completed on 9/29, 2021,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\n▼Maintenance content\n・18th Guild of Guilds \"VS Masquerade Demon\" begins\n・\"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica\" begins\n・Added Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" Event rewards\n・\"Search for the Phantom Mushroom ['20 Returning]\" ends\n・Guild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Taurus King\" ends\n・The Cheer emote is returning for a limited time for the TOKYO GAME SHOW 2021\nCheer\nPeriod: Starts after the September 29, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 6, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n・Other small adjustments and fixations\n-New Events\n-Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/29, 2021 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・18th Guild of Guilds \"VS Masquerade Demon\" begins\n・\"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Kirito, Asuna, and Silica\" begins\n・Added Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" Event rewards\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/29 Maintenance\n・\n\"Search for the Phantom Mushroom ['20 Returning]\"\n・\nGuild Floor Boss Hunting Event \"Floor Boss Battle VS Taurus King\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
