    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/22)\nMAINT.\n2021-09-21 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n[9/22 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/22, 2021, 13:00, was completed on 9/22, 2021,17:00(JST/UTC+9).\n▼Maintenance content\n・Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" begins\n・\"Chaos Showdown\"UPDATE\n・\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n・\"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 1\" begins\n・Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great Proficiency Items Event \"Boss Rush  VS Fallen Elven\" ends\n・\"Shooting Star of the Sea Order\" ends\n・Adjusted how the display setting \"Show Attack Range\" behaves when turned off. It now also applies to area-based attack range displays.\n・Changes made to 2 icons displayed on the mini map\nIcons changed\nBefore changes\nAfter changes\nQuest target\nTarget for breaking through the barricade\n* The barricade is an object that blocks the path in the Labyrinth.\n・Other small adjustments and fixations\n▼Upcoming Update\n・Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! \"Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki\"\nPlanned to start 9/24, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 (JST/UTC +9)\n-New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/22, 2021 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・Worldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great EXP Event \"Meiolania Assault [Chocolate Flavor]\" begins\n・\"Chaos Showdown\"UPDATE\n・\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/22 Maintenance\n・\nWorldwide 3.5 Year Anniversary! Great Proficiency Items Event \"Boss Rush  VS Fallen Elven\"\n・\n\"Shooting Star of the Sea Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
